ed-6","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-embed#路径前缀","content":"路径前缀","locale":"zh-CN"},"9":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-7","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-embed#挂载到已有的-fastapi-应用","content":"挂载到已有的 FastAPI 应用","locale":"zh-CN"},"10":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-8","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-embed#直接调用服务","content":"直接调用服务","locale":"zh-CN"},"11":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-9","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed","content":"RVC Next 可以作为一个库，在另一个 Python 程序里启动。启动后的服务端与 `rvc-next webui` 完全相同：同样的 API、同样的网页界面、同样的任务与实时变声。宿主程序可以决定数据放在哪里、设置文件放在哪里、哪些设置不允许用户修改，以及界面挂在哪个路径下。","locale":"zh-CN"},"12":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-10","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed","content":"宿主程序必须与 RVC Next 运行在同一个 Python 环境里，这个环境要满足 RVC Next 的依赖（见 安装）。不要把它装进依赖冲突的共享环境。","locale":"zh-CN"},"13":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-11","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#最小示例","content":"`start()` 在后台线程里运行服务端，返回网页界面的地址；`run()` 则在前台运行，直到 `Ctrl+C`。对象也可以当作上下文管理器使用：","locale":"zh-CN"},"14":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-12","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#最小示例","content":"`stop()` 可以重复调用，会关闭服务端、实时变声的子进程和数据库，并释放端口。`import rvc_next` 不会加载 torch 或 FastAPI，只有用到 `RvcNextServer` 时才加载服务端。","locale":"zh-CN"},"15":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-13","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#数据目录与配置目录","content":"参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"16":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-14","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#数据目录与配置目录","content":"存放什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"17":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-15","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#数据目录与配置目录","content":"默认值","locale":"zh-CN"},"18":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-16","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#数据目录与配置目录","content":"`data_dir`","locale":"zh-CN"},"19":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-17","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#数据目录与配置目录","content":"数据库、模型、实验、结果、上传文件、缓存，以及 `server.json`","locale":"zh-CN"},"20":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-18","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#数据目录与配置目录","content":"`RVC_NEXT_DATA_DIR` 或系统默认位置","locale":"zh-CN"},"21":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-19","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#数据目录与配置目录","content":"`config_dir`","locale":"zh-CN"},"22":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-20","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#数据目录与配置目录","content":"设置文件 `settings.toml`","locale":"zh-CN"},"23":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-21","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#数据目录与配置目录","content":"与 `data_dir` 相同","locale":"zh-CN"},"24":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-22","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#数据目录与配置目录","content":"`settings_path`","locale":"zh-CN"},"25":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-23","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#数据目录与配置目录","content":"直接指定设置文件的完整路径（文件名可以自定），优先于 `config_dir`","locale":"zh-CN"},"26":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-24","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#数据目录与配置目录","content":"无","locale":"zh-CN"},"27":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-25","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#数据目录与配置目录","content":"宿主程序通常有自己的配置文件夹，可以把 RVC Next 的设置放进去，而数据仍放在数据目录：","locale":"zh-CN"},"28":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-26","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#数据目录与配置目录","content":"网页界面 **设置 › 关于** 会显示当前使用的数据目录和设置文件。命令行同样支持：`rvc-next webui --config-dir <folder>`，或设置环境变量 `RVC_NEXT_CONFIG_DIR`（让 `rvc-next config` 等命令读写同一份设置时，用环境变量最方便）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"29":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-27","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#固定设置","content":"`settings` 参数接收与 `settings.toml` 相同结构的字典。这些值叠加在设置文件和环境变量之上，**不会写回文件**，也不能通过网页界面或 API 修改，适合宿主程序统一管理的项目：","locale":"zh-CN"},"30":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-28","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#固定设置","content":"被固定的文件夹在 **设置 › 存储** 中标注 **由嵌入 rvc-next 的应用设置**。所有设置项见 配置与环境变量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"31":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-29","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#地址端口与访问令牌","content":"参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"32":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-30","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#地址端口与访问令牌","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"33":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-31","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#地址端口与访问令牌","content":"`host`","locale":"zh-CN"},"34":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-32","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#地址端口与访问令牌","content":"绑定地址，默认取设置 `server.host`（`127.0.0.1`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"35":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-33","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#地址端口与访问令牌","content":"`port`","locale":"zh-CN"},"36":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-34","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#地址端口与访问令牌","content":"`0` 由系统任选空闲端口；一个数字表示从这个端口开始尝试（被占用时往后找，最多 20 个）；`None` 使用设置 `server.port`","locale":"zh-CN"},"37":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-35","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#地址端口与访问令牌","content":"`strict_port`","locale":"zh-CN"},"38":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-36","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#地址端口与访问令牌","content":"为 `True` 时端口被占用就直接失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"39":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-37","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#地址端口与访问令牌","content":"`access_token`","locale":"zh-CN"},"40":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-38","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#地址端口与访问令牌","content":"可选的访问令牌；设置后每个 API 和 socket 请求都要携带（网页界面会要求输入一次）。绑定到非本机地址或设置 `extra_hosts` 时也不是必需的","locale":"zh-CN"},"41":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-39","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#地址端口与访问令牌","content":"`extra_hosts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"42":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-40","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#地址端口与访问令牌","content":"除绑定地址外还接受的公网主机名，如内网穿透或反向代理的地址；见下方 内网穿透与反向代理","locale":"zh-CN"},"43":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-41","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#地址端口与访问令牌","content":"`open_browser`","locale":"zh-CN"},"44":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-42","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#地址端口与访问令牌","content":"启动后是否打开浏览器，默认 `False`","locale":"zh-CN"},"45":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-43","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#地址端口与访问令牌","content":"`log_level`","locale":"zh-CN"},"46":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-44","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#地址端口与访问令牌","content":"uvicorn 的日志级别，默认 `\"warning\"`","locale":"zh-CN"},"47":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-45","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#地址端口与访问令牌","content":"`host`、`access_token` 和 `open_browser` 同样作为固定设置生效。远程访问的注意事项见 远程访问与安全。","locale":"zh-CN"},"48":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-46","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#tunnels","content":"只监听本机时，服务器只接受 `Host` 为本机名称或绑定地址的请求。内网穿透（如 Gradio 共享链接）和反向代理会转发它们自己的公网主机名，需要先允许这个名称。穿透地址往往在服务器启动、端口确定之后才知道，所以 `allow_host()` 在启动后同样可以调用，立即生效：","locale":"zh-CN"},"49":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-47","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#tunnels","content":"任何拿到公网地址的人都能访问服务器并使用全部功能；需要时传入 `access_token`，或在宿主程序、代理一侧自行加上身份验证。通过这些名称到达的请求即使来自本机的穿透程序，也不会被当作本机请求，不能使用 **在文件夹中显示**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"50":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-48","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#路径前缀","content":"`api_prefix` 把 API、socket 和网页界面整体移到一个路径下，避免与宿主程序自己的路由冲突：","locale":"zh-CN"},"51":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-49","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#路径前缀","content":"网页界面不需要重新构建：它从自身脚本的地址推算出基础路径。命令行同样支持 `rvc-next webui --api-prefix /voice`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"52":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-50","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#挂载到已有的-fastapi-应用","content":"如果宿主程序本身就是 FastAPI（或其他 ASGI）应用，也可以不另开端口，直接挂载：","locale":"zh-CN"},"53":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-51","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#挂载到已有的-fastapi-应用","content":"宿主程序要在自己的事件循环里进入子应用的 `lifespan`（它启动 socket 事件转发），并在退出时调用 `services.close()`。`start_background=True` 启动任务调度和空闲卸载；不传时排队的任务不会运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"54":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-52","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#直接调用服务","content":"`server.services` 是服务端使用的同一组服务对象，宿主程序可以不经 HTTP 直接调用，例如列出音色、提交转换任务或修改设置：","locale":"zh-CN"},"55":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-53","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#直接调用服务","content":"这些方法与 API 一一对应，返回的模型与 API 的 JSON 结构相同，详见 核心服务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"56":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","type":"page","content":"常见问题","breadcrumbs":["RVC Next 文档","进阶"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-faq","locale":"zh-CN"},"57":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-0","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq","content":"按主题整理的常见问题。点开问题查看解答。遇到问题时，先运行 rvc-next doctor：它会检查 torch 和 CUDA、音频设备和资源，并给出修复命令。","locale":"zh-CN"},"58":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-1","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-faq#安装与启动","content":"安装与启动","locale":"zh-CN"},"59":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-2","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-faq#资源与模型下载","content":"资源与模型下载","locale":"zh-CN"},"60":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-3","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-faq#转换","content":"转换","locale":"zh-CN"},"61":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-4","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-faq#实时变声","content":"实时变声","locale":"zh-CN"},"62":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-5","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-faq#显存与性能","content":"显存与性能","locale":"zh-CN"},"63":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-6","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-faq#文件与远程访问","content":"文件与远程访问","locale":"zh-CN"},"64":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-7","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#安装与启动","content":"默认端口是 7868。被占用时服务器会自动尝试 7869、7870……（最多 20 个），日志中提示 \"Port 7868 is unavailable. Using port 7869.\"，浏览器会打开实际使用的端口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"65":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-8","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#安装与启动","content":"想固定用某个端口：","locale":"zh-CN"},"66":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-9","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#安装与启动","content":"加 `--strict-port`（或设置 `server.strict_port` 为 `true`）后，端口被占用时直接失败（退出码 3），不会换端口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"67":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-10","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#安装与启动","content":"默认在数据目录：Windows 为 `%APPDATA%\\rvc-next`，macOS 为 `~/Library/Application Support/rvc-next`，Linux 为 `~/.local/share/rvc-next`（或 `$XDG_DATA_HOME/rvc-next`）。`rvc-next config show` 的 `data_dir` 或 Web UI **设置** › **关于** 的 **数据文件夹** 显示当前位置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"68":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-11","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#安装与启动","content":"用环境变量 `RVC_NEXT_DATA_DIR` 或 `rvc-next webui --data-dir <路径>` 换到其他位置；只想移动某一类文件，改 **设置** › **存储** 中的 **音色**、**实验**、**结果**、**资源** 文件夹。目录结构见 配置与环境变量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"69":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-12","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#安装与启动","content":"先停止服务器，再删除或改名数据目录中的 `settings.toml`（`rvc-next config path` 打印它的路径）。下次启动时使用全部默认值；音色库、实验和结果不受影响。","locale":"zh-CN"},"70":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-13","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#安装与启动","content":"只想恢复某一项，用 `rvc-next config set <键> <默认值>` 写回，默认值见 配置与环境变量。注意 `RVC_NEXT_<GROUP>__<FIELD>` 环境变量设置的值始终优先。","locale":"zh-CN"},"71":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-14","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#安装与启动","content":"服务器会在约 1 秒内读到 `settings.toml` 的改动，Web UI 也会刷新。如果仍然没有变化：先看服务器日志里有没有 “Ignored a change to … settings.toml” 的警告（文件写错了）；再确认这个设置是否没有被同名环境变量覆盖（`rvc-next config show` 会标出）；端口、监听地址等少数设置需要重启服务器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"72":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-15","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#安装与启动","content":"可以。命令行在自己的进程里运行任务，任务记录写入同一个数据库，所以 Web UI 的 **任务** 面板和 `rvc-next jobs list` 都能看到双方的任务。需要注意两点：命令行任务不参与服务器的 GPU 排队，同时运行会争用显存；修改设置请参考上一个问题。","locale":"zh-CN"},"73":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-16","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#资源与模型下载","content":"转换至少需要 HuBERT，音高算法为 RMVPE 时还需要 RMVPE。界面上缺少资源时会显示 **需要 …** 和 **下载（大小）** 按钮，点击即可下载；也可以在 **模型** › **资源** 中下载。命令行出错时会提示具体命令（退出码 7），例如：","locale":"zh-CN"},"74":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-17","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#资源与模型下载","content":"如果你有原版 RVC，可以把 `paths.assets_dir` 指向它的 `assets` 文件夹，免去下载，见 从原版 RVC 迁移。","locale":"zh-CN"},"75":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-18","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#资源与模型下载","content":"FCPE 的模型（`fcpe`，约 41 MB）是一项资源，包含在默认下载的 `inference` 分组里：不带参数的 `rvc-next assets download` 会一并下载它。只缺它时，选择 FCPE 后界面会提示下载；命令行也可以单独运行 `rvc-next assets download fcpe`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"76":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-19","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#资源与模型下载","content":"切换到 hf-mirror 镜像端点：","locale":"zh-CN"},"77":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-20","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#资源与模型下载","content":"**设置** › **下载** › **下载端点** 选择 **hf-mirror.com**。也可以选 **自定义**，在 **自定义地址** 中填写其他镜像。","locale":"zh-CN"},"78":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-21","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#资源与模型下载","content":"下载支持断点续传：中断后再次下载会从 `.part` 文件继续，失败时自动重试。**模型仓库** 可以在 `rvc-model`（默认，含示例音色）和官方仓库之间切换，两者的模型文件相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"79":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-22","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#资源与模型下载","content":"文件的 SHA-256 与目录中的不一致，通常是下载不完整或文件被替换。在 **模型** › **资源** 中重新下载该资源，或运行 `rvc-next assets download <id>`。`rvc-next assets verify` 可以重新校验所有已安装的资源。","locale":"zh-CN"},"80":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-23","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#转换","content":"先确认是否真的在用 GPU：`rvc-next doctor` 的 \"Selected\" 一行显示选中的设备。显示 CPU 的常见原因：","locale":"zh-CN"},"81":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-24","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#转换","content":"安装的是 CPU 版 PyTorch，需要换成 CUDA 版（见 安装）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"82":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-25","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#转换","content":"显卡不满足 GPU 规则（显存不足 4 GiB 或计算能力太低），见 硬件与性能；","locale":"zh-CN"},"83":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-26","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#转换","content":"`compute.device` 被设成了 `cpu`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"84":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-27","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#转换","content":"确实只能用 CPU 时：音高算法改用 **pm（快速）**；先用 **预览 15 秒** 调好参数再转换整首；人声分离在 CPU 上尤其慢，能不分离就不分离。","locale":"zh-CN"},"85":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-28","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#转换","content":"没有索引时 **索引强度** 不起作用（界面会提示），转换仍然可以进行，只是音色特征全部来自模型本身。附加索引的方法：","locale":"zh-CN"},"86":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-29","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#转换","content":"在音色页面点 **附加索引**，上传或选择服务器上的 `.index` 文件（文件名不限，但版本必须与音色相符：v1 音色用 256 维索引，v2 用 768 维）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"87":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-30","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#转换","content":"有训练实验时点 **从实验构建**；","locale":"zh-CN"},"88":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-31","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#转换","content":"命令行：`rvc-next model index attach <音色> <文件>`，或 `rvc-next model index build <音色> --experiment <实验>`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"89":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-32","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#转换","content":"`trained_*.index` 不含特征向量，不能使用，请用 `added_*.index`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"90":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-33","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#转换","content":"`.pth` 中带有说话人信息的音色是多说话人音色，音色卡片上显示 **N 个说话人**，参数面板里会出现 **说话人** 选项。命令行用 `--speaker <id>`，`rvc-next model info <音色> --speakers` 列出说话人。可以给说话人起名字：`rvc-next model edit <音色> --speaker-name 0=Alice`。多说话人音色也可以为每个说话人附加自己的索引（`--speaker`）。实时变声同样使用所选的说话人。","locale":"zh-CN"},"91":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-34","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#转换","content":"默认在数据目录的 `outputs/<日期>/<任务 id>/`，文件名为 `<原文件名>.<音色>.<格式>`，同名时不会覆盖。在 Web UI 的 **结果** 列表中可以播放、下载（**全部下载** 打包为 zip），或点 **在文件夹中显示**（仅限服务器本机的浏览器）。命令行用 `-o` 指定输出文件夹，结束时打印每个结果的路径。","locale":"zh-CN"},"92":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-35","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#转换","content":"想换默认位置，修改 **设置** › **存储** 的 **结果** 文件夹；**结果保留天数（0：一直保留）** 大于 0 时，服务器启动时会删除过期的结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"93":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-36","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#转换","content":"导入的索引无法确定属于哪个音色（例如同一次导入里有多个同版本的音色，名称又对不上），Web UI 会打开 **检查导入**，每个索引只列出版本兼容的音色供你选择，也可以选 **暂不分配**，之后在 **模型** › **音色** 的 **未分配的索引** 中再分配。命令行会打印导入计划并以退出码 3 结束，用 `--pair 音色.pth=索引.index` 或 `--keep-unassigned` 重新运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"94":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-37","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#实时变声","content":"实时变声通过 PortAudio 访问声卡。Linux 上需要安装系统的 PortAudio 库：","locale":"zh-CN"},"95":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-38","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#实时变声","content":"然后运行 `rvc-next doctor` 查看 \"Audio devices\" 一行，或 `rvc-next live devices` 列出设备。页面显示 **此服务器暂不支持实时转换。** 表示服务器的 Python 环境里没有安装 `sounddevice`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"96":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-39","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#实时变声","content":"另外请记住：列出的是**服务器所在电脑**的设备。从另一台电脑或手机打开 Web UI 时，看不到也用不了那台设备的麦克风，见 远程访问与安全。","locale":"zh-CN"},"97":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-40","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#实时变声","content":"推理跟不上块长时就会断音。看实时页面的 **负载**：超过 80% 时会出现 **将块长增加到 … 毫秒**，点它即可。也可以手动增大 **块长**，或：","locale":"zh-CN"},"98":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-41","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#实时变声","content":"减小 **上下文**，关闭 **输入降噪**、**输出降噪**；","locale":"zh-CN"},"99":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-42","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#实时变声","content":"音高算法改用 pm；","locale":"zh-CN"},"100":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-43","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#实时变声","content":"停止同时运行的转换或训练任务（它们会和实时变声争用 GPU）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"101":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-44","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#实时变声","content":"确认实际在用 GPU（CPU 上通常需要很长的块长）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"102":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-45","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#实时变声","content":"**欠载**、**溢出** 计数持续增加也说明需要更大的块长。详见 硬件与性能。","locale":"zh-CN"},"103":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-46","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#实时变声","content":"上次使用的输出设备没有连接（例如拔掉了耳机或声卡）。界面会提示 **保存的输出设备不存在，将使用系统默认设备。**，点 **使用默认输出启动** 确认，或在设备面板里选择其他设备。命令行加 `--allow-fallback`。开启 **自动重新连接丢失的设备** 时，运行中丢失的设备重新接上后会自动恢复。","locale":"zh-CN"},"104":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-47","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#实时变声","content":"把实时变声的输出送进一块虚拟声卡，再在其他程序里把这块声卡的录音端选为麦克风：Windows 上用 VB-CABLE（**CABLE Input** → **CABLE Output**）或 Voicemeeter（**Voicemeeter AUX Input** → **Voicemeeter Out B1**），macOS 上用 **BlackHole 2ch**，Linux 上用 PipeWire/PulseAudio 虚拟麦克风。用 **监听** 听自己。分步说明以及其他程序里需要关闭的设置见 在其他程序中使用实时变声。","locale":"zh-CN"},"105":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-48","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#实时变声","content":"其他程序要录虚拟声卡的*录音端*（**CABLE Output**、**Voicemeeter Out B1**、**BlackHole 2ch**、**RVC-Next-Microphone**），不要选 **默认**，也不要选真实的麦克风。","locale":"zh-CN"},"106":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-49","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#实时变声","content":"rvc-next 的 **输出** 要选*播放端*，并且实时变声处于 **运行中**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"107":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-50","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#实时变声","content":"用 Voicemeeter 时，rvc-next 播放进去的那条通道要打开 **B1**，麦克风自己那条通道的 **B1** 要关闭。","locale":"zh-CN"},"108":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-51","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#实时变声","content":"在 Linux 上，虚拟输出不会作为单独的设备出现在 rvc-next 的菜单里：按 在其他程序中使用实时变声 › Linux 添加 **rvc-next-virtual** 这个 ALSA 设备。","locale":"zh-CN"},"109":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-52","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#实时变声","content":"另见 在其他程序中使用实时变声 末尾的排查表。","locale":"zh-CN"},"110":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-53","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#显存与性能","content":"显存不足时，失败的任务不会自动重试，服务器会卸载所有没在使用的模型。可以：","locale":"zh-CN"},"111":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-54","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#显存与性能","content":"停止实时变声和其他任务，在顶栏 **显存** 菜单中点 **释放显存**；","locale":"zh-CN"},"112":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-55","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#显存与性能","content":"在 **任务** 中点 **重试**；","locale":"zh-CN"},"113":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-56","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#显存与性能","content":"仍然不足时，把 **同时运行的 GPU 任务数** 设为 1、训练时减小批大小、关闭 **将数据集缓存到显存**，或把 **精度** 设为 fp16（显卡支持时）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"114":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-57","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#显存与性能","content":"详见 硬件与性能。","locale":"zh-CN"},"115":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-58","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#显存与性能","content":"GPU 任务数量达到 **同时运行的 GPU 任务数** 时，其余任务会排队；实时变声运行时，新的 GPU 任务也会等待，以免影响实时音频。任务卡片上的 **仍然运行** 可以不等实时变声结束就开始（可能导致实时声音卡顿）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"116":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-59","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#显存与性能","content":"服务器退出时还在排队或运行的任务，下次启动时会标记为 **已中断**。任务的请求保存在数据库里，点 **重试** 即可重新运行；训练会从最近保存的检查点继续。","locale":"zh-CN"},"117":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-60","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#文件与远程访问","content":"默认情况下，**服务器文件** 可以浏览所有驱动器（Windows 的 `C:\\`、`D:\\` 等）和已挂载的卷（macOS 的 `/Volumes/*`，Linux 的 `/media/<用户>/*`、`/run/media/<用户>/*`、`/mnt/*`），以及用户主目录、数据目录和原版 RVC 安装。","locale":"zh-CN"},"118":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-61","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#文件与远程访问","content":"如果看不到，通常是因为设置了 **浏览器可打开的文件夹**（`paths.browse_roots`）：一旦设置，就只能浏览列出的文件夹。把需要的磁盘加进去，或清空它恢复默认：","locale":"zh-CN"},"119":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-62","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#文件与远程访问","content":"命令行不受这个限制。","locale":"zh-CN"},"120":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-63","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#文件与远程访问","content":"绑定到所有网卡：","locale":"zh-CN"},"121":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-64","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#文件与远程访问","content":"在另一台电脑打开 `http://<服务器 IP>:7868` 即可，不需要访问令牌。网络不完全可信时，请自己加上防火墙、VPN 或带身份验证的反向代理，或设置可选的访问令牌（`rvc-next config set server.access_token \"一个足够长的随机字符串\"`），之后浏览器会弹出 **访问令牌** 对话框。详见 远程访问与安全。","locale":"zh-CN"},"122":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-65","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#文件与远程访问","content":"令牌不会以明文显示（`config show` 只显示是否已设置）。在服务器那台电脑上停止服务器，然后设置一个新令牌或清除它：","locale":"zh-CN"},"123":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-66","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#文件与远程访问","content":"设置令牌后，所有浏览器（包括服务器本机的浏览器）都需要输入令牌，所以忘记令牌时只能用命令行重设。浏览器会弹出 **访问令牌** 对话框，输入新令牌即可。","locale":"zh-CN"},"124":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-67","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#文件与远程访问","content":"可以。在 **模型** › **音色** 的 **原版 RVC 安装** 中 **添加 RVC 安装**，原版 `assets/weights` 中的音色会直接出现在音色列表里（带 **旧版** 标记），索引按原版规则自动推荐；把 `paths.assets_dir` 指向原版的 `assets` 文件夹可以复用 HuBERT、RMVPE、底模和分离模型。详见 从原版 RVC 迁移。","locale":"zh-CN"},"125":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-68","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#文件与远程访问","content":"音色库中的音色被移到系统回收站（系统没有回收站时，移到数据目录的 `trash/`），可以从那里找回。原版 RVC 安装中的音色只是隐藏，文件不会被改动；在音色列表中打开 **显示隐藏的**，或用 `rvc-next model list --all` 可以看到它们。","locale":"zh-CN"},"126":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","type":"page","content":"硬件与性能","breadcrumbs":["RVC Next 文档","进阶"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-hardware","locale":"zh-CN"},"127":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-0","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware","content":"本页说明 RVC Next 怎样选择计算设备和精度、怎样管理显存，以及影响速度和实时延迟的设置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"128":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-1","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#选择设备","content":"选择设备","locale":"zh-CN"},"129":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-2","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#gpu-rule","content":"GPU 规则","locale":"zh-CN"},"130":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-3","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#精度","content":"精度","locale":"zh-CN"},"131":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-4","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#安装对应的-pytorch","content":"安装对应的 PyTorch","locale":"zh-CN"},"132":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-5","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#cuda-graph","content":"CUDA Graph","locale":"zh-CN"},"133":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-6","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#amd-rocm-与-intel-xpu","content":"AMD ROCm 与 Intel XPU","locale":"zh-CN"},"134":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-7","page_id":"/docs/a