算**），完整列表见 配置与环境变量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"145":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-18","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#选择设备","content":"`compute.device`（**设置** › **计算** › **设备**）可以是：","locale":"zh-CN"},"146":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-19","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#选择设备","content":"值","locale":"zh-CN"},"147":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-20","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#选择设备","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"148":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-21","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#选择设备","content":"`auto`（默认）","locale":"zh-CN"},"149":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-22","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#选择设备","content":"按下面的 GPU 规则选择最合适的显卡（CUDA、ROCm 或 XPU）；都没有时尝试 DirectML，再不行用 CPU。`auto` 不会选择 MPS","locale":"zh-CN"},"150":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-23","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#选择设备","content":"`cpu`","locale":"zh-CN"},"151":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-24","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#选择设备","content":"只用 CPU","locale":"zh-CN"},"152":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-25","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#选择设备","content":"`cuda:N`","locale":"zh-CN"},"153":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-26","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#选择设备","content":"第 N 块 NVIDIA 显卡（从 0 开始），在 ROCm 版 torch 上则是第 N 块 AMD 显卡。GPU 规则会跳过的卡也照样使用（以 fp32 运行）；编号不存在时退回 CPU","locale":"zh-CN"},"154":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-27","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#选择设备","content":"`xpu:N`","locale":"zh-CN"},"155":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-28","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#选择设备","content":"XPU 版 torch 上的第 N 块 Intel 显卡（Arc、数据中心 GPU、较新的核显）。退回规则与 `cuda:N` 相同","locale":"zh-CN"},"156":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-29","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#选择设备","content":"`dml`","locale":"zh-CN"},"157":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-30","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#选择设备","content":"DirectML（Windows 上的 AMD、Intel 等显卡）。不可用时退回 CPU","locale":"zh-CN"},"158":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-31","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#选择设备","content":"`mps`","locale":"zh-CN"},"159":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-32","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#选择设备","content":"Apple Silicon 的 Metal（**实验性**）。不可用时退回 CPU","locale":"zh-CN"},"160":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-33","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#gpu-rule","content":"`auto` 沿用原版 RVC（`configs/config.py`）的规则，逐块检查 CUDA 显卡：","locale":"zh-CN"},"161":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-34","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#gpu-rule","content":"显卡","locale":"zh-CN"},"162":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-35","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#gpu-rule","content":"结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"163":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-36","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#gpu-rule","content":"显存不足 4 GiB，或计算能力低于 5.3","locale":"zh-CN"},"164":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-37","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#gpu-rule","content":"不使用","locale":"zh-CN"},"165":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-38","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#gpu-rule","content":"计算能力 6.1（Pascal，如 GTX 10 系列），或 GTX 16xx","locale":"zh-CN"},"166":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-39","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#gpu-rule","content":"使用，fp32","locale":"zh-CN"},"167":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-40","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#gpu-rule","content":"计算能力高于 6.1（RTX 20 系列及更新）","locale":"zh-CN"},"168":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-41","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#gpu-rule","content":"使用，fp16","locale":"zh-CN"},"169":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-42","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#gpu-rule","content":"其他（计算能力 5.3 到 6.1 之间）","locale":"zh-CN"},"170":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-43","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#gpu-rule","content":"不使用","locale":"zh-CN"},"171":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-44","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#gpu-rule","content":"ROCm 上的 AMD 显卡（仍是 `cuda:N`）和 Intel XPU 显卡不看计算能力：显存至少 4 GiB 就使用；ROCm 显卡以 fp16 运行，XPU 显卡在设备报告支持 fp16 时以 fp16 运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"172":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-45","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#gpu-rule","content":"有多块可用显卡时，选计算能力最高的，相同时选显存最大的。`rvc-next doctor` 和 **设置** › **计算** 下方的设备列表会列出每个设备、规则给出的精度和原因（例如 \"Pascal SM 6.1 and GTX 16xx cards run in fp32\"）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"173":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-46","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#精度","content":"`compute.precision`（**精度**）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"174":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-47","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#精度","content":"`auto`：按 GPU 规则；","locale":"zh-CN"},"175":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-48","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#精度","content":"`fp32`：始终用 fp32；","locale":"zh-CN"},"176":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-49","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#精度","content":"`fp16`：在 CUDA、ROCm 和 XPU 上强制 fp16（包括规则判为 fp32 的显卡）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"177":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-50","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#精度","content":"DirectML、MPS 和 CPU 上始终是 fp32（DirectML 上的人声分离例外，见下）。fp16 更快、显存占用更少；如果某块卡在 fp16 下输出异常，改为 `fp32`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"178":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-51","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#精度","content":"精度还决定长音频的分块大小（与原版相同）：显存不超过 4 GiB 的 CUDA、ROCm 和 XPU 卡用最小的分块，fp16 用较大的分块，其他情况用中等分块。","locale":"zh-CN"},"179":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-52","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#安装对应的-pytorch","content":"设备是否可用取决于安装的 PyTorch：NVIDIA 显卡需要 CUDA 版的 torch，AMD 显卡需要 ROCm 版（AMD 自己发布，支持 Windows 和 Linux），Intel 显卡需要 XPU 版；只装了 CPU 版时 `auto` 会选 CPU。安装方法见 安装；`rvc-next doctor` 显示 torch 版本和它的构建目标（例如 `CUDA 13.0`、`ROCm 10.0` 或 `XPU`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"180":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-53","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#cuda-graph","content":"CUDA Graph 把一次推理录制下来、之后直接重放，减少 CPU 调度开销，对实时变声的小块推理帮助最大：","locale":"zh-CN"},"181":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-54","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#cuda-graph","content":"设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"182":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-55","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#cuda-graph","content":"界面","locale":"zh-CN"},"183":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-56","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#cuda-graph","content":"默认值","locale":"zh-CN"},"184":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-57","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#cuda-graph","content":"`compute.cuda_graph_offline`","locale":"zh-CN"},"185":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-58","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#cuda-graph","content":"**转换时使用 CUDA Graph**","locale":"zh-CN"},"186":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-59","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#cuda-graph","content":"关","locale":"zh-CN"},"187":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-60","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#cuda-graph","content":"`compute.cuda_graph_live`","locale":"zh-CN"},"188":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-61","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#cuda-graph","content":"**实时转换使用 CUDA Graph**","locale":"zh-CN"},"189":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-62","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#cuda-graph","content":"开","locale":"zh-CN"},"190":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-63","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#cuda-graph","content":"只在 NVIDIA CUDA 上起作用：ROCm 和 XPU 上这两个开关不生效，推理以普通模式运行。录制按输入的形状缓存（每个调用点最多 8 个，环境变量 `RVC_NEXT_CUDA_GRAPH_MAX_CACHE` 可调），录制失败时自动退回普通模式。离线转换的输入长度各不相同，难以复用录制结果，所以默认关闭。","locale":"zh-CN"},"191":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-64","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#amd-rocm-与-intel-xpu","content":"ROCm：torch 的 ROCm 版（Windows 和 Linux）把 AMD 显卡当作 CUDA 设备，所以它们显示为 `cuda:N`，CUDA 上能运行的功能都能在上面运行，CUDA Graph 除外。人声分离直接使用显卡。","locale":"zh-CN"},"192":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-65","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#amd-rocm-与-intel-xpu","content":"XPU：Intel 显卡显示为 `xpu:N`。转换、实时变声、训练（fp16 使用 AMP；多卡训练使用 `xccl` 后端）以及音高和特征提取都在上面运行。人声分离先在 CPU 上加载模型再移到显卡，并以 fp32 运行，因为 pymss 本身不支持 XPU。","locale":"zh-CN"},"193":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-66","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#amd-rocm-与-intel-xpu","content":"多卡训练通过 `CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES`（ROCm 也读取它）或 XPU 上的 `ZE_AFFINITY_MASK` 选择显卡。**训练** 中的 GPU 编号指当前 torch 构建所提供的那一类设备。","locale":"zh-CN"},"194":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-67","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#directml","content":"安装 DirectML 支持：`pip install \"rvc-next[directml]\"`（安装 `torch-directml` 和 `onnxruntime-directml`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"195":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-68","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#directml","content":"RMVPE 在 DirectML 上使用 ONNX 版本，需要资源 `rmvpe-onnx`：`rvc-next assets download rmvpe-onnx`。它不在 `all` 分组里，缺少时界面和命令行会提示下载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"196":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-69","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#directml","content":"人声分离在 DirectML 上默认以 fp16 运行，并使用较小的分块；如果 fp16 失败，任务会自动改用 fp32 重新运行一次（日志中有 \"Retrying in fp32\"）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"197":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-70","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#apple-siliconmps","content":"把 `compute.device` 设为 `mps` 才会使用 Metal，`auto` 不会选它。MPS 上以 fp32 运行，属于实验性支持。","locale":"zh-CN"},"198":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-71","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#模型缓存","content":"服务器加载过的模型会留在内存（显存）里，下次使用时不必重新加载：HuBERT、各种音高算法的模型，以及最近使用的 3 个音色和它们的索引。实时变声在自己的工作进程里也保留一份。","locale":"zh-CN"},"199":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-72","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#模型缓存","content":"顶栏的 **显存** 指示器显示已用/总显存和 **已加载：** 的模型列表（没有时显示 **未加载任何模型**）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"200":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-73","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#空闲卸载","content":"`compute.unload_after_minutes`（**空闲多少分钟后卸载模型（0：从不）**，默认 10）：服务器里的模型空闲超过这个时间后自动卸载。服务器每 30 秒检查一次。","locale":"zh-CN"},"201":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-74","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#释放显存","content":"在顶栏 **显存** 菜单中点 **释放显存**，立即卸载所有缓存的模型，包括空闲的实时变声工作进程中的模型，并把显存还给驱动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"202":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-75","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#释放显存","content":"只有在**没有任务排队或运行、实时变声也没有运行**时才能释放；否则菜单项显示为 **释放显存（请等待：有任务正在运行）** 或 **释放显存（请等待：实时变声正在运行）**，因为这些模型正在使用，释放后马上又要重新加载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"203":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-76","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#释放显存","content":"命令行没有单独的释放命令：每条命令结束时进程退出，显存随之释放。","locale":"zh-CN"},"204":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-77","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#out-of-memory","content":"当推理或训练报告显存不足（CUDA 的 `OutOfMemoryError`，以及 MPS、DirectML 的相应错误）时：","locale":"zh-CN"},"205":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-78","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#out-of-memory","content":"任务失败，错误为 **GPU 不可用或显存不足**（`compute_unavailable`，`detail.reason` 为 `out_of_memory`；命令行退出码 9）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"206":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-79","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#out-of-memory","content":"服务器随即卸载所有没在使用的模型，让下一次从空的显存开始；实时变声的工作进程出错时先卸载自己的模型；","locale":"zh-CN"},"207":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-80","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#out-of-memory","content":"这样失败的任务**不会自动重试**，需要你在 **任务** 中点 **重试**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"208":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-81","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#out-of-memory","content":"减少显存占用的办法：","locale":"zh-CN"},"209":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-82","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#out-of-memory","content":"把 **同时运行的 GPU 任务数** 保持为 1；","locale":"zh-CN"},"210":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-83","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#out-of-memory","content":"转换或训练前先 **释放显存**，或停止实时变声；","locale":"zh-CN"},"211":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-84","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#out-of-memory","content":"训练时减小批大小（`train run --batch-size`），关闭 **将数据集缓存到显存**；","locale":"zh-CN"},"212":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-85","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#out-of-memory","content":"改用 fp16（如果显卡支持），或在显存很小的卡上改用 CPU。","locale":"zh-CN"},"213":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-86","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#gpu-任务排队","content":"转换、分离和训练任务在 `compute.device` 不是 `cpu` 时属于 GPU 任务：","locale":"zh-CN"},"214":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-87","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#gpu-任务排队","content":"`compute.gpu_jobs`（**同时运行的 GPU 任务数**，默认 1，最大 16）限制同时运行的 GPU 任务数量，其余任务排队（状态 **等待中**，**等待 GPU**）。显存充足时可以调大。","locale":"zh-CN"},"215":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-88","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#gpu-任务排队","content":"设备为 `cpu` 时这些任务改为 CPU 任务，最多同时运行 CPU 核数的一半个。","locale":"zh-CN"},"216":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-89","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#gpu-任务排队","content":"实验的 **GPU** 设为 `cpu` 时（新实验的默认值来自 `training.gpus`），训练也作为 CPU 任务运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"217":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-90","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#gpu-任务排队","content":"预览（只转换前几秒）的优先级高于普通转换。","locale":"zh-CN"},"218":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-91","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#实时变声优先","content":"实时变声对延迟最敏感，所以它开始时（设备不是 `cpu`）会占用 GPU：","locale":"zh-CN"},"219":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-92","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#实时变声优先","content":"已经在运行的 GPU 任务继续运行；","locale":"zh-CN"},"220":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-93","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#实时变声优先","content":"新的 GPU 任务进入等待，任务卡片上出现 **仍然运行**，提示 **实时转换正在使用 GPU。同时运行可能导致声音卡顿。** 点它可以不等实时变声结束就开始；","locale":"zh-CN"},"221":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-94","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#实时变声优先","content":"实时变声停止后，等待的任务自动开始。","locale":"zh-CN"},"222":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-95","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#实时变声优先","content":"命令行（`rvc-next convert` 等）在自己的进程中运行任务，不参与正在运行的服务器的 GPU 排队。服务器正在实时变声时，在同一台电脑上用命令行跑 GPU 任务同样可能造成卡顿。","locale":"zh-CN"},"223":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-96","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#live-latency","content":"实时变声每次处理一个\"块\"的音频。估计延迟（实时页面和 `live check` 显示）按下式计算：","locale":"zh-CN"},"224":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-97","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#live-latency","content":"按默认的 **块长** 250 毫秒、**交叉淡化** 50 毫秒，单个双工流时约为 560 毫秒加上设备延迟。","locale":"zh-CN"},"225":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-98","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#live-latency","content":"这里的设备延迟是 PortAudio 报告的值，往往偏乐观（MME、DirectSound 和蓝牙设备尤其如此）。要得到真实数值，把输出接回输入，然后在实时页面使用 **测量延迟**，或运行 `rvc-next live latency`：它让测试噪声经过实时变声所用的同一组缓冲，通过互相关在输入中找到它们，再加上转换器自身的延迟。详见 测量真实延迟。","locale":"zh-CN"},"226":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-99","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#live-latency","content":"要让变声不断音，每块的推理时间必须明显短于块长。实时页面的 **负载** 条显示推理耗时（p95）与块长之比：","locale":"zh-CN"},"227":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-100","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#live-latency","content":"负载超过 80% 时进度条变红，并出现按钮 **将块长增加到 \\{ms} 毫秒**（建议值让负载回到约 70%，上限 1500 毫秒），点击即可调整；","locale":"zh-CN"},"228":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-101","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#live-latency","content":"出现 **欠载**、**溢出** 计数或爆音时，同样应增大块长；","locale":"zh-CN"},"229":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-102","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#live-latency","content":"运行中修改块长、交叉淡化、上下文会重新缓冲，不需要重新加载模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"230":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-103","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#live-latency","content":"CPU 和 GPU 的差别主要体现在这里：在 GPU 上推理快，可以用较短的块长换取低延迟；在 CPU 上推理慢得多，通常需要更长的块长（延迟随之增加），pm 音高算法也比 RMVPE 快。**上下文** 越长效果越平滑，但每块的计算量也越大；降噪会增加一些耗时。","locale":"zh-CN"},"231":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-104","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#live-latency","content":"更多实时变声的使用说明见 实时变声。","locale":"zh-CN"},"232":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","type":"page","content":"从原版 RVC 迁移","breadcrumbs":["RVC Next 文档","进阶"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-migrate","locale":"zh-CN"},"233":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-0","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate","content":"RVC Next 是 Retrieval-based-Voice-Conversion-WebUI（以提交 81eed5e 为基准）的重写。","locale":"zh-CN"},"234":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-1","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#1-复用原版的-assets-文件夹","content":"1\\. 复用原版的 `assets` 文件夹","locale":"zh-CN"},"235":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-2","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#2-直接使用原版的音色","content":"2\\. 直接使用原版的音色","locale":"zh-CN"},"236":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-3","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#3-把音色复制进音色库","content":"3\\. 把音色复制进音色库","locale":"zh-CN"},"237":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-4","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#4-导入原版的训练实验","content":"4\\. 导入原版的训练实验","locale":"zh-CN"},"238":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-5","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#与原版的行为差异","content":"与原版的行为差异","locale":"zh-CN"},"239":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-6","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#与原版逐位一致的部分","content":"与原版逐位一致的部分","locale":"zh-CN"},"240":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-7","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate","content":"RVC Next 是 Retrieval-based-Voice-Conversion-WebUI（以提交 `81eed5e` 为基准）的重写。原版的模型文件格式不变：原版训练的音色、索引、底模和实验都可以直接使用，RVC Next 训练出的音色也是同样的格式。本页说明怎样复用一个已有的原版 RVC 安装，以及两者在行为上的差异。","locale":"zh-CN"},"241":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-8","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate","content":"迁移不会修改原版安装里的任何文件，可以两边同时使用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"242":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-9","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#1-复用原版的-assets-文件夹","content":"RVC Next 的资源文件夹与原版的 `assets/` 结构相同：","locale":"zh-CN"},"243":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-10","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#1-复用原版的-assets-文件夹","content":"资源","locale":"zh-CN"},"244":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-11","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#1-复用原版的-assets-文件夹","content":"路径","locale":"zh-CN"},"245":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-12","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#1-复用原版的-assets-文件夹","content":"HuBERT","locale":"zh-CN"},"246":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-13","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#1-复用原版的-assets-文件夹","content":"`hubert_base/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"247":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-14","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#1-复用原版的-assets-文件夹","content":"RMVPE","locale":"zh-CN"},"248":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-15","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#1-复用原版的-assets-文件夹","content":"`rmvpe/rmvpe.pt`（DirectML 用 `rmvpe/rmvpe.onnx`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"249":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-16","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#1-复用原版的-assets-文件夹","content":"底模","locale":"zh-CN"},"250":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-17","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#1-复用原版的-assets-文件夹","content":"`pretrained/`、`pretrained_v2/`（如 `f0G40k.pth`、`f0D40k.pth`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"251":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-18","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#1-复用原版的-assets-文件夹","content":"分离模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"252":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-19","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#1-复用原版的-assets-文件夹","content":"`pymss_weights/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"253":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-20","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#1-复用原版的-assets-文件夹","content":"FCPE","locale":"zh-CN"},"254":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-21","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#1-复用原版的-assets-文件夹","content":"`fcpe/fcpe_c_v001.pt`（原版通过 torchfcpe 包自带，RVC Next 需要单独下载）","locale":"zh-CN"},"255":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-22","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#1-复用原版的-assets-文件夹","content":"所以把 `paths.assets_dir` 指向原版的 `assets` 文件夹，就不必重新下载这些文件：","locale":"zh-CN"},"256":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-23","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#1-复用原版的-assets-文件夹","content":"**设置** › **存储** › **文件夹** 中的 **资源**，填入原版 RVC 的 `assets` 文件夹路径。","locale":"zh-CN"},"257":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-24","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#1-复用原版的-assets-文件夹","content":"指向原版的 `assets` 后，之后在 RVC Next 里下载的资源（例如 FCPE、缺少的底模）也会写进这个文件夹。","locale":"zh-CN"},"258":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-25","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#2-直接使用原版的音色","content":"把原版安装添加为\"原版 RVC 安装\"（设置里的 `paths.legacy_roots`）后，它的音色**直接读取，不复制**：","locale":"zh-CN"},"259":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-26","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#2-直接使用原版的音色","content":"音色来自 `<RVC>/assets/weights/*.pth`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"260":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-27","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#2-直接使用原版的音色","content":"索引从 `<RVC>/assets/indices` 和 `<RVC>/logs` 中查找，按原版 `get_index_path_from_model` 的打分规则（实验名、说话人、新旧）为每个音色推荐一个 `added_*.index`，名称含 `trained` 的索引不参与。","locale":"zh-CN"},"261":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-28","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#2-直接使用原版的音色","content":"在 Web UI 中：**模型** › **音色** 页面底部的 **原版 RVC 安装**，点 **添加 RVC 安装**，选择 RVC 的根目录（必须包含 `assets` 文件夹）。之后：","locale":"zh-CN"},"262":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-29","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#2-直接使用原版的音色","content":"这些音色带有 **旧版** 标记，出现在所有音色选择器里，可以直接用于转换和实时变声。","locale":"zh-CN"},"263":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-30","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#2-直接使用原版的音色","content":"**扫描**：重新读取 `assets/weights`，并为还没有选过索引的音色重新按原版规则推荐索引；你手动添加或移除过索引的音色保持你的选择。","locale":"zh-CN"},"264":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-31","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#2-直接使用原版的音色","content":"**全部导入**：把这个安装里的所有音色复制进 RVC Next 的音色库。","locale":"zh-CN"},"265":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-32","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#2-直接使用原版的音色","content":"推荐结果和你之后的修改（改名、说话人名称、换索引、隐藏）保存在数据目录的 `legacy-voices.json` 里，原版的文件夹始终不会被写入。为旧版音色附加的索引如果是上传的文件，会复制到 `models/attached-indexes/<音色>/`；如果是服务器上的路径，则只记录路径。删除旧版音色只是隐藏它（`rvc-next model list --all` 仍能列出），RVC 安装中的文件不会被改动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"266":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-33","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#2-直接使用原版的音色","content":"用命令行添加时，写入同样的设置即可，下次运行命令或启动服务器时会读取并推荐索引：","locale":"zh-CN"},"267":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-34","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#2-直接使用原版的音色","content":"Web UI 默认允许浏览已添加的原版 RVC 安装中的文件（见 远程访问与安全 中的浏览范围）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"268":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-35","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#3-把音色复制进音色库","content":"如果想让音色独立于原版安装（例如之后要删除原版），就导入它们。导入时每个文件按内容识别，`.pth` 和 `.index` 的文件名不需要对应：","locale":"zh-CN"},"269":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-36","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#3-把音色复制进音色库","content":"索引的宽度决定它适合哪个版本（256 维为 v1，768 维为 v2），版本不符的不会配对；","locale":"zh-CN"},"270":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-37","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#3-把音色复制进音色库","content":"同一次导入中只有一个兼容音色时自动配对；有多个时按实验名、名称相似度和是否在同一文件夹打分，不够确定时由你选择（Web UI 弹出 **检查导入**，命令行打印计划并以退出码 3 结束）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"271":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-38","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#3-把音色复制进音色库","content":"把 `.pth`、`.index` 或 `.zip` 拖到 **模型** › **音色** 的导入区。旧版音色也可以在 **原版 RVC 安装** 中点 **全部导入**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"272":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-39","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#3-把音色复制进音色库","content":"训练用的 `G_*.pth`/`D_*.pth` 默认作为 **底模** 导入（之后可以在实验设置里选择）；想把 G 检查点直接变成音色，加 `--extract`，或在 **模型** › **工具** 中提取。","locale":"zh-CN"},"273":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-40","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#4-导入原版的训练实验","content":"原版的实验文件夹 `logs/<名称>` 可以复制进来继续使用：","locale":"zh-CN"},"274":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-41","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#4-导入原版的训练实验","content":"**训练** 页面点 **导入实验**，填入 **原版实验文件夹（logs/\\<名称>）**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"275":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-42","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#4-导入原版的训练实验","content":"文件夹必须包含 `0_gt_wavs` 或 `config.json`。复制时跳过 `eval` 文件夹；输出已经存在的阶段（切片、音高、特征、训练、索引）记为已完成，之后可以接着运行没完成的阶段，或增加轮数继续训练。实验文件夹里没有 `experiment.json` 时，RVC Next 按原版实验来读取。","locale":"zh-CN"},"276":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-43","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#与原版的行为差异","content":"以下是有意的改动（其余数值计算与原版逐行对应）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"277":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-44","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#与原版的行为差异","content":"方面","locale":"zh-CN"},"278":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-45","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#与原版的行为差异","content":"原版","locale":