 显示它的位置）。音色库、实验和结果不受影响。环境变量设置的值仍然生效。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1638":{"id":"/docs/cli","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"page","content":"概览","breadcrumbs":["RVC Next 文档","命令行"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli","locale":"zh-CN"},"1639":{"id":"/docs/cli-0","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#命令一览","content":"命令一览","locale":"zh-CN"},"1640":{"id":"/docs/cli-1","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#与-web-ui-的区别","content":"与 Web UI 的区别","locale":"zh-CN"},"1641":{"id":"/docs/cli-2","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#输出格式与---json","content":"输出格式与 `--json`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1642":{"id":"/docs/cli-3","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"退出码","locale":"zh-CN"},"1643":{"id":"/docs/cli-4","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#调试日志","content":"调试日志","locale":"zh-CN"},"1644":{"id":"/docs/cli-5","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#shell-补全","content":"Shell 补全","locale":"zh-CN"},"1645":{"id":"/docs/cli-6","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#常用流程","content":"常用流程","locale":"zh-CN"},"1646":{"id":"/docs/cli-7","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#首次准备","content":"首次准备","locale":"zh-CN"},"1647":{"id":"/docs/cli-8","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#转换一个文件夹","content":"转换一个文件夹","locale":"zh-CN"},"1648":{"id":"/docs/cli-9","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#人声分离","content":"人声分离","locale":"zh-CN"},"1649":{"id":"/docs/cli-10","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#从头训练一个音色","content":"从头训练一个音色","locale":"zh-CN"},"1650":{"id":"/docs/cli-11","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#导入模型","content":"导入模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"1651":{"id":"/docs/cli-12","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#实时变声","content":"实时变声","locale":"zh-CN"},"1652":{"id":"/docs/cli-13","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#下一步","content":"下一步","locale":"zh-CN"},"1653":{"id":"/docs/cli-14","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli","content":"`rvc-next` 命令行与 Web UI 做的是同一套事情：转换、人声分离、训练、实时变声、模型与资源管理、预设、任务查询和设置。两者调用的是同一个核心服务（每个操作对应一个核心方法），所以命令行能做的事与界面一致，`--json` 的输出也与 API 返回的 JSON 完全相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1654":{"id":"/docs/cli-15","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli","content":"本页介绍命令行的共同约定和几个常用流程；每条命令的全部选项见 命令参考，设置项与环境变量见 配置与环境变量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1655":{"id":"/docs/cli-16","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#命令一览","content":"任何一级都可以加 `--help` 查看说明，只输入组名（如 `rvc-next model`）也会显示该组的帮助。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1656":{"id":"/docs/cli-17","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#与-web-ui-的区别","content":"**任务在前台运行。** `convert`、`separate`、`train run`、`assets download`、`model merge` 等会创建一个任务并在当前终端里执行，直到完成；终端（stderr）上显示进度条。按 ctrl+c 取消任务，退出码为 130。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1657":{"id":"/docs/cli-18","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#与-web-ui-的区别","content":"**不需要启动服务器。** 每条命令自己打开数据目录（设置、数据库、模型），执行完就关闭。命令行创建的任务同样记录在数据库里，所以 `rvc-next jobs list` 能看到本机所有任务，包括正在运行的服务器的任务，反之 Web UI 的 **任务** 面板也能看到命令行跑过的任务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1658":{"id":"/docs/cli-19","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#与-web-ui-的区别","content":"**命令行被视为可信。** Web UI 只能打开 **浏览器可打开的文件夹**（`paths.browse_roots`）里的服务器文件，命令行则可以使用任何路径（见 远程访问与安全）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1659":{"id":"/docs/cli-20","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#与-web-ui-的区别","content":"**音色可以直接给 `.pth` 路径。** `convert --voice` 接受音色 id、名称或一个 `.pth` 文件路径；用路径时可以再用 `--index` 指定索引，这样的临时音色不会出现在音色库列表里。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1660":{"id":"/docs/cli-21","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#与-web-ui-的区别","content":"`rvc-next config set` 直接写 `settings.toml`。正在运行的服务器会在约 1 秒内读到改动，打开的 Web UI 也会随之刷新；之后在 Web UI 保存设置时，会在文件当前内容的基础上合并，不会冲掉命令行的改动。少数设置（如端口、监听地址）仍需重启服务器才会生效。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1661":{"id":"/docs/cli-22","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#输出格式与---json","content":"列表和查询类命令默认打印表格；加 `--json` 打印 JSON，其结构与对应 API 的返回值一致，适合脚本处理：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1662":{"id":"/docs/cli-23","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#输出格式与---json","content":"进度条只在 stderr 是终端时显示，并且在 `--json` 模式下关闭，所以重定向 stdout 不会混入进度信息。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1663":{"id":"/docs/cli-24","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"命令出错时，日志里打印错误信息，退出码表示错误类别（定义在 `rvc_next/core/errors.py`）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1664":{"id":"/docs/cli-25","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"退出码","locale":"zh-CN"},"1665":{"id":"/docs/cli-26","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"1666":{"id":"/docs/cli-27","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"典型情况","locale":"zh-CN"},"1667":{"id":"/docs/cli-28","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"0","locale":"zh-CN"},"1668":{"id":"/docs/cli-29","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"成功","locale":"zh-CN"},"1669":{"id":"/docs/cli-30","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"1","locale":"zh-CN"},"1670":{"id":"/docs/cli-31","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"一般错误","locale":"zh-CN"},"1671":{"id":"/docs/cli-32","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"未分类的内部错误；`model remove` 时回答了\"否\"","locale":"zh-CN"},"1672":{"id":"/docs/cli-33","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"2","locale":"zh-CN"},"1673":{"id":"/docs/cli-34","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"未找到（`not_found`）","locale":"