pi-7","page_id":"/docs/development-api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-api#socketio-与事件","content":"socket.io 与事件","locale":"zh-CN"},"1721":{"id":"/docs/development-api-8","page_id":"/docs/development-api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-api#桥接","content":"桥接","locale":"zh-CN"},"1722":{"id":"/docs/development-api-9","page_id":"/docs/development-api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-api#事件与载荷","content":"事件与载荷","locale":"zh-CN"},"1723":{"id":"/docs/development-api-10","page_id":"/docs/development-api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-api#事件进入-openapi","content":"事件进入 OpenAPI","locale":"zh-CN"},"1724":{"id":"/docs/development-api-11","page_id":"/docs/development-api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-api#从-schema-生成-typescript","content":"从 schema 生成 TypeScript","locale":"zh-CN"},"1725":{"id":"/docs/development-api-12","page_id":"/docs/development-api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-api#静态页面","content":"静态页面","locale":"zh-CN"},"1726":{"id":"/docs/development-api-13","page_id":"/docs/development-api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-api#启动端口与-server_ready","content":"启动、端口与 `SERVER_READY`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1727":{"id":"/docs/development-api-14","page_id":"/docs/development-api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-api#新增一个接口","content":"新增一个接口","locale":"zh-CN"},"1728":{"id":"/docs/development-api-15","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api","content":"`rvc_next.api` 是 FastAPI 一端：把 HTTP 请求解析成核心层的 `Record` 模型，调用一个核心方法，再把结果原样返回；服务器到浏览器的推送走 socket.io。它不导入 `rvc_next.engine`（整体架构中的分层规则由 `tests/test_architecture.py` 守住），也不含业务逻辑——最大的路由文件 `routers/models.py` 也只是一串“一行调用核心”的路由。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1729":{"id":"/docs/development-api-16","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api","content":"本页面向需要增删接口、调整安全策略或新增事件的维护者：应用如何组装、REST 约定、上传与媒体、访问控制、事件与载荷、从 OpenAPI 生成 TypeScript 类型，以及服务器启动时的端口选择。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1730":{"id":"/docs/development-api-17","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#应用的组装","content":"`api/app.py` 的 `create_app(services, bound_host, bound_port, extra_hosts, serve_ui, api_prefix)` 依次（下文的路径都在 `api_prefix` 之下，默认为空）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1731":{"id":"/docs/development-api-18","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#应用的组装","content":"建 `RvcNextAPI`（`FastAPI` 子类，见下文“事件进入 OpenAPI”），`docs_url=\"/docs\"`、`openapi_url=\"/openapi.json\"`、关闭 ReDoc，并设 `separate_input_output_schemas=False`；把 `services` 存到 `app.state.services`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1732":{"id":"/docs/development-api-19","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#应用的组装","content":"`install_error_handlers(app)`：任何 `RvcNextError` 都变成 `{\"code\", \"message\", \"detail\"}`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1733":{"id":"/docs/development-api-20","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#应用的组装","content":"依次挂载 `ROUTERS` 中的 13 个路由模块，统一前缀 `/api`；各路由自带 `/v1/<资源>` 前缀，所以完整路径是 `/api/v1/...`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1734":{"id":"/docs/development-api-21","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#应用的组装","content":"在 `/ws` 挂载 socket.io（`SocketBridge.asgi_app()`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1735":{"id":"/docs/development-api-22","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#应用的组装","content":"中间件：`server.allowed_origins` 非空时加 `CORSMiddleware`；总是加 `GZipMiddleware(minimum_size=4096)` 与 `SecurityMiddleware`（后加者在外层，所以安全检查最先执行）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1736":{"id":"/docs/development-api-23","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#应用的组装","content":"**最后**挂载 `SPAStaticFiles` 到 `/`，只有找到 `webui/dist/index.html` 时才挂；没有构建产物时只记一条警告，API 照常工作（开发时由 Vite 提供页面）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1737":{"id":"/docs/development-api-24","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#应用的组装","content":"生命周期（`lifespan`）只负责启动和停止 socket 桥。服务本身由调用方创建与关闭：`rvc-next webui` 用 `build_services(start_background=True)` 启动任务调度和空闲卸载，再交给 `create_app`；测试则传入自己的 `Services`。这样同一个 `create_app` 既能服务真实进程，也能在 `TestClient` 里跑。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1738":{"id":"/docs/development-api-25","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#应用的组装","content":"嵌入模式（`embed.py` 的 `RvcNextServer`）走同一条路：`build_services(data_dir, config_dir, settings_path, settings_overrides, start_background=True)`，绑定端口，`create_app(..., api_prefix=...)`，在后台线程运行 uvicorn，并像 `rvc-next webui` 一样写 `server.json`。`normalize_prefix()` 把 `voice`、`/voice/` 都规范成 `/voice`；`SecurityMiddleware` 按前缀判断受保护路径。用法见 嵌入到其他程序。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1739":{"id":"/docs/development-api-26","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#应用的组装","content":"依赖注入只有一个：`api/deps.py` 的 `ServicesDep = Annotated[Services, Depends(get_services)]`，从 `request.app.state` 取服务。没有全局服务定位器（InvokeAI 的做法），因此一个路由依赖什么写在它的签名里，测试换掉 `app.state.services` 即可。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1740":{"id":"/docs/development-api-27","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#rest-约定","content":"约定","locale":"zh-CN"},"1741":{"id":"/docs/development-api-28","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#rest-约定","content":"做法","locale":"zh-CN"},"1742":{"id":"/docs/development-api-29","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#rest-约定","content":"原因","locale":"zh-CN"},"1743":{"id":"/docs/development-api-30","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#rest-约定","content":"一资源一路由","locale":"zh-CN"},"1744":{"id":"/docs/development-api-31","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/d