le":"zh-CN"},"1909":{"id":"/docs/development-api-196","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#事件与载荷","content":"`settings_changed`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1910":{"id":"/docs/development-api-197","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#事件与载荷","content":"`keys`（被修改的点分键名）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1911":{"id":"/docs/development-api-198","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#事件与载荷","content":"任何设置改动（API、命令行、直接编辑 `settings.toml`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1912":{"id":"/docs/development-api-199","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#事件与载荷","content":"使设置与 `meta` 失效","locale":"zh-CN"},"1913":{"id":"/docs/development-api-200","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#事件与载荷","content":"`models_changed` 的 id 并不都是音色 id：索引收件箱发 `index:<id>`，底模发 `base:<slug>`，导入的分离模型发 `user-<slug>`（也是它作为分离预设的 id）。前端目前只按 id 使详情失效，并不区分类型；需要区分时看前缀即可。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1914":{"id":"/docs/development-api-201","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#事件与载荷","content":"`live_stats`（10 Hz）、`train_metrics` 与任务进度放在 Pinia store 里，而不是 TanStack Query 的缓存：缓存的每次 `setQueryData` 都会通知所有观察者并做结构共享比较，高频写入会让无关组件反复重算。缓存只保存“REST 能重新取回”的状态，见 Web UI。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1915":{"id":"/docs/development-api-202","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#事件进入-openapi","content":"`api/openapi.py` 的 `RvcNextAPI.openapi()` 在 FastAPI 生成的 schema 之后，把每个事件类的 JSON Schema（`mode=\"serialization\"`）加入 `components.schemas`，把嵌套的 `$defs` 提升为同级组件，再加一个 `ServerEvents` 对象：属性名是事件名，值引用事件 schema。组件按名排序，保证生成结果稳定。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1916":{"id":"/docs/development-api-203","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#事件进入-openapi","content":"这样 socket 载荷与 REST 共用同一份类型来源：前端的 `ServerEvents` 类型（`api/types.ts`）直接从生成的 schema 派生，`socket.on('job_updated', ({ job }) => …)` 中的 `job` 就是 `Job` 类型。`tests/api/test_api.py::test_openapi_lists_events` 检查事件确实出现在 schema 里。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1917":{"id":"/docs/development-api-204","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#从-schema-生成-typescript","content":"`python scripts/dev.py typegen` 做三件事：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1918":{"id":"/docs/development-api-205","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#从-schema-生成-typescript","content":"运行 `scripts/generate_openapi.py`：在临时数据目录、空 `environ` 下 `build_services()`，`create_app(serve_ui=False)`，打印 `app.openapi()`。不启动服务器、不读用户设置，所以任何机器上结果都一样。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1919":{"id":"/docs/development-api-206","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#从-schema-生成-typescript","content":"从 schema 中取出 `VoiceParamsModel` 与 `StreamParamsModel`（`PARAM_MODELS`），把每个字段的 `type`、`default`、`minimum`/`maximum`、`enum`、`description` 写成 `src/api/paramSpecs.ts` 的 `PARAM_SPECS`。openapi-typescript 只生成类型，而参数面板需要具体数字；这一步让滑块的范围、默认值和帮助文字只有一个来源——核心层 `core/params.py` 的字段约束。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1920":{"id":"/docs/development-api-207","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#从-schema-生成-typescript","content":"用 openapi-typescript 生成 `src/api/schema.d.ts`。`--default-non-nullable false` 让带默认值的**请求**字段保持可选（客户端可以省略）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1921":{"id":"/docs/development-api-208","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#从-schema-生成-typescript","content":"两个生成文件都提交进仓库。`typegen-check`（`dev.py check` 的一部分，也在 CI 中运行）重新生成后执行 `git diff --exit-code`，API 改了却没重新生成就会失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1922":{"id":"/docs/development-api-209","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#从-schema-生成-typescript","content":"与类型形状有关的三个设定：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1923":{"id":"/docs/development-api-210","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#从-schema-生成-typescript","content":"`Record` 设置了 `json_schema_serialization_defaults_required=True`：带默认值的字段在**响应**里总会出现，所以 schema 把它们标为必填，生成的类型不会处处是 `?`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1924":{"id":"/docs/development-api-211","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#从-schema-生成-typescript","content":"`separate_input_output_schemas=False`：大多数模型只生成一个 schema，而不是 `-Input`/`-Output` 两份。FastAPI 仍把 `Dataset`、`FitSettings`、`SpeakerEntry` 拆成两份，`api/types.ts` 读取 `-Output` 形状、发送时用 `-Input`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1925":{"id":"/docs/development-api-212","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#从-schema-生成-typescript","content":"事件 schema 用序列化模式生成，但事件类里带默认值的字段在 TypeScript 中仍可能是可选的；`api/types.ts` 中的注释记录了这一点（服务器实际总会发送）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1926":{"id":"/docs/development-api-213","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#静态页面","content":"`api/static.py`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1927":{"id":"/docs/development-api-214","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#静态页面","content":"`web_dist_dir()` 通过 `rvc_next.webui.__path__` 定位 `dist/`，而不是相对当前目录或写死的路径，所以源码检出与安装后的 wheel 都能找到。`dist/` 被 git 忽略，作为包数据（`pyproject.toml` 的 `\"rvc_next.webui\" = [\"dist/**/*\"]`）由 `scripts/build_wheel.py` 构建后打进 wheel。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1928":{"id":"/docs/development-api-215","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#静态页面","content":"`SPAStaticFiles` 对 `assets/` 下的文件发 `Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable`（Vite 产物文件名含内容哈希，可以永久缓存），其余文件（主要是 `index.html`）发 `no-cache`，保证升级后浏览器拿到新的入口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1929":{"id":"/docs/development-api-216","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#静态页面","content":"未知路径只在请求 `Accept` 含 `text/html` 时回落到 `index.html`。拼错的资源或 API 路径因此仍然得到 404，而不是一页 HTML（这修正了 InvokeAI 的做法里“任何路径都回 index.html”的问题）。前端用 hash 路由，正常导航本就不需要回落。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1930":{"id":"/docs/development-api-217","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#启动端口与-server_ready","content":"`rvc-next webui`（`cli/commands/webui.py`）的顺序：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1931":{"id":"/docs/development-api-218","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#启动端口与-server_ready","content":"`build_services(start_background=True)`；主机、端口、严格模式、是否打开浏览器取命令行参数，缺省时取 `server.*` 设置（默认 `127.0.0.1:7868`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1932":{"id":"/docs/development-api-219","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#启动端口与-server_ready","content":"绑定非回环地址时先警告（不要求 `server.access_token`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1933":{"id":"/docs/development-api-220","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#启动端口与-server_ready","content":"`bind_first_free_port(host, port, strict=…)` **自己绑定**监听套接字：从配置端口开始，遇到 `EADDRINUSE`/`EACCES`（以及 Windows 的对应码）就试下一个，最多 20 个、不超过 65535；`strict` 时只试一个；端口 0 交给操作系统挑。Windows 上设 `SO_EXCLUSIVEADDRUSE`（防止别的进程绑定同一地址端口），其他平台设 `SO_REUSEADDR`（`TIME_WAIT` 期间也能快速重启）。全部失败时退出（码 3）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1934":{"id":"/docs/development-api-221","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#启动端口与-server_ready","content":"`create_app(…, bound_host=host, bound_port=实际端口)`，`uvicorn.Server(config).run(sockets=[sock])`——把**同一个**套接字交给 uvicorn。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1935":{"id":"/docs/development-api-222","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#启动端口与-server_ready","content":"运行前写 `server.json`（`host`、`port`、`url`、`pid`，经临时文件原子替换），向 stdout 打印 `SERVER_READY url=http://…`，按设置延时 0.8 s 打开浏览器；退出时只删除自己写的 `server.json`（比较 `pid`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1936":{"id":"/docs/development-api-223","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#启动端口与-server_ready","content":"InvokeAI 先 `connect` 探测端口，再在服务加载完后让 uvicorn 绑定。探测只能发现“有人在监听”的端口，Windows 的保留端口段这类“没人监听但绑不上”的情况会被误判为空闲；探测和绑定之间还有一整段启动时间，别的进程可以抢占。直接绑定是唯一可靠的答案，而把测试过的套接字原样交给 uvicorn，就不存在空档。`SERVER_READY` 一行和 `server.json` 则让启动器、脚本和其他程序得知端口变化——日志里的警告对机器不可读。`--strict-port` 用于端口映射固定的部署（反向代理、容器），那里悄悄换端口只会掩盖问题。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1937":{"id":"/docs/development-api-224","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#启动端口与-server_ready","content":"`read_runtime_file()` 会检查 `pid` 是否存活，过期的文件视为不存在。任务服务在启动时也借助它判断数据目录是否已被另一个存活的服务器占用（见核心服务）。开发模式下 `scripts/dev.py dev` 以 `--no-open --strict-port` 启动 API，并让 Vite 通过 `RVC_NEXT_BACKEND` 代理过去（见 Web UI）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1938":{"id":"/docs/development-api-225","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#新增一个接口","content":"在核心层写方法，参数与返回值是 `Record`；需要的错误用 `core/errors.py` 中已有的类。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1939":{"id":"/docs/development-api-226","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#新增一个接口","content":"在对应的 `api/routers/<资源>.py` 加路由：写 `operation_id`，签名用 `ServicesDep`，涉及揭示文件时加 `dependencies=[LocalDep]`；上传用 `spool` + `read_chunks` 并声明 `openapi_extra=RAW_BODY`。固定路径放在通配路由之前。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1940":{"id":"/docs/development-api-227","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#新增一个接口","content":"长操作返回 `Job`，进度靠事件；新的推送需要时在 `core/events/models.py` 加 `EventBase` 子类（它会自动进入 OpenAPI 和 `ServerEvents`），并在前端 `api/socket.ts` 处理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1941":{"id":"/docs/development-api-228","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#新增一个接口","content":"若 CLI 也要提供同样的操作，调用同一个核心方法（见命令行实现）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1942":{"id":"/docs/development-api-229","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#新增一个接口","content":"运行 `python scripts/dev.py typegen` 并提交 `schema.d.ts`（参数模型变了还有 `paramSpecs.ts`）；在 `tests/api/test_api.py` 用 `TestClient` 覆盖错误映射与权限。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1943":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","type":"page","content":"整体架构","breadcrumbs":["RVC Next 文档","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-architecture","locale":"zh-CN"},"1944":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-0","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture","content":"本页给出 RVC Next 的全貌：包结构与分层规则、服务怎样被组装、哪些工作在哪个进程里运行、一个请求从浏览器到引擎再回来的路径，以及贯穿各层的几样基础设施：错误、设置、事件、数据库和数据目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1945":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-1","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-architecture#分层","content":"分层","locale":"zh-CN"},"1946":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-2","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-architecture#分层规则及其测试","content":"分层规则及其测试","locale":"zh-CN"},"1947":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-3","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-architecture#一个操作一个核心方法","content":"一个操作，一个核心方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"1948":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-4","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-architecture#组装build_services","content":"组装：`build_services()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1949":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-5","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-architecture#进程模型","content":"进程模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"1950":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-6","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-architecture#worker-协议","content":"worker 协议","locale":"zh-CN"},"1951":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-7","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-architecture#一个请求的路径","cont