ocs/development-architecture#分层规则及其测试","content":"`cli`、`core`、`version`、`logger`、`api`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1979":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-35","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#分层规则及其测试","content":"typer、click、rich、pydantic、uvicorn","locale":"zh-CN"},"1980":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-36","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#分层规则及其测试","content":"另有两个子进程测试：导入 `rvc_next.core.context` 不得加载 `torch`；导入 `rvc_next.cli.app` 既不得加载 `torch` 也不得加载 `fastapi`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1981":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-37","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#分层规则及其测试","content":"这些规则各有用意：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1982":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-38","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#分层规则及其测试","content":"**引擎不知道应用的存在。** 它不导入核心层、任何 Web / CLI 框架或 pydantic；参数用冻结的 dataclass（`VoiceParams`、`StreamParams`）表示。这样 worker 子进程和测试可以直接驱动引擎，而核心层的 `Record` 模型是唯一的 API 形状。原版的问题之一正是引擎返回 Gradio 的更新字典和中文状态文字，离开 UI 就无法使用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1983":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-39","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#分层规则及其测试","content":"**核心层不导入框架，也不直接导入 torch。** 它对引擎的 51 处导入全部写在函数内部。结果是 `rvc-next version`、`config`、`--help` 这类命令不付出加载 torch 的代价，第二个测试守着这一点。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1984":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-40","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#分层规则及其测试","content":"**`sounddevice` 和 `pymss` 被关在各自的目录里**，设备访问和分离库的变动不会扩散。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1985":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-41","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#分层规则及其测试","content":"**`protocol` 只用标准库**，因为它被两侧共享：服务端和 worker 子进程都要能导入它而不带上对方的依赖。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1986":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-42","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#分层规则及其测试","content":"**`api` 和 `cli` 从不导入 `engine`。** 唯一的跨端导入是 `cli` 的 `webui` 命令在函数内导入 `rvc_next.api.app.create_app` 来启动服务器，规则表为此允许 `cli → api` 和 `uvicorn`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1987":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-43","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#一个操作一个核心方法","content":"每个操作在核心层恰好有一个方法，接收并返回 `Record` 模型（`core/record.py`）。路由和命令只做三件事：解析输入、调用这个方法、整理输出。以转换为例，`api/routers/convert.py` 的路由体只是检查服务器路径的访问权限、拒绝只属于命令行的字段，然后 `return services.conversion.convert(body)`；CLI 的 `convert` 命令构造同一个 `ConvertRequest`，调用同一个方法（`foreground=True`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1988":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-44","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#一个操作一个核心方法","content":"所以 API 返回的 JSON 和 CLI 的 `--json` 输出形状完全相同：`tests/cli/test_cli.py` 里的 `test_model_json_matches_api_shape` 直接比较 `rvc-next model list --json` 与 `GET /api/v1/models` 的结果。`Record` 设置了 `json_schema_serialization_defaults_required`，带默认值的字段在输出模式中标为必填，生成的 TypeScript 类型因此与服务器实际发送的内容一致。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1989":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-45","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#组装build_services","content":"`core/context.py` 的 `build_services()` 一次性按依赖顺序构建所有服务，返回一个 `Services` dataclass：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1990":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-46","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#组装build_services","content":"字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"1991":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-47","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#组装build_services","content":"类","locale":"zh-CN"},"