,"type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-assets#新增或更新资源","content":"新增或更新资源","locale":"zh-CN"},"2179":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-10","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets","content":"「资源」（asset）指 RVC Next 运行时需要、但不随 Python 包分发的模型文件：HuBERT、RMVPE（及其 ONNX 版）、FCPE、CREPE、训练底模和人声分离权重。另有一组可下载的示例音色。本页说明资源目录 `catalog.json` 的格式、两个下载仓库、下载与校验的实现，以及增改资源的流程。核心层里 `AssetService` 如何被其他服务调用见 核心服务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2180":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-11","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#资源目录-catalogjson","content":"`rvc_next/core/assets/catalog.json` 作为包数据随包分发（`pyproject.toml` 的 `package-data`），由 `core/assets/service.py:load_catalog()` 读入并校验成 `core/assets/models.py` 里的记录。顶层有三个键：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2181":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-12","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#资源目录-catalogjson","content":"记录","locale":"zh-CN"},"2182":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-13","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#资源目录-catalogjson","content":"字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"2183":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-14","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#资源目录-catalogjson","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"2184":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-15","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#资源目录-catalogjson","content":"`Repository`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2185":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-16","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#资源目录-catalogjson","content":"`id`（`rvc-model` 或 `official`）、`repo`、`revision`、`title`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2186":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-17","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#资源目录-catalogjson","content":"Hugging Face