ocs/development-assets#现有资源","content":"训练底模，每个资源 4 个文件（有无音高各一对 G/D）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2227":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-58","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#现有资源","content":"`separation-<model>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2228":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-59","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#现有资源","content":"separation","locale":"zh-CN"},"2229":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-60","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#现有资源","content":"`pymss_weights/<checkpoint>.ckpt`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2230":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-61","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#现有资源","content":"`dereverb`、`dereverb-aggressive`、`vocals`、`vocals-aggressive`、`karaoke` 五个分离模型；YAML 随包分发（`engine/separate/configs/`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2231":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-62","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#现有资源","content":"共 17 个资源、37 个文件，约 4.9 GiB。SwiftF0 的 165 KB 权重不是资源：它随包分发（`engine/f0/data/swift_f0.pt`）。底模按「版本 × 采样率」拆分而不是计划里的 `pretrained-v1`/`pretrained-v2` 两个：训练某一采样率只需下载 4 个文件，而不是 12 个（AGENTS.md §8）。分离权重放在 `pymss_weights/` 而非计划中的 `separation/`，同样是为了与原版布局一致。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2232":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-63","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#现有资源","content":"`ids_for_group()` 决定 `rvc-next assets download --group` 的内容：按目录中的 `group` 取资源，`all` 取全部，都不含只给 DirectML 用的 `rmvpe-onnx`（按需下载）。`inference`（不带参数时的默认）因此是 `hubert`、`rmvpe`、`fcpe`、`crepe` 和 `crepe-tiny`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2233":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-64","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#现有资源","content":"`paths.assets_dir` 可以直接指向已有的原版 RVC 安装里的 `assets/` 文件夹，HuBERT、RMVPE、底模和 `pymss_weights` 都在同样的相对路径上，什么都不必再下载一遍。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2234":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-65","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#两个下载仓库","content":"仓库 id","locale":"zh-CN"},"2235":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-66","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#两个下载仓库","content":"Hugging Face 仓库","locale":"zh-CN"},"2236":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-67","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#两个下载仓库","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"2237":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-68","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#两个下载仓库","content":"`rvc-model`（默认）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2238":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-69","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#两个下载仓库","content":"licyk/rvc-model","locale":"zh-CN"},"2239":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-70","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#两个下载仓库","content":"RVC Next 用到的每个文件，按类别整理，外加示例音色和 `manifest.json`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2240":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-71","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#两个下载仓库","content":"`official`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2241":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-72","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#两个下载仓库","content":"lj1995/VoiceConversionWebUI","locale":"zh-CN"},"2242":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-73","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#两个下载仓库","content":"官方 RVC 仓库；没有示例音色，也没有 FCPE 和 CREPE 权重","locale":"zh-CN"},"2243":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-74","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#两个下载仓库","content":"两个设置共同决定下载地址（`AssetService.url()`）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2244":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-75","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#两个下载仓库","content":"`downloads.repository`（`rvc-model` 或 `official`）选**仓库**。某个文件在所选仓库里没有（`sources` 里没有这个键）时，自动改用列出的另一个仓库——示例音色、FCPE 和 CREPE 因此总是从 rvc-model 下载，即使选的是官方仓库。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2245":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-76","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#两个下载仓库","content":"`downloads.source` 选**端点**：`huggingface`（`https://huggingface.co`）、`hf-mirror`（`https://hf-mirror.com`）或 `custom`（`downloads.endpoint`）。两个仓库都经由同一个端点访问。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2246":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-77","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#两个下载仓库","content":"最终 URL 为 `<端点>/<repo>/resolve/<revision>/<sources[仓库]>`。两个仓库的 `revision` 目前都是 `main`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2247":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-78","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#两个下载仓库","content":"**内容特征模型**（分组 `embedder`，资源 `embedder-<名称>`，位于 `embedders/<名称>/`）是 Applio 音色可能使用的类 HuBERT 模型（`engine/features/embedders.py`），来自 `hf:IAHispano/Applio`（上游，固定修订版本）；配置文件的哈希由该修订版本计算，权重的哈希来自 LFS。`assets download --group all` 不包含它们。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2248":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-79","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#两个下载仓库","content":"**社区底模**（分组 `community`，21 个资源 `community-<名称>-<采样率>`）来自作者自己的仓库：每个这样的仓库都以 `\"upstream\": true` 和固定的修订版本（一个提交）列在 `repositories` 中，其文件只有这一个来源，`repositories()` 不把上游仓库列入设置中的选项。列表来自 Applio 维护的那一份（`IAHispano/Applio/pretrains.json`），每个 G 都已检查是所标采样率的 v2 音高生成器，每个文件的 SHA-256 取自该修订版本的 Hub LFS 元数据；仓库已不公开的 DMR 未收录。资源的 `base_model` 给出名称、采样率、版本、音高引导、仓库声明的许可（常常没有）和主页；`BaseModelService` 把它们列为 `source: \"community\"`。它们是完整的训练检查点（G 约 440 MB，D 约 860 MB，含优化器状态），所以 `assets download --group all` 不包含它们。用 PyTorch 较新的权重归一化名称（`parametrizations.weight.original0/1`，例如 Ov2Super 的 32k）保存的检查点，读取时会改名为 RVC 的 `weight_g`/`weight_v`（`checkpoint.legacy_weight_norm`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2249":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-80","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#两个下载仓库","content":"设立 rvc-model 的理由：官方仓库是早期版本留下的平铺结构，混杂着代码、Windows 可执行文件和几十 GB 的发行包；有些模型（示例音色）只存在于 `.7z` 发行包内部，无法单独下载（见下文）。rvc-model 把需要的文件原样复制出来按类别放好，任何一个文件都能单独取。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2250":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-81","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#rvc-model-的布局","content":"目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"2251":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-82","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#rvc-model-的布局","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"2252":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-83","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#rvc-model-的布局","content":"来源","locale":"zh-CN"},"2253":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-84","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#rvc-model-的布局","content":"`hubert/hubert_base/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2254":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-85","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#rvc-model-的布局","content":"HuBERT（transformers 格式）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2255":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-86","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#rvc-model-的布局","content":"官方仓库 `hubert_base/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2256":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-87","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#rvc-model-的布局","content":"`rmvpe/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2257":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-88","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#rvc-model-的布局","content":"`rmvpe.pt`、`rmvpe.onnx`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2258":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-89","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#rvc-model-的布局","content":"官方仓库根目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"2259":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-90","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#rvc-model-的布局","content":"`fcpe/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2260":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-91","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#rvc-model-的布局","content":"`fcpe_c_v001.pt`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2261":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-92","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#rvc-model-的布局","content":"torchfcpe 0.0.4 包内自带的权重（RVC 通过 `spawn_bundled_infer_model` 使用的那一个）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2262":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-93","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#rvc-model-的布局","content":"`crepe/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2263":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-94","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#rvc-model-的布局","content":"`full.pth`、`tiny.pth`、`LICENSE-CREPE.txt`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2264":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-95","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#rvc-model-的布局","content":"torchcrepe 0.0.24 包内自带的权重（MIT）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2265":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-96","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#rvc-model-的布局","content":"`pretrained/v1/`、`pretrained/v2/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2266":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-97","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#rvc-model-的布局","content":"各采样率的 `[f0]G`、`[f0]D`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2267":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-98","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#rvc-model-的布局","content":"官方仓库 `pretrained/`、`pretrained_v2/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2268":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-99","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#rvc-model-的布局","content":"`separation/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2269":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-100","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#rvc-model-的布局","content":"五个分离检查点","locale":"zh-CN"},"2270":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-101","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#rvc-model-的布局","content":"官方仓库 `pymss_weights/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2271":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-102","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#rvc-model-的布局","content":"`voices/<name>/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2272":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-103","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#rvc-model-的布局","content":"示例音色 `.pth` 与 `.index`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2273":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-104","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#rvc-model-的布局","content":"从官方 `RVC*.7z` 发行包中提取","locale":"zh-CN"},"2274":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-105","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#rvc-model-的布局","content":"仓库根目录另有官方的许可文件和 `manifest.json`。`manifest.json` 为每个文件记录大小、SHA-256 和上游路径（它来自官方仓库的哪个路径、哪个发行包，或 torchfcpe），是 rvc-model 自身的清单。约定：向 rvc-model 上传文件时同步更新 `manifest.json`，`catalog.json` 中的大小、哈希和 `rvc-model` 路径从 manifest 生成。本仓库里没有提交执行这一步的脚本；改动 `catalog.json` 时必须保证它与 manifest 一致。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2275":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-106","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#rvc-model-的布局","content":"所有从官方仓库复制的文件都未改动；目录中的哈希曾对照完整下载的官方仓库（修订 `e6d0c1a`）重新计算并全部吻合。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2276":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-107","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#rvc-model-的布局","content":"FCPE 曾通过 torchfcpe 包使用，而 torchfcpe 依赖 torchaudio 并内置了 43 MB 的模型。现在推理路径已移植到 `engine/f0/fcpe_model.py`（见 与原版的一致性），权重则作为 `fcpe` 资源下载，所以 RVC Next 不再依赖 torchfcpe 或 torchaudio。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2277":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-108","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#下载断点续传与校验","content":"下载是 `download` 任务（资源 `io`，并发容量 4），由 `AssetService.download(ids, group, verify_only, foreground)` 提交；命令行以 `foreground=True` 在前台执行。每个资源是任务的一个步骤。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2278":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-109","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#下载断点续传与校验","content":"**跳过已有文件**：大小与目录一致的文件不重新下载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2279":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-110","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#下载断点续传与校验","content":"**断点续传**（`_fetch()`）：下载写入 `<文件名>.part`；已有部分时发 `Range: bytes=<已有>-`。服务器回 200 而不是 206 时从头写；回 416 且 `.part` 已完整时视为完成；`.part` 比目标大时删除重下。最多重试 4 次（`RETRIES`），退避 1、2、4…秒（上限 10 秒）。完成后检查大小，再把 `.part` 改名为正式文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2280":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-111","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#下载断点续传与校验","content":"**校验**：`downloads.verify_checksums`（默认开）或 `verify_only` 时计算 SHA-256 并与目录比较。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2281":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-112","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#下载断点续传与校验","content":"**校验缓存**：结果按 `<path>|<size>|<mtime_ns>` 为键存入数据目录的 `assets-verified.json`。文件大小或修改时间变化后缓存自然失效。这样列出资源状态时不必每次重算几 GB 的哈希，又能在文件被替换时重新显示为「未校验」。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2282":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-113","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#下载断点续传与校验","content":"**进度**：进度按字节计算；`ctx.transfer(done, total)` 让任务卡片显示速度与剩余时间（见 核心服务）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2283":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-114","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#下载断点续传与校验","content":"失败的资源记为 `failed`，任务以 `RvcNextError` 结束，`detail.assets` 列出失败的 id。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2284":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-115","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#状态","content":"`AssetService.status(id)` 只看磁盘和校验缓存，不发网络请求：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2285":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-116","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#状态","content":"状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"2286":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-117","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#状态","content":"条件","locale":"zh-CN"},"2287":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-118","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#状态","content":"`downloading`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2288":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-119","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#状态","content":"有下载任务正在处理它","locale":"zh-CN"},"2289":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-120","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#状态","content":"`installed`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2290":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-121","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#状态","content":"每个文件都在且大小正确，且没有校验失败记录","locale":"zh-CN"},"2291":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-122","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#状态","content":"`corrupt`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2292":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-123","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#状态","content":"文件齐全，但某个文件的校验失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"2293":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-124","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#状态","content":"`partial`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2294":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-125","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#状态","content":"部分文件在（或有部分字节）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2295":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-126","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#状态","content":"`missing`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2296":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-127","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#状态","content":"一个字节都没有","locale":"zh-CN"},"2297":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-128","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#状态","content":"`verified` 为 `True`（全部校验通过）、`False`（有失败）或 `None`（有文件尚未校验）。`is_installed()` 把 `corrupt` 也算作已安装——文件可能只是被用户换成了别的版本，由界面提示而不是阻止使用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2298":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-129","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#状态","content":"`delete(id)` 删除资源的全部文件和 `.part`（下载中拒绝，409）并清理校验缓存；官方底模的删除只调用 `delete_files()` 删它自己的一对 G/D，该资源随之显示为 `partial`。状态变化时发布 `assets_changed`（载荷为全部资源状态）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2299":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-130","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#示例音色","content":"`voice_catalog()`（`GET /models/catalog`，`rvc-next model catalog`）列出示例音色，并标出已经下载进音色库的那个（`installed_voice_id`，按音色 `voice.json` 里的 `catalog_id` 匹配，DB 迁移 2 为此添加了 `voice_models.catalog_id` 列）。`download_voices(ids, all_missing)`（`POST /models/catalog/download`，`rvc-next model download`）提交一个请求为 `{\"voices\": [...]}` 的 `download` 任务：把 `.pth` 和 `.index` 下载到 `uploads/` 下的临时目录，检查 SHA-256（这里总是检查，不受 `verify_checksums` 影响），再以 `catalog_id` 为来源加入音色库。示例音色就是普通的库音色，删除后目录里会重新显示为可下载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2300":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-131","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#示例音色","content":"id","locale":"zh-CN"},"2301":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-132","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#示例音色","content":"版本","locale":"zh-CN"},"2302":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-133","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#示例音色","content":"采样率","locale":"zh-CN"},"2303":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-134","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#示例音色","content":"索引","locale":"zh-CN"},"2304":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-135","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#示例音色","content":"`kikiv1`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2305":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-136","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#示例音色","content":"v1","locale":"zh-CN"},"2306":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-137","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#示例音色","content":"40k","locale":"zh-CN"},"2307":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-138","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#示例音色","content":"有","locale":"zh-CN"},"2308":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-139","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#示例音色","content":"`keruanv1`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2309":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-140","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#示例音色","content":"v1","locale":"zh-CN"},"2310":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-141","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#示例音色","content":"40k","locale":"zh-CN"},"2311":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-142","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devel