page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#只存在于官方发行包中的模型","content":"原样上传到 rvc-model 的 `voices/<name>/`，进入 `catalog.json` 的 `voices`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2332":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-163","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#只存在于官方发行包中的模型","content":"没有对应音色的索引","locale":"zh-CN"},"2333":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-164","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#只存在于官方发行包中的模型","content":"`anchun`、`keqing`、`mi-test`、`mi-test-v1`、`test`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2334":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-165","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#只存在于官方发行包中的模型","content":"不用：它们的音色从未发布","locale":"zh-CN"},"2335":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-166","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#只存在于官方发行包中的模型","content":"被取代或重复的权重","locale":"zh-CN"},"2336":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-167","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#只存在于官方发行包中的模型","content":"旧版 `rmvpe.pt`（2023-07 之前的权重）；`model_bs_roformer_ep_317` 的另一份存档","locale":"zh-CN"},"2337":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-168","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#只存在于官方发行包中的模型","content":"不用：仓库自身的文件取代了它们","locale":"zh-CN"},"2338":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-169","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#只存在于官方发行包中的模型","content":"不是模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"2339":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-170","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#只存在于官方发行包中的模型","content":"`Synthesizer_inputs.pth`、`hubert_inputs.pth`（导出 ONNX 用的样例输入）、`logs/mute/*.spec.pt`（训练加载器生成的频谱缓存）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2340":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-171","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#只存在于官方发行包中的模型","content":"不用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2341":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-172","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#只存在于官方发行包中的模型","content":"包内其余所有模型文件都与仓库里的某个文件逐字节相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2342":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-173","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#只存在于官方发行包中的模型","content":"为什么不直接从发行包下载：这些 `.7z` 是固实压缩，音色与其他资源共享 1.3–1.9 GB 的压缩块，取一个文件至少要下载并解压它所在的整个块。这正是 rvc-model 存在的主要理由之一。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2343":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-174","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#只存在于官方发行包中的模型","content":"仓库中其余未进入目录的文件及原因：`mute.zip`（内容相同的静音样本已作为包数据随包分发，见 `engine/train/data/mute/`）；`hubert_base.pt`（fairseq 检查点，RVC Next 用 transformers 格式）；`pretrained_v0/`（早期 v1 生成器，没有任何地方选择它们）；`uvr5_weights/` 等（UVR5 分离，所移植的分支已换成 PyMSS）；`weights/白菜357k.pt`（RVC 之前的模型格式，无法加载）；`ffmpeg.exe`/`ffprobe.exe`（RVC Next 用 PyAV 解码）；`RVCRealtime-Win64VST.zip`（实时 VST 插件，与将来的 VST 适配相关）；以及早期版本的代码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2344":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-175","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#新增或更新资源","content":"把文件上传到 rvc-model 的对应类别目录，并更新它的 `manifest.json`（大小、SHA-256、上游路径）。若官方仓库也有该文件，记下它在官方仓库里的路径。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2345":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-176","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#新增或更新资源","content":"在 `catalog.json` 的 `assets` 中新增或修改条目：`path` 用原版 `assets/` 布局下的相对路径；`sources` 至少列出一个仓库；`size` 与 `sha256` 必须与 manifest 一致——下载以大小判断完成、以哈希判断损坏。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2346":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-177","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#新增或更新资源","content":"人声分离权重还要同步 `engine/separate/presets.py` 的 `MODELS`（检查点名、YAML 名、大小、SHA-256、主副音轨）、`core/separation/presets.json` 中预设的 `assets`，并把 YAML 放进 `engine/separate/configs/`。`tests/engine/test_separate_presets.py` 检查预设与 `MODELS` 的一致性，但不检查 `MODELS` 与 `catalog.json` 的大小和哈希是否相同，需要人工核对。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2347":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-178","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#新增或更新资源","content":"新资源若是某个功能的前提，在相应服务的 `require()` 调用里加上它的 id（例如 `ConversionService.required_assets()`、`LiveService._require_assets()`、`TrainingService._preflight()`），界面会自动通过 `AssetGate` 提供下载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2348":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-179","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#新增或更新资源","content":"示例音色加在 `voices` 中，`id` 一经发布不要再改：已下载音色靠它与目录条目对应。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2349":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-180","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#新增或更新资源","content":"运行 `python scripts/dev.py check`。`tests/core/test_assets.py` 用模拟传输覆盖续传、校验、仓库回退、删除与示例音色导入。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2350":{"id":"/docs/development-cli","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","type":"page","content":"命令行实现","breadcrumbs":["RVC Next 文档","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-cli","locale":"zh-CN"},"2351":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-0","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-cli#结构","content":"结构","locale":"zh-CN"},"2352":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-1","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-cli#集中注册","content":"集中注册","locale":"zh-CN"},"2353":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-2","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-cli#工厂与自定义类","content":"工厂与自定义类","locale":"zh-CN"},"2354":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-3","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-cli#错误与退出码","content":"错误与退出码","locale":"zh-CN"},"2355":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-4","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-cli#输出--json-等于-api-的-json","content":"输出：`--json` 等于 API 的 JSON","locale":"zh-CN"},"2356":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-5","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-cli#服务与前台任务","content":"服务与前台任务","locale":"zh-CN"},"2357":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-6","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-cli#音色参数","content":"音色参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"2358":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-7","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-cli#webui-命令","content":"`webui` 命令","locale":"zh-CN"},"2359":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-8","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-cli#新增一个命令","content":"新增一个命令","locale":"zh-CN"},"2360":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-9","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli","content":"`rvc-next` 命令行是核心层上的一层薄壳：每个命令解析参数、调用一个核心方法、把结果打印成表格或 JSON。本页讲它是怎样组织的，以及新增命令时要遵守的规则。每个命令的选项说明见命令参考，设置与环境变量见配置与环境变量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2361":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-10","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#结构","content":"文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"2362":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-11","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#结构","content":"职责","locale":"zh-CN"},"2363":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-12","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#结构","content":"`cli/app.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2364":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-13","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#结构","content":"`get_app()` 注册全部命令和命令组；`main()` 运行它并统一处理错误","locale":"zh-CN"},"2365":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-14","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#结构","content":"`cli/factory.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2366":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-15","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#结构","content":"`typer_factory()` 与自定义的 Typer 类；对 Typer 私有模块 `typer._click` 的导入只出现在这里","locale":"zh-CN"},"2367":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-16","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#结构","content":"`cli/commands/*.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2368":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-17","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#结构","content":"命令函数，都是普通函数，不带装饰器","locale":"zh-CN"},"2369":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-18","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#结构","content":"`cli/output.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2370":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-19","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#结构","content":"`open_services()`、`print_json()`、`print_table()`、`human_size()` 等","locale":"zh-CN"},"2371":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-20","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#结构","content":"`cli/params.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2372":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-21","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#结构","content":"`convert`、`live run`、`preset save` 共用的音色参数选项（`ParamOptions`）与 `build_params()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2373":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-22","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#结构","content":"`cli/progress.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2374":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-23","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#结构","content":"前台任务的 Rich 进度条（`job_progress()`）与结束处理（`finish()`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2375":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-24","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#结构","content":"入口有两个：`pyproject.toml` 的 `[project.scripts]` 把 `rvc-next` 指向 `rvc_next.cli.app:main`，`rvc_next/__main__.py` 让 `python -m rvc_next` 调用同一个 `main()`（`dev.py dev` 就是这样启动 API 的）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2376":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-25","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#结构","content":"这套结构来自 ani2xcur-cli，经 SD Model Hub 沿用下来。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2377":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-26","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#集中注册","content":"`get_app()` 是整个命令行的目录：每个命令都在这里用 `app.command(help=..., name=...)(函数)` 注册，命令名和帮助文字在注册时给出，而不是取自函数名或文档字符串（`live_test_tone` 注册为 `test-tone`，`model_list` 注册为 `list`）。命令组是另一个 `typer_factory()` 创建的应用，用 `add_typer(..., name=...)` 挂上去，最深三层（`model index assign`）。应用在函数里构建，导入模块时不创建任何东西。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2378":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-27","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#集中注册","content":"当前的命令树：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2379":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-28","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#集中注册","content":"`tests/cli/test_cli.py` 的 `EXPECTED_TREE` 是这棵树的快照，`test_command_tree` 逐层比较。增删命令而不更新快照，测试就会失败，这是有意的：命令行是对外接口，改动它应当是显式的决定。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2380":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-29","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#工厂与自定义类","content":"`typer_factory(help)` 让每个应用和命令组拥有相同的设置：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2381":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-30","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#工厂与自定义类","content":"设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"2382":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-31","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#工厂与自定义类","content":"效果","locale":"zh-CN"},"2383":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-32","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#工厂与自定义类","content":"`add_completion=True`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2384":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-33","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#工厂与自定义类","content":"支持 shell 补全","locale":"zh-CN"},"2385":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-34","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#工厂与自定义类","content":"`no_args_is_help=True`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2386":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-35","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#工厂与自定义类","content":"不带参数运行应用或命令组时显示帮助","locale":"zh-CN"},"2387":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-36","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#工厂与自定义类","content":"`cls=AlphabeticalMixedGroup`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2388":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-37","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#工厂与自定义类","content":"命令组带 `--debug`，并按字母顺序列出子命令和子组","locale":"zh-CN"},"2389":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-38","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#工厂与自定义类","content":"`rich_markup_mode=None`、`rich_help_panel=None`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2390":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-39","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#工厂与自定义类","content":"帮助文字是纯文本","locale":"zh-CN"},"2391":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-40","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#工厂与自定义类","content":"`pretty_exceptions_enable=False`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2392":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-41","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#工厂与自定义类","content":"异常交给 `main()` 处理","locale":"zh-CN"},"2393":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-42","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#工厂与自定义类","content":"`--debug` 在任何层级都可用（`rvc-next --debug version`、`rvc-next model --debug list`、`rvc-next model index --debug --help`），而没有任何命令函数声明 `debug` 参数。它由三部分实现：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2394":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-43","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#工厂与自定义类","content":"`_make_debug_option()` 构造一个 `is_eager=True`、`expose_value=False` 的标志选项，回调把 `rvc_next` 日志器设为 `DEBUG`。急切求值保证它在命令体之前生效；不暴露值保证它不会传给命令函数；`ctx.resilient_parsing`（shell 补全时）为真时回调什么也不做。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2395":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-44","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#工厂与自定义类","content":"`DebugTyperCommand` 和 `AlphabeticalMixedGroup` 在 `__init__` 里把这个选项插到参数表最前面（已有则不重复）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2396":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-45","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#工厂与自定义类","content":"`DebugOptionTyper.command()` 默认使用 `DebugTyperCommand`；命令组的类则由工厂的 `cls=` 指定。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2397":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-46","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#工厂与自定义类","content":"`test_debug_everywhere` 覆盖这三种位置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2398":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-47","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#错误与退出码","content":"领域错误（`core/errors.py`）各自带有 `exit_code`，完整对照表见整体架构。命令行在两个地方把它们变成退出码：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2399":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-48","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#错误与退出码","content":"**`DebugTyperCommand.invoke()`** 捕获 `RvcNextError`，记录 `e.message`，若 `detail.assets` 非空再提示 `Install with: rvc-next assets download <ids>`，然后 `raise typer.Exit(e.exit_code)`。放在命令类里而不只放在 `main()` 里，是因为测试用 `typer.testing.CliRunner` 直接调用 Click 命令、不经过 `main()`；这样测试看到的退出码与用户看到的一致（`test_missing_asset_exit_code` 断言缺少资源时退出码为 7，`model info nope` 为 2）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2400":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-49","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#错误与退出码","content":"**`main()`** 兜底：`typer.Exit` 原样退出，`Abort` 为 1，`ClickException` 显示后用其退出码（参数错误为 2），`RvcNextError` 用其退出码，`KeyboardInterrupt` 为 130，其他异常打印堆栈后为 1。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2401":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-50","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#错误与退出码","content":"前台任务失败时，错误不是以异常形式出现的，而是记录在 `Job.error` 里。`cli/progress.py` 的 `finish(job)` 负责收尾：`completed` 直接返回；`cancelled` 以 130 退出；失败时打印消息，按 `job.error.code` 找到对应错误类的退出码退出（`busy` 为 3，`invalid_model` 为 4）。所以 `rvc-next convert` 缺少 RMVPE 时，无论错误出在提交前的校验还是任务执行中，退出码都是 7。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2402":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-51","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#错误与退出码","content":"少数命令自行决定退出码，都与领域错误的约定一致：`webui` 的证书文件不存在时退出 4、端口不可用时退出 3；`model import` 的导入计划有歧义时打印计划并退出 3；`live check` / `live run` 遇到设备问题时退出 8。只属于命令行的参数校验用 `typer.BadParameter`（退出码 2）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2403":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-52","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#输出--json-等于-api-的-json","content":"每个列出或展示数据的命令都有 `--json`。`print_json()` 用 `model_dump(mode=\"json\")` 序列化 `Record`（列表和字典递归处理，`Path` 转字符串），所以输出与 API 返回的 JSON 完全相同。这不是靠约定维持的：命令和路由调用的是同一个核心方法，返回同一个 `Record`。`test_model_json_matches_api_shape` 用 `rvc-next model list --json` 与 `GET /api/v1/models` 的结果直接比较。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2404":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-53","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#输出--json-等于-api-的-json","content":"没有 `--json` 时用 `print_table()` 画 Rich 表格。日志（包括错误消息）经 `rvc_next/logger.py` 的 `RichHandler` 写到 **stderr**，数据写到 **stdout**，所以 `rvc-next model list --json | jq` 不会被日志打断。日志级别默认 `INFO`，可用 `RVC_NEXT_LOG_LEVEL` 或 `--debug` 调整。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2405":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-54","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#服务与前台任务","content":"命令通过 `with open_services() as services:` 取得服务。它调用 `build_services()` 时**不启动后台线程**：没有调度器、没有空闲卸载、不监管 Live worker。命令结束时服务被关闭。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2406":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-55","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#服务与前台任务","content":"长操作（转换、分离、训练、下载、合并、提取、建索引）在核心层都是任务。命令行用 `foreground=True` 调用核心方法，后者改走 `JobService.run_now()`：任务照样写入数据库、照样发布事件，但在**调用线程上**执行，Ctrl+C 会设置取消标志、取消引擎令牌并杀掉 worker 子进程，任务以 `cancelled` 结束。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2407":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-56","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#服务与前台任务","content":"`job_progress(services)` 订阅与 Web UI 相同的 `job_updated` / `job_log` 事件，在 stderr 上画一个临时的 Rich 进度条（\"标题 · 当前步骤\"），并把以 `error` 或 `Traceback` 开头的日志行标红打印。stderr 不是终端或使用了 `--json` 时不画进度条。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2408":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-57","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#服务与前台任务","content":"几个命令的特别之处：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2409":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-58","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#服务与前台任务","content":"**`jobs list` / `jobs show`** 读的是数据目录里共享的数据库，所以能看到一个正在运行的服务器的任务；SQLite 的 WAL 与 `busy_timeout` 让这种并发读安全。`jobs show --log` 按字节偏移分段读取任务日志。取消任务只能在 Web UI 中，或对前台命令按 Ctrl+C。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2410":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-59","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#服务与前台任务","content":"**`live run`** 在前台启动同一个 Live worker，每秒刷新四次一行状态（状态、负载 `infer_ms_p95 / block_ms`、延迟、电平），直到 Ctrl+C、`--seconds` 到时或出错。设备参数 `--input`、`--output`、`--monitor` 接受设备 id、名称或 `default`，先从新枚举的设备列表中解析。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2411":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-60","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#服务与前台任务","content":"**`webui`** 启动服务器，步骤见下文。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2412":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-61","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#音色参数","content":"音色参数可以写成音色 id、名称，或者 `.pth` 文件路径。给路径时，`convert` 用 `services.models.temporary()` 把它注册为一个**临时音色**（`tmp-…`，不出现在列表里），可以用 `--index` 附上索引；参数则从 `convert.default_params` 起步，而不是从音色的默认预设起步。`live run` 只接受库中的音色（`resolve(..., allow_path=False)`）：`LiveConfig` 以音色 id 指定音色，启动后这个 id 会作为 `live.last_voice` 存进设置，供下一次不带 `--voice` 的 `live run` 和 Web UI 恢复会话。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2413":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-62","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#音色参数","content":"`cli/params.py` 的 `ParamOptions` 定义了 `--speaker`、`--pitch`、`--formant`、`--f0`、`--index-rate`、`--protect`、`--rms-mix`、`--unvoiced`，范围与 `VoiceParamsModel` 一致。`build_params(base, **overrides)` 只把用户给出的选项盖在 `base`（音色的默认预设、`--preset` 指定的预设，或 Live 上次的参数）上，再交给 `VoiceParamsModel` 校验。这与 Web UI 的行为相同：选中一个音色就加载它的默认预设，所以同一个音色在转换和实时变声里听起来一样。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2414":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-63","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#webui-命令","content":"`cli/commands/webui.py` 是命令行唯一导入 API 层的地方（在函数内导入）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2415":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-64","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#webui-命令","content":"`--data-dir` 设置 `RVC_NEXT_DATA_DIR`，以便之后启动的 worker 子进程使用同一个数据目录；然后 `build_services(start_background=True)`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2416":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-65","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#webui-命令","content":"主机不是回环地址时发出警告（不要求访问令牌）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2417":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-66","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#webui-命令","content":"`bind_first_free_port(host, port, strict=...)` **先绑定套接字**，端口被占用时向上尝试（`--strict-port` 时直接失败，退出码 3）；实际端口与请求的不同时给出警告。绑定而不是试连接，是为了消除\"检查\"与\"真正绑定\"之间的空隙，也能识别 Windows 上被系统保留的端口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2418":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-67","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#webui-命令","content":"用 `create_app(services, bound_host=..., bound_port=...)` 建应用，写 `server.json`，在 stdout 打印一行 `SERVER_READY url=http://…`（供启动器等程序读取），需要时 0.8 秒后打开浏览器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2419":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-68","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#webui-命令","content":"`uvicorn.Server(...).run(sockets=[sock])` 在刚才绑定的套接字上服务；退出时删除 `server.json` 并关闭服务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2420":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-69","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#webui-命令","content":"详见 API 与事件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2421":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-70","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#新增一个命令","content":"**先有核心方法。** 命令要做的事如果核心层还没有对应的方法，先在相应服务里加一个，接收和返回 `Record` 模型。命令里不放业务逻辑，否则 API 和 Web UI 就得各写一遍。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2422":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-71","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#新增一个命令","content":"**在 `cli/commands/` 里写一个普通函数**，参数用 `Annotated[..., typer.Option(...)]` / `typer.Argument(...)` 声明，不加装饰器：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2423":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-72","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#新增一个命令","content":"**必填选项不写默认值**，并把这类参数排在有默认值的参数前面（Python 要求如此）。不要写 `= ...`：Typer 把没有默认值的参数视为必填，`...` 只是旧写法，而且它的类型与标注不符，ty 会报错。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2424":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-73","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#新增一个命令","content":"列出或展示数据的命令提供 `--json`，并直接打印核心方法返回的 `Record`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2425":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-74","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#新增一个命令","content":"长操作调用核心方法时传 `foreground=True`，用 `with job_progress(services, enabled=not json_output):` 包住，结束后调用 `finish(job)`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2426":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-75","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#新增一个命令","content":"领域错误直接抛出即可，`DebugTyperCommand` 会把它们变成退出码；只有命令行才有的参数问题用 `typer.BadParameter`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2427":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-76","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#新增一个命令","content":"**在 `cli/app.py` 的 `get_app()` 中注册**，给出 `name` 和 `help`；需要新命令组时用 `typer_factory(help=...)` 创建并 `add_typer`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2428":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-77","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#新增一个命令","content":"**更新 `tests/cli/test_cli.py` 的 `EXPECTED_TREE`**，并为命令写测试（用 `runner` fixture，它把数据目录、tiny 资源目录和 CPU 设备设在环境变量里）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2429":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-78","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#新增一个命令","content":"确认导入 `rvc_next.cli.app` 仍然不会加载 torch 或 FastAPI（`tests/test_architecture.py` 会检查）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2430":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-79","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#新增一个命令","content":"在用户文档的命令参考中补上这个命令。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2431":{"id":"/docs/development-core","page_id":"/docs/development-core","type":"page","content":"核心服务","breadcrumbs":["RVC Next 文档","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-core","locale":"zh-CN"},"2432":{"id":"/docs/development-core-0","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core","content":"核心层（rvcnext/core/）是 RVC Next 的全部业务逻辑：任务调度、显存管理、资源下载、音色库与导入、转换、人声分离、训练、实时变声，以及它们共用的设置、事件和数据库。API 与命令行都只是它的薄外壳，引擎（rvcnext/engine/）只被它以函数调用的方式使用，且只在函数内部惰性导入 torch。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2433":{"id":"/docs/development-core-1","page_id":"/docs/development-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-core#服务一览","content":"服务一览","locale":"zh-CN"},"2434":{"id":"/docs/development-core-2","page_id":"/docs/development-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-core#任务","content":"任务","locale":"zh-CN"},"2435":{"id":"/docs/development-core-3","page_id":"/docs/development-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-core#注册与请求","content":"注册与请求","locale":"zh-CN"},"2436":{"id":"