,"content":"某种任务（kind）向 `JobService.register(kind, factory)` 注册一个工厂：`request dict → JobSpec(title, run, resources, steps, priority)`。请求本身（纯 JSON）存入 `jobs.request` 列，所以服务器重启之后 **Retry** 仍能用同一请求重新提交（`retry()` 即 `submit(job.kind, job.request)`）。工厂里应当重新校验请求，因为重试时音色或文件可能已经变了。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2556":{"id":"/docs/development-core-124","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#注册与请求","content":"kind","locale":"zh-CN"},"2557":{"id":"/docs/development-core-125","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#注册与请求","content":"注册者","locale":"zh-CN"},"2558":{"id":"/docs/development-core-126","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#注册与请求","content":"资源","locale":"zh-CN"},"2559":{"id":"/docs/development-core-127","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#注册与请求","content":"运行方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"2560":{"id":"/docs/development-core-128","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#注册与请求","content":"`convert`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2561":{"id":"/docs/development-core-129","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#注册与请求","content":"`ConversionService`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2562":{"id":"/docs/development-core-130","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#注册与请求","content":"`gpu`（`compute.device == \"cpu\"` 时为 `cpu`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2563":{"id":"/docs/development-core-131","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#注册与请求","content":"进程内；带人声分离前置步骤时先起分离 worker","locale":"zh-CN"},"2564":{"id":"/docs/development-core-132","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#注册与请求","content":"`separate`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2565":{"id":"/docs/development-core-133","page_id":"/docs/developmen