ent-engine-21","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-engine#与原版的两处不同","content":"与原版的两处不同","locale":"zh-CN"},"2948":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-22","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-engine#热更新","content":"热更新","locale":"zh-CN"},"2949":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-23","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-engine#延迟估算","content":"延迟估算","locale":"zh-CN"},"2950":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-24","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-engine#音频编解码与-dsp","content":"音频编解码与 DSP","locale":"zh-CN"},"2951":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-25","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-engine#实时音频设备audio_io","content":"实时音频设备（`audio_io`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2952":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-26","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-engine#枚举与分组devicespy","content":"枚举与分组（`devices.py`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2953":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-27","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-engine#会话与拓扑streamspy","content":"会话与拓扑（`streams.py`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2954":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-28","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-engine#录制输出设备capturepy","content":"录制输出设备（`capture.py`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2955":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-29","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-engine#live-worker-与控制协议","content":"Live worker 与控制协议","locale":"zh-CN"},"2956":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-30","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-engine#人声分离","content":"人声分离","locale":"zh-CN"},"2957":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-31","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-engine#训练","content":"训练","locale":"zh-CN"},"2958":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-32","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-engine#指纹","content":"指纹","locale":"zh-CN"},"2959":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-33","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-engine#worker-子进程的入口","content":"Worker 子进程的入口","locale":"zh-CN"},"2960":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-34","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine","content":"`rvc_next/engine/` 是全部机器学习与数字信号处理代码：设备选择、模型缓存、HuBERT 特征、F0 提取、检索索引、合成器网络、离线转换、流式转换、音频编解码、实时音频设备、人声分离和训练的每个阶段。它不知道应用的存在——不导入 `rvc_next.core/api/cli/workers`，不导入 pydantic 或任何 Web/命令行框架（由 `tests/test_architecture.py` 守住，见整体架构）。核心层、worker 子进程和测试都只是它的调用者。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2961":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-35","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine","content":"本页按模块讲引擎做了什么、为什么这样做。与原版逐行对照的规则、golden 测试和行为变化见与原版的一致性。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2962":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-36","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#约定","content":"**参数是冻结的 dataclass**：`VoiceParams`（`engine/convert/params.py`）、`StreamParams`（`engine/stream/params.py`），以及训练各阶段的 `SliceRequest`、`F0Request`、`FeatureRequest`、`TrainRequest`、`IndexRequest`。核心层用 `VoiceParamsModel`/`StreamParamsModel`（`core/params.py`）镜像前两者并加上取值范围；引擎自己不做范围校验。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2963":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-37","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#约定","content":"**重依赖在函数内导入**：torch、transformers、faiss、av、pymss、sounddevice、parselmouth 都在用到它们的函数里 `import`，所以 `import rvc_next.engine.xxx` 很便宜，`rvc-next --help` 不会加载 torch。例外是移植文件（`engine/graph.py`、`engine/f0/rmvpe.py`、`engine/f0/fcpe_model.py`、`engine/audio/sinc_resample.py`、`engine/audio/denoise.py`、`engine/models/*.py`），它们在模块顶层导入 torch，只能从其他函数里被惰性导入。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2964":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-38","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#约定","content":"**异常**只有 `engine/errors.py` 里的几种：`EngineError` 基类、`MissingAssetError`（带 `assets`，资源目录 id 列表）、`ModelFormatError`、`AudioError`、`Cancelled`。核心层在 `core/engine_errors.py:map_engine_error()` 里把它们映射成领域错误；worker 子进程在 `workers/base.py:run_worker()` 里把它们变成 `error` 事件，核心层再用 `worker_error()` 重建。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2965":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-39","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#约定","content":"**取消**是协作式的：`engine/cancel.py:CancelToken`，引擎在分块之间调用 `cancel.check()`，抛出 `Cancelled`。子进程里的工作不靠它，取消就是杀进程树。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2966":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-40","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#约定","content":"**`sounddevice` 只出现在 `engine/audio_io/`，`pymss` 只出现在 `engine/separate/`**（架构测试检查），这样其余引擎代码在没有 PortAudio 或 pymss 的环境里也能导入。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2967":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-41","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#模块地图","content":"模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"2968":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-42","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#模块地图","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2969":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-43","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#模块地图","content":"来自原版","locale":"zh-CN"},"2970":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-44","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#模块地图","content":"`runtime.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2971":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-45","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#模块地图","content":"GPU 规则、`ChunkConfig`、资源路径、模型缓存、显存释放与 OOM 判断","loca