"/docs/development-testing-114","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#测试布局","content":"错误形状、Host / Origin / 令牌、原始上传、Range、峰值、浏览根目录、通过 API 提交转换、OpenAPI 中列出事件","locale":"zh-CN"},"3821":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-115","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#测试布局","content":"`cli/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3822":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-116","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#测试布局","content":"命令树快照、各层 `--debug`、`config`、`--json` 与 API 一致、用 `.pth` 路径转换、缺少资源的退出码","locale":"zh-CN"},"3823":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-117","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#测试布局","content":"`workers/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3824":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-118","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#测试布局","content":"设备 worker（枚举、格式检查、测试音，以及本机真实 PortAudio 的枚举）；Live worker（启动、热更新、换音色、设备丢失后重连、错误不致命、电平表 / 直通 / 测试音、端到端进程、空闲释放与 OOM 卸载）；分离 worker（模拟分离器下的链式事件、不覆盖已有文件、单个输入失败、缺少权重、DirectML fp16 失败请求 fp32 重试、杀进程取消）；训练 worker（切片 → F0 → 特征 → 索引）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3825":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-119","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#替身","content":"**模拟 PortAudio**（`engine/audio_io/fake.py`）：每个设备有自己的时钟（名义速率乘以 `1 + ppm·1e-6`），流在线程里按块回调；输入来自信号函数，输出按设备录下；`lose(index)` 让设备停止送数据（像拔掉 USB 设备），`refuse` 让打开失败并给出原因。漂移校正、欠载 / 过载计数、设备丢失与重连都在它上面测试。Live worker 和设备 worker 的请求里写 `\"backend\": \"fake\"` 即使用它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3826":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-120","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#替身","content":"**模拟分离器**：分离 worker 的请求带 `test_fake` 时，`engine/separate/runner.py` 用 `FakeSeparator` 代替 pymss，可以假装处于 DirectML（`pretend_dml`）以测试 fp16 → fp32 的重试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3827":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-121","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#替身","content":"**录制的设备枚举**（`tests/fixtures/devices/`）：Windows（MME、DirectSound、WASAPI、WDM-KS、虚拟声卡）、macOS 和 Linux PipeWire 机器上 `query_devices` / `query_hostapis` 的输出，用于测试分组、排序、虚拟设备标记和每一种解析结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3828":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-122","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#web-ui-测试","content":"`rvc_next/webui` 用 vitest（`happy-dom` 环境）和 `@vue/test-utils`，`bun run test` 运行，`bun run typecheck` 做 `vue-tsc` 类型检查。`src/test/setup.ts` 补上 happy-dom 缺少的 `attachInternals`（`@material/web` 需要它），`src/test/motion-zero.css` 把所有动效时长设为 0，让动效测试快速且确定。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3829":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-123","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#web-ui-测试","content":"除了组件和 store 的单元测试，还有一批**规则测试**，把约定变成会失败的测试：`tokens.test.ts`（`src/theme/` 之外不得出现十六进制颜色）、`imports.test.ts`（模块之间用 `@/` 别名导入）、`layout.test.ts`（含文件名的行给文本项 `min-width: 0`、页面是一列段落等布局规则）、`i18n/i18n.test.ts`（`zh-CN` 与 `en` 的键和占位符一致，固定词汇）、`ui/motion/motion.test.ts`（完整动效与减弱动效下都能运行、视图过渡）等。逐个说明见 Web UI。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3830":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-124","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`.github/workflows/ci.yml` 在推送到 `main`、拉取请求、手动触发和被其他工作流调用（`release.yml` 复用它）时运行，同一分支上新的运行会取消旧的：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3831":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-125","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"作业","locale":"zh-CN"},"3832":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-126","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"环境","locale":"zh-CN"},"3833":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-127","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci"