opment-37","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面地图","content":"命令行实现","locale":"zh-CN"},"4112":{"id":"/docs/development-38","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面地图","content":"Typer 工厂、命令注册、错误到退出码、`--json`、前台任务、如何新增命令","locale":"zh-CN"},"4113":{"id":"/docs/development-39","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面地图","content":"资源与模型仓库","locale":"zh-CN"},"4114":{"id":"/docs/development-40","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面地图","content":"`catalog.json` 格式、两个下载仓库、校验与断点续传、如何新增资源、只存在于整合包中的模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"4115":{"id":"/docs/development-41","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面地图","content":"与原版的一致性","locale":"zh-CN"},"4116":{"id":"/docs/development-42","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面地图","content":"移植规则、golden 测试、与原版的行为差异及原因、torchaudio / torchfcpe 的移植","locale":"zh-CN"},"4117":{"id":"/docs/development-43","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面地图","content":"测试与检查","locale":"zh-CN"},"4118":{"id":"/docs/development-44","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面地图","content":"`dev.py check`、pytest 标记与环境变量、tiny 模型、测试布局与 CI","locale":"zh-CN"},"4119":{"id":"/docs/development-45","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面地图","content":"第一次接触代码，建议按 开发环境 → 整体架构 → 与手头工作相关的那一层 的顺序读。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4120":{"id":"/docs/development-46","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#项目由来","content":"RVC Next 是对 Retrieval-based-Voice-Conversion-WebUI（下称\"原版\"，以本地检出 `81eed5e` 为准，那是一个 2026 年的重度修改分支：用 `transformers` 的 HuBERT 取代 fairseq，用 PyMSS 取代 UVR5，加入了 CUDA Graph、多说话人训练和 VST 插件）的重写。原版把功能分散在五个入口里：Gradio WebUI、桌面实时变声 GUI、VST 插件、各训练阶段的命令行脚本，以及内置的 PyMSS 命令行，每个入口各有一套设置、模型选择和进度显示。重写把它们合并成一个应用：**转换（Convert）**、**实时变声（Live）**、**人声分离（Separate）**、**训练（Train）**和**模型（Models）**，放在同一个 FastAPI 服务、同一个 Vue 3 Web UI 和同一个 Typer 命令行后面。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4121":{"id":"/docs/development-47","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#项目由来","content":"代码有三个来源，处理方式各不相同：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4122":{"id":"/docs/development-48","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#项目由来","content":"来源","locale":"zh-CN"},"4123":{"id":"/docs/development-49","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#项目由来","content":"拿来了什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"4124":{"id":"/docs/development-50","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#项目由来","content":"处理方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"4125":{"id":"/docs/development-51","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#项目由来","content":"SD Model Hub（经由 Hanaikada）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4126":{"id":"/docs/development-52","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#项目由来","content":"应用骨架：设置、事件总线、SQLite 数据库、安全中间件、端口绑定、CLI 工厂、Web UI 的主题、`ui/` 组件库、动效系统和规则测试","locale":"zh-CN"},"4127":{"id":"/docs/development-53","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#项目由来","content":"改名后沿用；Hanaikada 的 `embed.py`（嵌入其他应用）没有带过来，因为没有宿主应用需要嵌入 RVC Next","locale":"zh-CN"},"4128":{"id":"/docs/development-54","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#项目由来","content":"原版 RVC","locale":"zh-CN"},"4129":{"id":"/docs/development-55","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#项目由来","content":"合成器与判别器网络、RMVPE、TorchGate、CUDA Graph 缓存、离线 / 流式 / 训练的数值计算","locale":"zh-CN"},"4130":{"id":"/docs/development-56","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#项目由来","content":"**移植而非重写**，用 golden 测试与原版逐位比对，保证已有音色听起来完全一样（见与原版的一致性）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4131":{"id":"/docs/development-57","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#项目由来","content":"torchaudio、torchfcpe","locale":"zh-CN"},"4132":{"id":"/docs/development-58","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#项目由来","content":"`transforms.Resample` 的加窗 sinc 重采样器；FCPE 推理路径（mel 前端、纯卷积的 `CFNaiveMelPE`、解码器、加载器）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4133":{"id":"/docs/development-59","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#项目由来","content":"逐步移植到 `engine/audio/sinc_resample.py` 和 `engine/f0/fcpe_model.py`，测试在装有原库时与之逐位相等。这样 RVC Next 不再依赖 torchaudio（其最后一个版本是 2.11）和 torchfcpe","locale":"zh-CN"},"4134":{"id":"/docs/development-60","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#项目由来","content":"编排、存储、进程控制和全部用户界面都是新写的。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4135":{"id":"/docs/development-61","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#许可","content":"RVC Next 以 **GPL-3.0-only** 发布（`LICENSE`，`pyproject.toml` 中 `license = \"GPL-3.0-only\"`）。原因是骨架代码来自 GPLv3 的 SD Model Hub 与 Hanaikada。移植来的代码保留其原许可声明，集中列在 `NOTICE`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4136":{"id":"/docs/development-62","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#许可","content":"原版 RVC：MIT；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4137":{"id":"/docs/development-63","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#许可","content":"torchaudio：BSD 2-Clause，全文同时保留在 `engine/audio/sinc_resample.py` 里；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4138":{"id":"/docs/development-64","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#许可","content":"FCPE / torchfcpe：MIT（其 conformer 来自 Diffusion-SVC，同为 MIT）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4139":{"id":"/docs/development-65","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#许可","content":"PyMSS 作为依赖使用（MIT）；RMVPE、DDSP-SVC 的 SOLA 交叉淡化、TorchGate 也在其中注明出处。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4140":{"id":"/docs/development-66","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#许可","content":"运行时下载的模型权重（HuBERT、RMVPE、FCPE、底模、分离模型、演示音色）各有其条款，不属于本仓库的许可范围。移植新代码时，请同时在文件头和 `NOTICE` 中写明来源与许可。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4141":{"id":"/docs/first-run","page_id":"/docs/first-run","type":"page","content":"首次启动","breadcrumbs":["RVC Next 文档","开始"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/first-run","locale":"zh-CN"},"4142":{"id":"/docs/first-run-0","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run","content":"装好 RVC Next 之后，本页带你走完第一次使用的全过程：启动网页界面，了解数据存放在哪里，下载转换必需的 HuBERT 和 RMVPE，获取一个示例音色，最后完成一次转换。每一步都同时给出网页界面和命令行两种做法。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4143":{"id":"/docs/first-run-1","page_id":"/docs/first-run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/first-run#启动网页界面","content":"启动网页界面","locale":"zh-CN"},"4144":{"id":"/docs/first-run-2","page_id":"/docs/first-run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/first-run#数据文件夹","content":"数据文件夹","locale":"zh-CN"},"4145":{"id":"/docs/first-run-3","page_id":"/docs/first-run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/first-run#下载-hubert-和-rmvpe","content":"下载 HuBERT 和 RMVPE","locale":"zh-CN"},"4146":{"id":"/docs/first-run-4","page_id":"/docs/first-run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/first-run#获取一个示例音色","content":"获取一个示例音色","locale":"zh-CN"},"4147":{"id":"/docs/first-run-5","page_id":"/docs/first-run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/first-run#完成第一次转换","content":"完成第一次转换","locale":"zh-CN"},"4148":{"id":"/docs/first-run-6","page_id":"/docs/first-run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/first-run#接下来","content":"接下来","locale":"zh-CN"},"4149":{"id":"/docs/first-run-7","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#启动网页界面","content":"在激活了 RVC Next 环境的终端中运行：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4150":{"id":"/docs/first-run-8","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#启动网页界面","content":"服务器启动后，终端会打印一行类似：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4151":{"id":"/docs/first-run-9","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#启动网页界面","content":"稍后浏览器会自动打开这个地址。默认端口是 **7868**（与原版 RVC 的 7865 错开）。要停止服务器，在终端中按 ctrl+c。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4152":{"id":"/docs/first-run-10","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#启动网页界面","content":"`rvc-next webui` 的常用选项：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4153":{"id":"/docs/first-run-11","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#启动网页界面","content":"选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"4154":{"id":"/docs/first-run-12","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#启动网页界面","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"4155":{"id":"/docs/first-run-13","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#启动网页界面","content":"`--port <端口>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4156":{"id":"/docs/first-run-14","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#启动网页界面","content":"首先尝试的端口，默认读取设置（7868）；`0` 表示任选一个空闲端口","locale":"zh-CN"},"4157":{"id":"/docs/first-run-15","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#启动网页界面","content":"`--strict-port` / `--no-strict-port`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4158":{"id":"/docs/first-run-16","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#启动网页界面","content":"端口被占用时直接失败，而不是自动尝试下一个端口（默认会尝试下一个，并提示实际使用的端口）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4159":{"id":"/docs/first-run-17","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#启动网页界面","content":"`--open` / `--no-open`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4160":{"id":"/docs/first-run-18","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#启动网页界面","content":"是否自动打开浏览器（默认打开，可在设置中修改）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4161":{"id":"/docs/first-run-19","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#启动网页界面","content":"`--host <地址>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4162":{"id":"/docs/first-run-20","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#启动网页界面","content":"监听的地址，默认 `127.0.0.1`，即只允许本机访问","locale":"zh-CN"},"4163":{"id":"/docs/first-run-21","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#启动网页界面","content":"`--data-dir <文件夹>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4164":{"id":"/docs/first-run-22","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#启动网页界面","content":"本次使用的数据文件夹","locale":"zh-CN"},"4165":{"id":"/docs/first-run-23","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#启动网页界面","content":"`--debug`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4166":{"id":"/docs/first-run-24","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#启动网页界面","content":"输出调试日志","locale":"zh-CN"},"4167":{"id":"/docs/first-run-25","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#启动网页界面","content":"如果把 `--host` 设为 `0.0.0.0` 等非本机地址，服务器会被局域网中的其他设备访问到，不需要访问令牌。能连上的人都能使用全部功能，所以只在可信的网络中这样做，或自己加上防火墙、VPN 等保护；也可以用 `rvc-next config set server.access_token <secret>` 设置一个可选的访问令牌。详见远程访问与安全。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4168":{"id":"/docs/first-run-26","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#启动网页界面","content":"网页打开后，你会看到左侧的导航栏（窄窗口下在底部）：**转换**、**实时**、**分离**、**训练**、**模型**，以及最下方的 **设置**。第一次打开时显示 **转换** 页面；之后会回到你上次所在的页面。界面各部分的说明见界面总览。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4169":{"id":"/docs/first-run-27","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#数据文件夹","content":"设置、数据库、音色库、训练实验、转换结果和下载的模型都保存在一个**数据文件夹**里：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4170":{"id":"/docs/first-run-28","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#数据文件夹","content":"系统","locale":"zh-CN"},"4171":{"id":"/docs/first-run-29","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#数据文件夹","content":"默认位置","locale":"zh-CN"},"4172":{"id":"/docs/first-run-30","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#数据文件夹","content":"Windows","locale":"zh-CN"},"4173":{"id":"/docs/first-run-31","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/doc