dels","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"4954":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-25","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models","content":"**音色**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4955":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-26","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models","content":"音色库：导入、浏览、编辑音色，未分配的索引，原版 RVC 安装","locale":"zh-CN"},"4956":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-27","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models","content":"**底模**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4957":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-28","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models","content":"训练用的底模：官方底模和你导入的 G/D","locale":"zh-CN"},"4958":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-29","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models","content":"**分离模型**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4959":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models","content":"内置的分离模型和你导入的分离模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"4960":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models","content":"**资源**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4961":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models","content":"所有可下载的文件：HuBERT、音高模型（RMVPE、FCPE、CREPE）、底模、分离模型、示例音色","locale":"zh-CN"},"4962":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models","content":"**工具**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4963":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models","content":"融合两个音色；从训练检查点提取音色","locale":"zh-CN"},"4964":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#浏览与筛选","content":"**音色** 标签页以卡片形式列出音色库里的所有音色。每张卡片显示名称、采样率 · 版本 · **音高引导**/**无音高引导**，以及标签：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4965":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-36","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#浏览与筛选","content":"**无索引**：音色没有附加索引，**索引强度** 参数对它不起作用；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4966":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-37","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#浏览与筛选","content":"**N 个说话人**：多说话人音色；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4967":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-38","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#浏览与筛选","content":"**旧版**：来自原版 RVC 安装、在原处直接读取的音色（见下文“原版 RVC 安装”一节）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4968":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-39","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#浏览与筛选","content":"卡片上方的工具：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4969":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-40","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#浏览与筛选","content":"**筛选音色**：按名称或标签搜索；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4970":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-41","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#浏览与筛选","content":"**无索引**：只显示没有索引的音色，方便补全索引；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4971":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-42","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#浏览与筛选","content":"**显示隐藏的**：显示被隐藏的旧版音色。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4972":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-43","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#浏览与筛选","content":"点击卡片进入音色详情页。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4973":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-44","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#浏览与筛选","content":"空的音色库会提示 **还没有音色**，并提供 **获取示例音色** 按钮，点击后跳到 **资源** 标签页，可以下载几个 RVC 官方示例音色先试用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4974":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-45","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#音色详情","content":"详情页顶部有 **返回**、**下载**（把音色打包为 zip：`.pth`（写入了说话人名称）和它的索引，文件名使导入时能再次自动配对；也可用 `rvc-next model export`）、**在文件夹中显示**（只在服务器本机打开网页时显示）和 **删除** 按钮。页面分为四块：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4975":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-46","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#音色详情","content":"**信息**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4976":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-47","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#音色详情","content":"可编辑 **名称**、**描述**、**标签**（用英文逗号分隔），多说话人音色还可以给每个 **说话人 N** 起名，改完点 **保存**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4977":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-48","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#音色详情","content":"下方列出 **采样率**、**版本**、**音高引导**、**说话人**、**文件**、**大小** 和 **模型内信息**。单说话人音色会显示 **单说话人 · N 个嵌入槽位**：训练出的音色通常都带有 109 个嵌入槽位，这并不代表它是多说话人音色；只有模型里记录了说话人信息时才算多说话人。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4978":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-49","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#音色详情","content":"**索引**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4979":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-50","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#音色详情","content":"列出已附加的索引：`default` 是整个音色的索引，`spk<N>` 是某个说话人专用的索引。点 **移除** 可以卸下。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4980":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-51","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#音色详情","content":"多说话人音色会出现 **索引** 下拉框，用来选择接下来附加的是 `default` 还是某个说话人的索引。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4981":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-52","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#音色详情","content":"**附加索引**：把 `.index` 文件拖到这里或点击选择。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4982":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-53","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#音色详情","content":"**服务器上 .index 的路径**：直接填写服务器上的路径，再点 **添加**（只在服务器本机，或设置了访问令牌时显示）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4983":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-54","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#音色详情","content":"**从实验构建**：选择一个训练实验，用它已提取的特征为这个音色构建索引（实验需要已完成 **特征** 阶段）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4984":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-55","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#音色详情","content":"每次附加都会检查索引是否适合这个音色：不含向量的空索引（原版的 `trained_*.index`）和版本不符的索引（v1 是 256 维，v2 是 768 维）会被拒绝。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4985":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-56","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#音色详情","content":"**默认参数**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4986":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-57","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#音色详情","content":"每个音色有一个默认预设，在导入时根据设置中的默认参数创建。在其他页面选择这个音色时，会自动载入这组参数。在这里调整后点 **保存** 即可。参数含义见 音色参数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4987":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-58","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#音色详情","content":"**试听**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4988":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-59","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#音色详情","content":"**用默认参数转换一小段音频。** 选一段音频，点 **预览 15 秒**，结果会显示在下方，可以直接播放或与源音频对比。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4989":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-60","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#删除与隐藏","content":"音色库中的音色：**删除** 会确认 **将 \\{名称} 移到回收站？**，音色文件夹被移到数据文件夹的 `trash/` 中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4990":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-61","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#删除与隐藏","content":"旧版音色：按钮变成 **隐藏**，确认 **隐藏 \\{名称}？RVC 安装中的文件不会被改动。** 隐藏后可以通过 **显示隐藏的** 再看到。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4991":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-62","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#删除与隐藏","content":"下载的示例音色：删除后可以在 **资源** 中重新下载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4992":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-63","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#音色库在磁盘上的样子","content":"音色库默认位于数据文件夹的 `models/`（可在 **设置 › 存储 › 音色** 中更改）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4993":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-64","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#导入模型","content":"**音色**、**底模**、**分离模型** 三个标签页顶部都有一个拖放区。三者使用同一套导入流程，**放在哪个拖放区都可以**：rvc-next 会根据文件**内容**（而不是文件名或扩展名）判断每个文件是什么，再决定放到哪里。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4994":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-65","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[]