t","url":"/docs/guide-models#recognized-files","content":"默认作为底模导入，也可以选择 **提取音色**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5006":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-77","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#recognized-files","content":"训练判别器 D（`D_*.pth`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5007":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-78","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#recognized-files","content":"子判别器数量","locale":"zh-CN"},"5008":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-79","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#recognized-files","content":"与 G 配对作为底模","locale":"zh-CN"},"5009":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-80","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#recognized-files","content":"分离模型配置 `.yaml` 与检查点（`.ckpt`、`.pth`、`.bin`、`.safetensors`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5010":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-81","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#recognized-files","content":"配置的模型类型","locale":"zh-CN"},"5011":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-82","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#recognized-files","content":"成为一个分离模型和预设","locale":"zh-CN"},"5012":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-83","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#recognized-files","content":"`.zip`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5013":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-84","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#recognized-files","content":"解压后逐个识别其中的文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"5014":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-85","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#recognized-files","content":"同上","locale":"zh-CN"},"5015":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-86","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#recognized-files","content":"无法识别的文件会被跳过，并在导入完成后提示 **已跳过：…**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5016":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-87","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#导入步骤","content":"把文件拖到拖放区（或点击选择）。可以一次拖入多个文件，例如一个 `.pth` 和它的 `.index`，或者一个包含它们的 `.zip`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5017":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-88","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#导入步骤","content":"上传时显示进度条。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5018":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-89","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#导入步骤","content":"如果每个文件该去哪里都很明确，导入会立即完成，并弹出提示，例如 **已导入 \\{名称}，并附加 1 个索引**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5019":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-90","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#导入步骤","content":"如果有无法确定的地方，会打开 **检查导入** 对话框，让你确认后再导入。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5020":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-91","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#links","content":"每个拖放区下方的 **或从链接添加** 可以填一个或多个链接（用空格分隔）；点 **添加** 后由服务器下载（一个 **下载链接** 任务显示进度），之后的导入与拖入文件相同：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5021":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-92","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#links","content":"**Hugging Face**：一个文件（`…/blob/main/x.pth` 或 `…/resolve/main/x.pth`）、一个仓库（`huggingface.co/owner/repo`），或仓库里的一个文件夹（`…/tree/main/folder`）：其中所有 `.pth`、`.index`、`.zip` 和分离模型文件都会被下载。Hugging Face 链接通过 **设置 › 下载** 中选择的下载源（例如 hf-mirror）下载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5022":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-93","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#links","content":"**Google Drive**：分享的文件链接（`drive.google.com/file/d/…`）。Drive 会不时改变下载方式；如果链接失效，请在浏览器中下载文件后拖入。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5023":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-94","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#links","content":"**其他任意** 指向文件的链接。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5024":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-95","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#links","content":"链接必须指向互联网：指向服务器本机或其局域网（例如 `127.0.0.1`、`192.168.…`、`10.…`）的链接会被拒绝，网站重定向到这些地址时也一样，这样网页界面就不能被用来访问服务器旁边的其他服务。命令行（`rvc-next model import <链接>`）可以从本地地址下载。超过 8 GiB 的文件，以及打开后是网页而不是文件的链接，都会被拒绝。与任何文件一样，来自网络的模型只会作为数据读取（见能识别哪些文件）；它的许可需要你自己确认。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5025":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-96","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#links","content":"导入完成后可能出现的提示：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5026":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-97","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#links","content":"提示","locale":"zh-CN"},"5027":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-98","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#links","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"5028":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-99","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#links","content":"**已导入 \\{名称}** / **已导入 \\{名称}，并附加 N 个索引**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5029":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-100","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#links","content":"新音色已加入音色库","locale":"zh-CN"},"5030":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-101","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#links","content":"**已将 \\{名称} 附加到库中的音色**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5031":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-102","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#links","content":"索引被附加到音色库里已有的音色","locale":"zh-CN"},"5032":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-103","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#links","content":"**\\{名称} 暂未分配，可在“音色”中分配。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5033":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-104","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#links","content":"索引进了 **未分配的索引**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5034":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-105","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#links","content":"**已导入 N 个底模，可在实验设置中选择。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5035":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-106","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#links","content":"导入了底模","locale":"zh-CN"},"5036":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-107","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#links","content":"**已导入 N 个分离模型，可在“分离”中使用。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5037":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-108","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#links","content":"导入了分离模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"5038":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-109","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#索引如何自动配对","content":"索引和音色的配对规则：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5039":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-110","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#索引如何自动配对","content":"**版本必须一致**：v1 索引只能配 v1 音色，v2 只能配 v2，这是硬性条件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5040":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-111","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#索引如何自动配对","content":"在兼容的音色中，按名称打分：与实验名完全相同得分最高，其次是名称包含音色名、名称相似；放在同一个文件夹里还会加分。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5041":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-112","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#索引如何自动配对","content":"只有当某个索引是本次导入中**唯一兼容**的音色，或者得分明显领先其他候选时，才会自动配对；否则交给你选择。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5042":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-113","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#索引如何自动配对","content":"本次导入里没有合适的音色时，才会考虑音色库中已有的音色。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5043":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-114","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#检查导入对话框","content":"对话框顶部提示：**部分文件无法确定配对，请检查以下选择；每个索引只列出兼容的音色。** 按文件类型分组：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5044":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-115","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#检查导入对话框","content":"**音色**：每个音色可以改 **名称**，用 **导入** 开关决定是否导入。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5045":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-116","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#检查导入对话框","content":"**索引**：每个索引显示向量数量、配对状态和理由。在 **音色** 下拉框中选择要配对的音色——**\\{名称}（本次导入）** 或 **\\{名称}（库中）**——或选 **暂不分配** 放进未分配的索引。目标是多说话人音色时，还可以选择 **说话人**（默认 **所有说话人**）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5046":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-117","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#检查导入对话框","content":"**底模与检查点**：每个 G 选择 **用作** **底模**、**提取音色** 或 **跳过**，并可以改名；作为底模时选择配对的 **判别器（D）**（也可以选 **无**）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5047":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-118","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#检查导入对话框","content":"**分离模型**：为每个 YAML 选择对应的 **检查点**，填写名称，选择 **主音轨** 和 **副音轨** 并为它们命名（**主音轨名称**、**副音轨名称**），用 **导入** 开关决定是否导入。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5048":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-119","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#检查导入对话框","content":"**不导入**：列出无法使用的文件及原因，例如 **不是模型文件**、**缺少生成器的判别器**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5049":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-120","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#检查导入对话框","content":"索引的配对状态：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5050":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-121","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#检查导入对话框","content":"状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"5051":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-122","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#检查导入对话框","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"5052":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-123","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#检查导入对话框","content":"**唯一匹配**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5053":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-124","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#检查导入对话框","content":"只有一个兼容的音色","locale":"zh-CN"},"5054":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-125","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#检查导入对话框","content":"**已匹配**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5055":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-126","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#检查导入对话框","content":"根据名称或文件夹找到了匹配","locale":"zh-CN"},"5056":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-127","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#检查导入对话框","content":"**待选择**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5057":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-128","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#检查导入对话框","content":"有多个候选，需要你选","locale":"zh-CN"},"5058":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-129","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#检查导入对话框","content":"**不兼容**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5059":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-130","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#检查导入对话框","content":"没有版本相符的音色","locale":"zh-CN"},"5060":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-131","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#检查导入对话框","content":"**空索引**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5061":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-132","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#检查导入对话框","content":"不含向量（`trained_` 索引），不能使用","locale":"zh-CN"},"5062":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-133","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#检查导入对话框","content":"**重复**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5063":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-134","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#检查导入对话框","content":"另一个索引更匹配同一个音色","locale":"zh-CN"},"5064":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-135","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#检查导入对话框","content":"**已选择**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5065":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-136","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#检查导入对话框","content":"你手动选择过","locale":"zh-CN"},"5066":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-137","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#检查导入对话框","content":"确认后点 **导入**；点 **取消** 则放弃这次导入，已上传的文件会被丢弃。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5067":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-138","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#未分配的索引","content":"导入时没有配上音色的索引会出现在 **音色** 标签页顶部的 **未分配的索引** 区域：**导入时未配对音色的索引。只列出版本匹配的音色。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5068":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-139","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#未分配的索引","content":"在 **音色** 下拉框中选择一个音色（只列出版本相符的音色）；多说话人音色还可以选择 **说话人**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5069":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-140","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#未分配的索引","content":"点 **分配**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5070":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-141","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#未分配的索引","content":"不需要的索引点 删除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5071":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-142","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#未分配的索引","content":"如果库里还没有同版本的音色，会显示 **库中还没有 v1 音色** 之类的提示。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5072":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-143","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#applio","content":"Applio 是另一个 RVC 应用，它会在音色中写入一些额外信息；rvc-next 会读取它们：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5073":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-144","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#applio","content":"使用 Applio 默认声码器（HiFi-GAN）的音色就是 RVC 音色，可以直接使用。它们的作者、轮数、步数和训练时长显示在 **信息** 中；多说话人音色会得到编号的说话人，可以改名。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5074":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-145","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#applio","content":"用其他 **内容特征模型**（Applio 的 “embedder”：SPIN、SPIN v2，或中文、日文、韩文 HuBERT）训练的音色，会按训练时的方式用该模型转换。**信息** 中显示 **内容特征**；第一次转换时会提示下载该模型（约 380 MB，来自 Applio 的仓库；也可在 **资源 › 内容特征模型** 中下载）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5075":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-146","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#applio","content":"使用 Applio 的 **RefineGAN** 或 **MRF HiFi-GAN** 声码器的音色，以及用自定义内容特征模型训练的音色无法使用：导入时会说明原因并跳过。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5076":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-147","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#原版-rvc-安装","content":"如果你还保留着原版 RVC，不必复制模型就能直接使用其中的音色。**音色** 标签页下方的 **原版 RVC 安装** 区域：**RVC 安装中的音色直接使用；“全部导入”会将其复制到音色库。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5077":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-148","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#原版-rvc-安装","content":"点 **添加 RVC 安装**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5078":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-149","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#原版-rvc-安装","content":"在 **RVC 文件夹** 中填写原版的根目录（里面应有 `assets` 文件夹），或点 **浏览…** 选择。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5079":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-150","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#原版-rvc-安装","content":"点 **添加**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5080":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-151","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#原版-rvc-安装","content":"rvc-next 会读取 `assets/weights` 中的音色，并在 `assets/indices` 和 `logs` 中按原版的规则为每个音色推荐一个索引。这些音色带 **旧版** 标签，文件始终留在原处，rvc-next 不会写入原版的文件夹（为旧版音色附加的索引会复制到 `models/attached-indexes/`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5081":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-152","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#原版-rvc-安装","content":"每个已添加的安装旁边有两个按钮：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5082":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-153","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#原版-rvc-安装","content":"**扫描**：原版里新增或删除了模型后，重新读取，并为新音色推荐索引（你手动选过索引的音色不受影响）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"5083":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-154","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#原版-rvc-安装","content":"**全部导入**：把这个安装里的所有音色（连同索引）复制到音色库，之后就和普通音色一样可以编辑。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5084":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-155","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#原版-rvc-安装","content":"更多迁移细节见 从原版 RVC 迁移。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5085":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-156","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#底模","content":"**底模** 标签页：**训练从底模开始。可在下方下载官方底模，或导入你自己的 G（和 D）；采样率、版本和音高引导从权重中读取。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5086":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-157","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#底模","content":"**导入底模**：拖入 G 和 D 的 `.pth` 文件，或 `.zip`。G 和 D 会自动按名称配对；只有 G 也可以导入（显示为 **无 D**）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5087":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-158","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#底模","content":"**你的底模**：已导入的底模，显示版本 · 采样率 · 是否音高引导 · **G + D** 或 **无 D** · 大小。可以 **重命名** 或 删除（移到回收站）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5088":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-159","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#底模","content":"**社区底模**：由 RVC 用户训练的 21 个底模（KLM、Snowie、Titan、Ov2Super、Rigel 等；Applio 维护的列表），都是带音高引导的 v2 底模。每行显示其仓库声明的许可（很多没有声明：分享训练结果前请确认）和来源仓库；**下载** 从那里获取（约 1.3 GB，G 和 D）。下载后即可在实验中选为底模。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5089":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-160","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#底模","content":"**官方**：v1/v2 × 32k/40k/48k × 有/无音高引导的官方底模。点 **下载** 会下载该版本和采样率的整套底模（有、无音高引导的 G 和 D 共 4 个文件）；删除只移除这一项自己的 G 和 D，之后可以重新下载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5090":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-161","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#底模","content":"训练实验的 **设置 › 底模** 只会列出采样率、版本和音高引导都与实验相符的底模。详见 训练。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5091":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-162","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#分离模型","content":"**分离模型** 标签页：**内置模型可在此处或“资源”中下载；你自己的模型以检查点及其 YAML 配置导入。每个模型都会成为“分离”中的预设。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5092":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-163","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#分离模型","content":"**导入分离模型**：拖入检查点（`.ckpt`、`.pth`、`.safetensors`）及其 `.yaml`，或 `.zip`。导入前 rvc-next 会实际加载一次模型，确认它能用（可能需要几秒）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5093":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-164","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#分离模型","content":"**你的分离模型**：显示模型类型、主/副音轨名称和大小，可删除。每个导入的分离模型都会成为 **分离** 页面中带 **已导入** 标签的一个预设。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5094":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-165","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#分离模型","content":"**内置**：内置的分离模型，每项标注 **预设：…**，即哪些分离预设会用到它。可以下载或删除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5095":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-166","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#分离模型","content":"没有导入任何模型时显示 **尚未导入分离模型**；内置预设始终可以在 **分离** 页面使用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5096":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-167","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#资源","content":"**资源** 标签页列出 rvc-next 能下载的所有文件，按用途分组：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5097":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-168","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#资源","content":"分组","locale":"zh-CN"},"5098":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-169","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#资源","content":"文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"5099":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-170","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#资源","content":"大约大小","locale":"zh-CN"},"5100":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-171","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#资源","content":"**转换**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5101":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-172","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#资源","content":"HuBERT（所有转换、实时和训练都需要）、RMVPE、RMVPE（ONNX，DirectML 设备使用）、FCPE、CREPE、CREPE tiny","locale":"zh-CN"},"5102":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-173","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#资源","content":"180 MB、173 MB、345 MB、41 MB、85 MB、2 MB","locale":"zh-CN"},"5103":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-174","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#资源","content":"**训练**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5104":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-175","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#资源","content":"官方底模 v1/v2 × 32k/40k/48k","locale":"zh-CN"},"5105":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-176","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#资源","content":"每组约 350–420 MB","locale":"zh-CN"},"5106":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-177","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#资源","content":"**分离**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5107":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-178","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#资源","content":"人声、人声（激进）、去混响、去混响（激进）、主唱","locale":"zh-CN"},"5108":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-179","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#资源","content":"每个约 305–436 MB","locale":"zh-CN"},"5109":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-180","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#资源","content":"列表中的文件名称和说明来自服务器，以英文显示，例如 `HuBERT`、`Base models v2 40k`、`Separation: Vocals`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5110":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-181","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#资源","content":"每一行显示名称、说明、大小（校验过的显示 **已校验**）和状态：**已安装**、**未安装**、**部分下载**、**校验不符**、**下载中**。可用的操作：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5111":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-182","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#资源","content":"**下载**：开始下载。下载中显示进度条，以及“已下载 / 总大小 · 速度 · 剩余时间”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5112":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-183","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#资源","content":"**下载全部转换文件**（以及 **下载全部训练文件**、**下载全部分离文件**）：分组标题旁的按钮，一次下载该组中缺少的所有文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5113":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-184","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#资源","content":"**校验**：重新计算已安装文件的 SHA-256 校验和。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5114":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-185","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#资源","content":"删除：删除文件，之后可以重新下载。下载进行中不能删除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5115":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-186","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#资源","content":"下载很稳健：中断后会从断点续传（未完成的文件以 `.part` 结尾），失败会自动重试，完成后核对校验和。你不必提前把所有文件都下载好——在任何页面需要某个文件时，相应按钮的位置都会显示 **需要 …** 和 **下载（大小）**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5116":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-187","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#资源","content":"下载来源在 **设置 › 下载** 中配置：可以在 **模型仓库**（rvc-model 或 RVC 官方仓库）之间切换，也可以把 **下载端点** 改成 hf-mirror.com 或自定义镜像。详见 设置 的“下载”一节。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5117":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-188","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#示例音色","content":"**资源** 标签页底部是 **示例音色**：**RVC 官方示例音色，连同索引从模型仓库下载。** 每行显示采样率 · 版本 · **含索引** · 大小。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5118":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-189","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#示例音色","content":"点 **下载** 下载单个音色，或点 **全部下载**；开始后提示 **已开始下载；完成后音色会出现在音色库中。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5119":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-190","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#示例音色","content":"已下载的音色显示 **已在音色库** 按钮，点击打开它的详情页。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5120":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-191","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#示例音色","content":"示例音色只存放在 rvc-model 仓库中，所以无论 **模型仓库** 选的是哪个，示例音色总是从 rvc-model 下载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5121":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-192","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#融合两个音色","content":"把两个音色按权重混合成一个新音色：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5122":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-193","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#融合两个音色","content":"选择 **第一个音色** 和 **第二个音色**。两者的采样率、版本和音高引导必须相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5123":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-194","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#融合两个音色","content":"调整 **第一个音色的权重**（0–1，默认 0.5）：结果 = 权重 × 第一个 +（1 − 权重）× 第二个。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5124":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-195","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#融合两个音色","content":"填写 **新音色名称**，点 **融合**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5125":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-196","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#融合两个音色","content":"融合作为任务在后台运行，完成后新音色出现在音色库中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5126":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-197","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#从检查点提取音色","content":"训练检查点（`G_*.pth`）不能直接用于转换，需要先提取成小模型：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5127":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-198","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#从检查点提取音色","content":"在 **检查点（G\\_\\*.pth 路径或 \\<实验>/\\<文件>）** 中填写服务器上检查点的完整路径，或用 `实验名/G_xxx.pth` 的形式指向某个实验里的检查点。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5128":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-199","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#从检查点提取音色","content":"填写 **新音色名称**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5129":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-200","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#从检查点提取音色","content":"**采样率** 和 **模型版本** 默认 **从实验读取**；检查点不在实验里、无法读取时，请手动选择。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5130":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-201","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#从检查点提取音色","content":"点 **提取**。完成后新音色出现在音色库中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5131":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-202","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#从检查点提取音色","content":"训练出来的音色通常直接在 **训练 › 结果** 中 **导出为音色** 更方便，它会自动提取并带上索引。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5132":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-203","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#命令行","content":"命令行导入遇到无法确定的配对时会打印方案并以退出码 3 结束，可以用 `--pair`、`--keep-unassigned`、`--extract` 做决定。完整说明见 命令参考。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5133":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","type":"page","content":"音色参数","breadcrumbs":["RVC Next 文档","使用教程"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-parameters","locale":"zh-CN"},"5134":{"id":"/docs/guide-para