"page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#f0","content":"> 如何跟踪输入的音高。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5235":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-101","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#f0","content":"RVC 先从输入中提取每一帧的音高（F0），再让音色按这个音高（加上 **音高** 的偏移）发声。可选的算法：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5236":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-102","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#f0","content":"选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"5237":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-103","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#f0","content":"特点","locale":"zh-CN"},"5238":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-104","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#f0","content":"需要下载","locale":"zh-CN"},"5239":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-105","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#f0","content":"**pm（快速）**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5240":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-106","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#f0","content":"基于 Praat 的传统算法，速度最快，对 CPU 友好；对歌声、气声和嘈杂的录音容易跟错","locale":"zh-CN"},"5241":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-107","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#f0","content":"无","locale":"zh-CN"},"5242":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-108","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#f0","content":"**RMVPE（最佳）**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5243":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-109","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#f0","content":"神经网络音高模型，准确度最高，抗噪能力强，适合歌声；默认选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"5244":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-110","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#f0","content":"RMVPE（约 173 MB）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5245":{"id":"/docs/guide-p