0 倍实时），在其评测中与 RMVPE 相当，最高 2093 Hz；来自 Applio 的修复步骤会把它短暂读低一个八度的音抬回来","locale":"zh-CN"},"5256":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-122","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#f0","content":"无（随 RVC Next 提供）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5257":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-123","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#f0","content":"建议：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5258":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-124","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#f0","content":"一般情况下保持 **RMVPE**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5259":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-125","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#f0","content":"没有 GPU、又追求速度时，可以试试 **SwiftF0**、**FCPE** 或 **CREPE tiny**，或者对干净的语音使用 **pm**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5260":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-126","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#f0","content":"用 CREPE 音高训练的音色（网上分享的音色中很常见）用 **CREPE** 可能最贴近它的训练；有 GPU 时它也足够快，可以用于实时变声。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5261":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-127","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#f0","content":"如果结果中出现突然跑调、破音、音高乱跳，多半是音高跟踪出错，换成 **RMVPE** 往往能解决。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5262":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-128","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#f0","content":"所选算法对应的模型没有下载时，运行按钮会被替换为“**需要 RMVPE**”（或该算法的其他模型）和 **下载** 按钮。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5263":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-129","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#f0","content":"**无音高引导**的音色（训练时关闭了音高引导）不使用音高，此时这一行会变暗，选择哪种算法都没有影响，也不需要下载音高模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5264":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-130","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#pitch","content":"> 以半音为单位：+12 为升高一个八度。男声转女声约 +12。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5265":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-131","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#pitch","content":"把输入的音高整体平移若干个半音后再交给音色。这是最常调整的参数：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5266":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-132","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#pitch","content":"情况","locale":"zh-CN"},"5267":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-133","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#pitch","content":"建议值","locale":"zh-CN"},"5268":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-134","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#pitch","content":"男声输入，女声音色","locale":"zh-CN"},"5269":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-135","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#pitch","content":"约 +12（有时 +8 ～ +12 更自然）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5270":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-136","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#pitch","content":"女声输入，男声音色","locale":"zh-CN"},"5271":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-137","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#pitch","content":"约 −12","locale":"zh-CN"},"5272":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-138","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#pitch","content":"同性别之间","locale":"zh-CN"},"5273":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-139","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#pitch","content":"0，再按需要 ±1 ～ ±3 微调","locale":"zh-CN"},"5274":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-140","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#pitch","content":"翻唱时匹配原曲调","locale":"zh-CN"},"5275":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-141","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#pitch","content":"按音色本身的音域，以 12 的倍数为主，避免与伴奏跑调","locale":"zh-CN"},"5276":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-142","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#pitch","content":"调整的目标是让移调后的音高落在**音色训练数据的音域**内。偏离太多时，声音会发虚、走音或失真。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5277":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-143","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#pitch","content":"如果打开了 **先分离人声** 和 **加回伴奏**，伴奏不会跟着移调。此时 **音高** 最好用 0 或 ±12，否则人声会与伴奏不在一个调上。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5278":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-144","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#pitch","content":"界面中按 1 个半音调节；命令行和 API 接受小数，例如 `--pitch 1.5`。**音高** 只对有音高引导的音色起作用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5279":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-145","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#formant","content":"> 改变声道的音色而不改变音高。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5280":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-146","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#formant","content":"共振峰决定了声音听起来像“多大的人”在说话。**正值**会抬高共振峰，声音更细、更亮、更年轻；**负值**会降低共振峰，声音更厚、更沉。音高不变。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5281":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-147","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#formant","content":"跨性别转换时，**音高** 调好后声音仍然“不像”，可以把 **共振峰** 向同一方向小幅调整，例如男转女时 +0.5 ～ +1；","locale":"zh-CN"},"5282":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-148","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#formant","content":"调整幅度不宜过大，±2 已经是很明显的变化，过大会让声音不自然。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5283":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-149","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#formant","content":"原版 RVC 只在实时变声中提供共振峰偏移。RVC Next 把同样的方法也用在文件转换上；**共振峰** 为 0 时，计算与原版完全相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5284":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-150","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#index-rate","content":"> 从音色的索引中取用多少它自身的音色特征。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5285":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-151","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#index-rate","content":"音色的索引（`.index` 文件）保存了训练数据的特征。转换时，RVC 会在索引中查找与输入最接近的特征，按这个比例混入，让结果更像训练时的声音。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5286":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-152","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#index-rate","content":"**越高**：音色越接近训练数据，口音和咬字也更像训练者；但如果索引质量不好或数据量太少，可能带来杂音、含糊或咬字不清；","locale":"zh-CN"},"5287":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-153","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#index-rate","content":"**越低**：更多保留输入本身的发音，咬字更清楚，但音色相似度降低；","locale":"zh-CN"},"5288":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-154","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#index-rate","content":"**0**：完全不使用索引。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5289":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-155","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#index-rate","content":"建议从默认的 0.75 开始；发音含糊或有杂音时降到 0.3 ～ 0.6。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5290":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-156","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#index-rate","content":"如果音色没有附加索引，这个滑块会变灰，并提示“此音色没有索引，索引强度不起作用。可在“模型”中附加索引。”附加索引的方法见模型管理。多说话人音色可以为每个说话人附加单独的索引，转换时会使用所选说话人的索引。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5291":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-157","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#protect","content":"> 在输入没有音高的地方保持呼吸声和辅音清晰；0.5 为关闭。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5292":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-158","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#protect","content":"清辅音（如 s、sh、t、k）和呼吸声没有音高，用音色特征替换它们容易产生“电音”、撕裂声。辅音保护会在这些没有音高的位置保留更多输入本身的特征。它抑制的是索引的作用：**索引强度** 为 0 或音色没有索引时，它不改变任何东西。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5293":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-159","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#protect","content":"**数值越小，保护越强**；**0.5 表示关闭保护**；","locale":"zh-CN"},"5294":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-160","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#protect","content":"默认 0.33 适合大多数情况；","locale":"zh-CN"},"5295":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-161","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#protect","content":"如果齿音、呼吸声出现撕裂或电子音，降低到 0.2 ～ 0.3；","locale":"zh-CN"},"5296":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-162","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#protect","content":"保护过强（接近 0）会让这些位置更像原声，也会削弱 **索引强度** 的效果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5297":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-163","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#protect","content":"**无音高引导**的音色不使用这项，滑块会变灰，并提示“此音色没有音高引导，此项不起作用。”**无音高帧** 选为 **填补（RVC 2026）** 时它同样不起作用，滑块会说明这一点。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5298":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-164","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#unvoiced","content":"位于 **音高细节** 中。音高算法在呼吸声和清辅音中找不到音高，这一项决定这些帧如何处理：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5299":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-165","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#unvoiced","content":"选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"5300":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-166","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#unvoiced","content":"`--unvoiced`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5301":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-167","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#unvoiced","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"5302":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-168","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#unvoiced","content":"**保护**（默认）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5303":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-169","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#unvoiced","content":"`protect`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5304":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-170","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#unvoiced","content":"用相邻帧填补音高，并对这些帧应用 **辅音保护**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5305":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-171","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#unvoiced","content":"**无音高（经典 RVC）**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5306":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-172","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#unvoiced","content":"`zero`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5307":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-173","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#unvoiced","content":"这些帧也不给音高，音色在这里发出噪声而不是乐音，与经典 RVC 和 Applio 的转换相同。网上分享的音色大多是这样训练的，用这一项可能更干净。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5308":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-174","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#unvoiced","content":"**填补（RVC 2026）**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5309":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-175","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#unvoiced","content":"`original`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5310":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-176","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#unvoiced","content":"RVC Next 所依据的 RVC 整合包的规则：填补音高，辅音保护不起作用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5311":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-177","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#unvoiced","content":"RVC 2026 在辅音保护寻找无音高帧之前就把音高填补了，所以它永远找不到，保护也就从不生效。**保护** 保留填补后的音高（用 RVC 2026 或 RVC Next 训练的音色需要它），但按音高算法自己的判断确定这些帧。实时变声使用同一设置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5312":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-178","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#high-register","content":"位于 **音高细节** 中；只用于 **RMVPE**，且只在转换中生效（实时变声不提供：它会让每一块的音高分析耗时翻倍）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5313":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-179","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#high-register","content":"RMVPE 的训练数据大约到 C6（约 1040 Hz）为止。高于这个音时，它会非常确定地报出低一个八度（或低一个八度加五度）的音，转换出的声音也就唱在那里。**纠正为真实音高** 会把音频降低一个八度再跑一遍 RMVPE（在那里它能读对），用这一遍把每一帧放回正确的八度；两遍一致的地方保留第一遍更精细的音高曲线。低于 460 Hz 的帧从不改动，所以说话和大多数演唱的结果与原来完全相同；音高分析耗时约为三倍。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5314":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-180","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#high-register","content":"选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"5315":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-181","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#high-register","content":"`--high-register`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5316":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-182","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#high-register","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"5317":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-183","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#high-register","content":"**按检测结果**（默认）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5318":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-184","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#high-register","content":"`off`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5319":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-185","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#high-register","content":"使用 RMVPE 的结果，与原版相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5320":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-186","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#high-register","content":"**纠正为真实音高**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5321":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-187","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#high-register","content":"`true_pitch`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5322":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-188","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#high-register","content":"**纠正的最高音高**（默认 1250 Hz）以内的音得到真实音高；更高的音保持低一个八度，因为用 RMVPE 音高训练的音色很少能发出更高的音。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5323":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-189","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#high-register","content":"**纠正，但低一个八度**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5324":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-190","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#high-register","content":"`fold`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5325":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-191","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#high-register","content":"只修正被读错音名的音，并写成比真实音高低一个八度，让每个音都留在音色训练过的音域内。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5326":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-192","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#high-register","content":"这个纠正方法来自 Applio。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5327":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-193","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#auto-pitch","content":"位于 **音高细节** 中；只在转换中生效（实时变声中调会随块跳动）。它计算输入的常用音高（有声帧的中位数）与音色的音高相差多少，并在 **音高** 之外再移调这么多：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5328":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-194","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#auto-pitch","content":"选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"5329":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-195","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#auto-pitch","content":"`--auto-pitch`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5330":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-196","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#auto-pitch","content":"移调","locale":"zh-CN"},"5331":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-197","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#auto-pitch","content":"**关**（默认）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5332":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-198","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#auto-pitch","content":"`off`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5333":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-199","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#auto-pitch","content":"不移调","locale":"zh-CN"},"5334":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-200","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#auto-pitch","content":"**到最近的半音**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5335":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-201","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#auto-pitch","content":"`semitone`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5336":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-202","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#auto-pitch","content":"把差距取整到半音（最多两个八度）。适合说话。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5337":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-203","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#auto-pitch","content":"**按整八度**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5338":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-204","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#auto-pitch","content":"`octave`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5339":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-205","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#auto-pitch","content":"把差距取整到整八度，歌曲保持原调。适合唱歌。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5340":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-206","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#auto-pitch","content":"**目标** 是目标音高。为 0 时就是音色自己的音高：rvc-next 训练音色时会测量训练数据的中位音高，并在音色的 **信息** 中显示为 **训练音高（中位数）**。没有记录它的音色（大多数下载的音色）以 155 Hz（较低的声音）为目标；较高的声音可设为约 255 Hz。任务日志会写出选定的调。来自 Applio 的“建议音高”，它按分块计算；这里对整个文件只选一次。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5341":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-207","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#autotune","content":"位于 **音高细节** 中；转换和实时变声都可用。把每个有声帧拉向 A4 = 440 Hz 调律下最近的半音：1 让每一帧都对齐到音符上（机械的“电音”效果），0.3 ～ 0.6 在保留一些颤音的同时让音准更稳，0 不改变。呼吸声和辅音不会被赋予音符。它修正的是你最终听到的音高，即经过 **音高**、**自动定调** 和 **共振峰** 之后的音高。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5342":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-208","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#rms-mix","content":"> 0 跟随输入的响度，1 保持转换后的响度。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5343":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-209","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#rms-mix","content":"控制输出的音量变化（响度包络）跟随谁：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5344":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-210","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#rms-mix","content":"**0**：输出的音量起伏完全跟随输入，适合需要保留原有轻重、强弱表现的歌声；","locale":"zh-CN"},"5345":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-211","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#rms-mix","content":"**1**：保持模型生成的响度，不做调整；","locale":"zh-CN"},"5346":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-212","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#rms-mix","content":"默认 **0.25**：以输入的起伏为主。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5347":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-213","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#rms-mix","content":"想更多保留原声的轻重、强弱表现时调低；想让输出更接近模型自身的响度时调高。拿不准时保持默认。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5348":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-214","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#speaker","content":"多说话人音色（模型文件中带有说话人信息）在音色选择框下方会多出一个 **说话人** 下拉框，按名称和编号列出各个说话人。选择新音色时，会自动选中它的第一个说话人。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5349":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-215","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#speaker","content":"单说话人音色不显示这个下拉框，使用编号 0。说话人的名称可以在音色详情页中修改，见模型管理。命令行用 `--speaker <编号>` 指定。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5350":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-216","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#presets","content":"预设是一组保存下来的音色参数（不含说话人）。每个预设要么**属于某个音色**，要么是**所有音色**通用的。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5351":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-217","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#每个音色的默认预设","content":"每个音色都有一个**默认预设**，导入音色时自动创建，名为 `Default`，初始值来自设置中的 `convert.default_params`（即上表中的默认值）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5352":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-218","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#每个音色的默认预设","content":"在任意页面**选择一个音色时，参数面板会自动载入它的默认预设**（说话人保持不变）。所以把常用的音高、索引强度等存进默认预设后，这个音色在 **转换** 和 **实时** 中一选即用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5353":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-219","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#每个音色的默认预设","content":"修改默认预设：打开 **模型 › 音色**，点击音色进入详情页，在 **默认参数** 分区中调整参数，点 **保存**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5354":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-220","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#应用预设","content":"点参数面板右上角的 **预设**，菜单中列出：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5355":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-221","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#应用预设","content":"当前音色的预设，其中默认预设带“· 默认”；","locale":"zh-CN"},"5356":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-222","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#应用预设","content":"所有音色通用的预设，带“· 所有音色”；","locale":"zh-CN"},"5357":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-223","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#应用预设","content":"最后一项 **保存为预设**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5358":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-224","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#应用预设","content":"点一个预设即应用它的参数（说话人保持不变），屏幕底部会提示预设名称。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5359":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-225","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#保存预设","content":"调好参数后，点 **预设** › **保存为预设**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5360":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-226","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#保存预设","content":"在 **预设名称** 中输入名称。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5361":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-227","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#保存预设","content":"勾选 **仅用于此音色**，预设只属于当前音色；取消勾选则保存为所有音色通用的预设。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5362":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-228","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#保存预设","content":"勾选了 **仅用于此音色** 时，还可以勾选 **设为此音色的默认预设**，用它替换原来的默认预设。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5363":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-229","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#保存预设","content":"点 **保存**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5364":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-230","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#保存预设","content":"界面中暂时不能删除或重命名预设，请使用命令行：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5365":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-231","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#保存预设","content":"`rvc-next convert` 默认从音色的默认预设出发，`--preset <名称>` 改用其他预设，再用 `--pitch` 等选项单独覆盖。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5366":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-232","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"在 **实时** 页面，参数面板的说明变为“拖动时即时生效。”：所有音色参数（**音高**、**共振峰**、**索引强度**、**辅音保护**、**响度匹配**、**音高细节**；实时变声没有 **极高音** 和 **自动定调**）在拖动滑块时就会应用到正在进行的变声，不需要停止再启动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5367":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-233","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"切换 **音高算法** 时，新算法的模型会在后台加载。如果它尚未下载，变声会继续使用原来的算法，并提示缺少的模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5368":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-234","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"切换 **说话人** 时，会同时换用该说话人的索引。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5369":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-235","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"切换音色同样即时生效，并会载入新音色的默认预设。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5370":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-236","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"实时页使用的参数会被记住，下次打开时恢复。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5371":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-237","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"此外，实时页还有一组 **缓冲与降噪** 参数，控制延迟与稳定性：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5372":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-238","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"5373":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-239","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"范围","locale":"zh-CN"},"5374":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-240","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"默认值","locale":"zh-CN"},"5375":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-241","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"生效方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"5376":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-242","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"**块长**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5377":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-243","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"20 ～ 1500 毫秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"5378":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-244","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"250 毫秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"5379":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-245","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"修改后音频流会短暂重新缓冲","locale":"zh-CN"},"5380":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-246","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"**交叉淡化**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5381":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-247","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"10 ～ 150 毫秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"5382":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-248","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"50 毫秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"5383":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-249","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"修改后音频流会短暂重新缓冲","locale":"zh-CN"},"5384":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-250","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"**上下文**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5385":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-251","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"50 ～ 5000 毫秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"5386":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-252","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"2500 毫秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"5387":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-253","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"修改后音频流会短暂重新缓冲","locale":"zh-CN"},"5388":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-254","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"**输入门限**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5389":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-255","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"−60 ～ 0 dB（−60 为关闭）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5390":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-256","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"−60 dB","locale":"zh-CN"},"5391":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-257","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"即时","locale":"zh-CN"},"5392":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-258","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"**输入降噪** / **输出降噪**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5393":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-259","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"开 / 关","locale":"zh-CN"},"5394":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-260","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"关","locale":"zh-CN"},"5395":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-261","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"即时","locale":"zh-CN"},"5396":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-262","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"这些参数的详细说明和调节方法见实时变声。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5397":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-263","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"实时变声参数的数学处理与原版实时变声逐块一致（在 CPU 上测试）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5398":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","type":"page","content":"人声分离","breadcrumbs":["RVC Next 文档","使用教程"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-separate","locale":"zh-CN"},"5399":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-0","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate","content":"分离 页面用 RoFormer 系列模型拆分音频：把歌曲分成人声与伴奏、去除人声中的混响、把主唱与和声分开。几个步骤还可以串联成一个预设一次完成。分出的任何分轨都可以直接送到 转换 页。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5400":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-1","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-separate#使用步骤","content":"使用步骤","locale":"zh-CN"},"5401":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-2","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"预设","locale":"zh-CN"},"5402":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-3","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-separate#怎么选","content":"怎么选","locale":"zh-CN"},"5403":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-4","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-separate#导入的分离模型","content":"导入的分离模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"5404":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-5","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-separate#下载分离模型","content":"下载分离模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"5405":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-6","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-separate#任务","content":"任务","locale":"zh-CN"},"5406":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-7","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-separate#结果","content":"结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"5407":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-8","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-separate#命令行","content":"命令行","locale":"zh-CN"},"5408":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-9","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate","content":"页面从上到下是 **输入**、**预设**（含 **格式**）和 **结果** 三个分区，底部是固定的操作栏，其中有任务卡片和 **分离** 按钮。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5409":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-10","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate","content":"如果你的目的是“分离人声 → 转换 → 加回伴奏”，不必先来这里：在 **转换** 页打开 **先分离人声** 和 **加回伴奏** 就能一步完成，见转换 › 可选步骤。当你需要**保留**分离出的分轨，或要先检查、处理分轨时，再使用本页面。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5410":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-11","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#使用步骤","content":"在 **输入** 中添加音频：拖入文件、点 **服务器文件** 选择服务器上的文件或整个文件夹（处理该文件夹第一层的音频文件），或点 **之前的结果**。用法与转换页的输入完全相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5411":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-12","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#使用步骤","content":"在 **预设** 中点选一张卡片。每张卡片显示预设名称、说明和它输出的分轨，例如“分轨：vocals, instrumental”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5412":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-13","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#使用步骤","content":"在 **格式** 中选择输出格式：WAV、FLAC、MP3、M4A 或 OGG（Opus，始终为 48 kHz）。默认是 FLAC。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5413":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-14","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#使用步骤","content":"如果操作栏显示“**需要 Separation: ……**”，先点 **下载** 获取该预设所需的分离模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5414":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-15","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#使用步骤","content":"点 **分离**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5415":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-16","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#使用步骤","content":"页面会记住你上次选的预设。从未选过时，使用 **设置 › 训练默认值** 中的 **默认分离预设**（初始为 **Vocals**）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5416":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-17","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"预设的名称和说明由服务器提供，目前以英文显示。内置预设如下：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5417":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-18","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"预设（界面显示）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5418":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-19","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"ID","locale":"zh-CN"},"5419":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-20","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"5420":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-21","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"输出的分轨","locale":"zh-CN"},"5421":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-22","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"需要的模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"5422":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-23","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"**Vocals**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5423":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-24","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"`vocals`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5424":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-25","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"把歌曲分成人声和伴奏（BS-RoFormer，SDR 12.96）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5425":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-26","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"`vocals`、`instrumental`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5426":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-27","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"Separation: Vocals","locale":"zh-CN"},"5427":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-28","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"**Vocals, aggressive**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5428":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-29","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"`vocals-aggressive`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5429":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"更彻底地分离人声和伴奏（BS-RoFormer，SDR 12.98）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5430":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"`vocals`、`instrumental`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5431":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"Separation: Vocals, aggressive","locale":"zh-CN"},"5432":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"**Remove reverb**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5433":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"`dereverb`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5434":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"去除人声中的混响和回声（Mel-RoFormer，SDR 18.81）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5435":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-36","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"`noreverb`、`reverb`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5436":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-37","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"Separation: Remove reverb","locale":"zh-CN"},"5437":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-38","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"**Remove reverb, aggressive**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5438":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-39","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"`dereverb-aggressive`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5439":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-40","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"更强力地去除混响和回声（Mel-RoFormer，SDR 19.17）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5440":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-41","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"`noreverb`、`reverb`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5441":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-42","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"Separation: Remove reverb, aggressive","locale":"zh-CN"},"5442":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-43","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"**Lead vocal**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5443":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-44","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"`karaoke`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5444":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-45","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"保留主唱、分出和声；应当用在**人声分轨**上（Mel-RoFormer karaoke，SDR 10.20）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5445":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-46","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"`main_vocal`、`off_vocal`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5446":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-47","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"Separation: Lead vocal","locale":"zh-CN"},"5447":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-48","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"**Vocals, clean** （串联）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5448":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-49","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"`vocals-clean`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5449":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-50","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"先分离人声，再去混响：得到干声和伴奏","locale":"zh-CN"},"5450":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-51","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"`vocals`、`instrumental`、`reverb`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5451":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-52","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"Vocals + Remove reverb","locale":"zh-CN"},"5452":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-53","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"**Lead vocal, clean** （串联）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5453":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-54","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"`lead-clean`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5454":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-55","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"先分离人声，再提取主唱，最后去混响：得到干净的主唱、和声和伴奏","locale":"zh-CN"},"5455":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-56","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"`main_vocal`、`instrumental`、`off_vocal`、`reverb`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5456":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-57","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"Vocals + Lead vocal + Remove reverb","locale":"zh-CN"},"5457":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-58","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"分轨名称的含义：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5458":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-59","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"分轨","locale":"zh-CN"},"5459":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-60","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"5460":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-61","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"`vocals`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5461":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-62","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"人声（串联预设中为去混响后的干声）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5462":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-63","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"`instrumental`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5463":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-64","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"伴奏","locale":"zh-CN"},"5464":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-65","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"`noreverb` / `reverb`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5465":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-66","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"去除混响后的声音 / 被分离出来的混响","locale":"zh-CN"},"5466":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-67","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"`main_vocal` / `off_vocal`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5467":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-68","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"主唱 / 和声","locale":"zh-CN"},"5468":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-69","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"带 **串联** 标记的预设会依次运行多个模型：每一步处理上一步的主分轨（例如 **Vocals, clean** 先得到人声，再对人声去混响），每个分轨只输出一次。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5469":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-70","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#怎么选","content":"**普通歌曲转换**：用 **Vocals**。分离后人声里还残留伴奏时，试试 **Vocals, aggressive**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5470":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-71","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#怎么选","content":"**人声混响很重**：用 **Vocals, clean**，直接得到干声，转换效果通常更好。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5471":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-72","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#怎么选","content":"**有和声的歌曲**：用 **Lead vocal, clean** 只保留主唱再转换，避免和声被一起转换。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5472":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-73","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#怎么选","content":"**已经是干净的人声，只是有混响**：直接用 **Remove reverb** 或 **Remove reverb, aggressive**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5473":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-74","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#怎么选","content":"**Lead vocal** 要用在人声上，而不是整首歌：先用 **Vocals** 分出人声，再在人声结果上选 **用作输入**，换成 **Lead vocal** 预设分离一次。或者直接用串联的 **Lead vocal, clean**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5474":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-75","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#导入的分离模型","content":"你也可以在 **模型 › 分离模型** 中导入自己的分离模型（检查点及其 `.yaml` 配置）。每个导入的模型都会在这里成为一个单步预设，卡片上带 **已导入** 标记。导入方法见模型管理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5475":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-76","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#下载分离模型","content":"每个内置预设需要一个或多个分离模型，每个约 305 MB（两个 Vocals 模型）或约 436 MB（其余三个）。获取方式：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5476":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-77","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#下载分离模型","content":"选好预设后，如果模型尚未下载，操作栏中的 **分离** 按钮会被替换为“**需要 Separation: Vocals**”之类的提示和 **下载** 按钮，点击即可下载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5477":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-78","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#下载分离模型","content":"**模型 › 分离模型** 的 **内置** 分组列出全部五个内置模型，可以逐个 **下载** 或删除；","locale":"zh-CN"},"5478":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-79","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#下载分离模型","content":"**模型 › 资源** 的 **分离** 分组中，点 **下载全部分离文件** 一次下载全部。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5479":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-80","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#下载分离模型","content":"分离模型保存在资源文件夹的 `pymss_weights/` 中，与原版 RVC 的布局相同。如果你在设置中把资源文件夹指向原版 RVC 的 `assets/`，已经下载过的同名模型可以直接使用，见从原版 RVC 迁移。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5480":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-81","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#任务","content":"每点一次 **分离**，就为当前全部输入创建**一个**任务，标题形如 `Separate song.flac · Vocals`（多个输入时为 `Separate song.flac and 2 more · Vocals`），每个输入是一步。分离在一个独立的工作进程中运行，可以随时 **取消**，失败后可以 **重试**，点 **日志** 查看过程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5481":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-82","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#任务","content":"分离使用 **设置 › 计算** 中选择的设备。CPU 也能运行，但 RoFormer 模型在 CPU 上较慢，长歌曲需要耐心等待。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5482":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-83","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#任务","content":"在 DirectML 上，如果模型以半精度失败，RVC Next 会自动改用 fp32 重新运行（日志中记录 `Retrying in fp32`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5483":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-84","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#结果","content":"分离出的分轨出现在 **结果** 分区，**按源文件分组**：每组以源文件名为标题，下面是它的各个分轨，每个分轨带 **分轨** 标签和分轨名称（如 `vocals`）。播放、对比、下载等通用操作见界面总览 › 结果列表。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5484":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-85","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#结果","content":"本页特有的两个操作，在每个分轨的 **更多操作**（⋮）菜单中：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5485":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-86","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#结果","content":"**转换这个**：把该分轨加入 **转换** 页的输入，并跳转到 **转换** 页。选好音色就可以转换了。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5486":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-87","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#结果","content":"**用作输入**：把该分轨加回本页的输入，用另一个预设再分离一次，例如对 `vocals` 运行 **Lead vocal**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5487":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-88","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#结果","content":"结果保存在数据文件夹的 `outputs/<日期>/<任务 ID>/` 中，文件名为：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5488":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-89","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#结果","content":"例如 `song.flac` 用 **Vocals** 分离并输出 FLAC，得到 `song.vocals.flac` 和 `song.instrumental.flac`。同名文件已存在时会加序号，如 `song.vocals-2.flac`，不会覆盖。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5489":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-90","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#命令行","content":"全部选项见命令参考。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5490":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"page","content":"设置","breadcrumbs":["RVC Next 文档","使用教程"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings","locale":"zh-CN"},"5491":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-0","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings","content":"设置 页面集中了 rvc-next 的所有选项，按八个标签页分组：常规、计算、音频、存储、下载、训练默认值、外观、关于。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5492":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-1","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings#设置保存在哪里","content":"设置保存在哪里","locale":"zh-CN"},"5493":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-2","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"常规","locale":"zh-CN"},"5494":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-3","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings#访问令牌","content":"访问令牌","locale":"zh-CN"},"5495":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-4","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"计算","locale":"zh-CN"},"5496":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-5","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings#音频","content":"音频","locale":"zh-CN"},"5497":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-6","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings#存储","content":"存储","locale":"zh-CN"},"5498":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-7","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings#文件夹","content":"文件夹","locale":"zh-CN"},"5499":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-8","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings#浏览器可打开的文件夹","content":"浏览器可打开的文件夹","locale":"zh-CN"},"5500":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-9","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings#结果保留天数","content":"结果保留天数","locale":"zh-CN"},"5501":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-10","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings#下载","content":"下载","locale":"zh-CN"},"5502":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-11","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings#训练默认值","content":"训练默认值","locale":"zh-CN"},"5503":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-12","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings#外观","content":"外观","locale":"zh-CN"},"5504":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-13","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings#关于","content":"关于","locale":"zh-CN"},"5505":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-14","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings#在命令行中修改设置","content":"在命令行中修改设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"5506":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-15","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings","content":"大多数选项改动后立即保存，并提示 **设置已保存**；**存储** 标签页中的文件夹需要点 **保存**。少数选项（服务器地址、端口）要到下次启动服务器时才生效，界面上会注明。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5507":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-16","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#设置保存在哪里","content":"服务器的设置保存在数据文件夹的 `settings.toml` 中。数据文件夹默认为：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5508":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-17","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#设置保存在哪里","content":"Windows：`%APPDATA%\\rvc-next`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5509":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-18","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#设置保存在哪里","content":"macOS：`~/Library/Application Support/rvc-next`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5510":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-19","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#设置保存在哪里","content":"Linux：`~/.local/share/rvc-next`（或 `$XDG_DATA_HOME/rvc-next`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5511":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-20","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#设置保存在哪里","content":"可以用环境变量 `RVC_NEXT_DATA_DIR` 或 `rvc-next webui --data-dir` 指定其他位置。`rvc-next config path` 会打印设置文件的路径。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5512":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-21","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#设置保存在哪里","content":"**外观** 和 **常规 › 语言** 属于界面偏好：它们保存在服务器上（换个浏览器打开也一样），同时在浏览器本地保留一份副本，不写入 `settings.toml`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5513":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-22","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#设置保存在哪里","content":"每个设置都可以用 `RVC_NEXT_<分组>__<字段>` 形式的环境变量覆盖，例如 `RVC_NEXT_SERVER__PORT=8000`、`RVC_NEXT_PATHS__ASSETS_DIR=D:\\rvc-assets`。环境变量的优先级高于 `settings.toml`：界面上显示的是最终生效的值；在界面上修改会写入 `settings.toml`，但只要环境变量还在，生效的仍是环境变量的值。**存储** 标签页中被环境变量固定的文件夹会标注 **由环境变量设置**。完整列表见 配置与环境变量，或运行 `rvc-next env`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5514":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-23","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"5515":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-24","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"默认值","locale":"zh-CN"},"5516":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-25","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"5517":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-26","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"**语言**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5518":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-27","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"**自动（…）**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5519":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-28","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"界面语言：自动跟随系统，或固定为 English / 简体中文。立即生效","locale":"zh-CN"},"5520":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-29","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"**服务器启动时打开浏览器**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5521":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"开","locale":"zh-CN"},"5522":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"运行 `rvc-next webui` 时自动打开网页。命令行的 `--open/--no-open` 可以临时覆盖","locale":"zh-CN"},"5523":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"**服务器地址**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5524":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"`127.0.0.1`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5525":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"服务器监听的地址。**下次启动服务器时生效。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5526":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"**端口**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5527":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-36","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"`7868`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5528":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-37","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"服务器端口，下次启动时生效。端口被占用时会自动尝试下一个端口","locale":"zh-CN"},"5529":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-38","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#访问令牌","content":"访问令牌是可选的一层保护：设置之后，每个访问服务器 API 的请求（包括网页本身发出的请求）都必须带上它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5530":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-39","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#访问令牌","content":"在 **访问令牌** 输入框中输入一个足够长的随机字符串。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5531":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-40","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#访问令牌","content":"点 **设置令牌**。左侧标签会变成 **已设置访问令牌**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5532":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-41","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#访问令牌","content":"浏览器之后会弹出 **访问令牌** 对话框（**此服务器需要访问令牌。**），输入同一个令牌即可继续使用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5533":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-42","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#访问令牌","content":"要取消，点 **清除令牌**。令牌保存后不会再显示出来。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5534":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-43","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#访问令牌","content":"默认地址 `127.0.0.1` 只允许本机访问。把 **服务器地址** 改成 `0.0.0.0` 或局域网 IP 之后，不需要访问令牌，能连上的人都能使用全部功能（包括浏览下面允许的服务器文件夹）。只在可信的网络中这样做，或自己加上防火墙、VPN 等保护，或设置访问令牌。详见 远程访问与安全。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5535":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-44","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"5536":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-45","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"默认值","locale":"zh-CN"},"5537":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-46","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"5538":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-47","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"**设备**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5539":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-48","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"**自动**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5540":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-49","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"用哪个设备运行模型。下拉框列出检测到的设备及显存，不满足要求的设备标有 ✕。自动时选择最合适的 NVIDIA 显卡（计算能力最高、显存最大），没有时尝试 DirectML，再没有就用 CPU。也可以固定为某张显卡（`cuda:N`）、DirectML、CPU，或实验性的 Apple MPS（`mps`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5541":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-50","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"**精度**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5542":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-51","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"**自动**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5543":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-52","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"**自动** / **fp32** / **fp16**。自动时在支持的显卡上用半精度（fp16），否则用 fp32，规则与原版相同","locale":"zh-CN"},"5544":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-53","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"**转换时使用 CUDA Graph**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5545":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-54","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"关","locale":"zh-CN"},"5546":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-55","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"离线转换时用 CUDA Graph 减少 GPU 调度开销","locale":"zh-CN"},"5547":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-56","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"**实时转换使用 CUDA Graph**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5548":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-57","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"开","locale":"zh-CN"},"5549":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-58","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"实时变声时使用 CUDA Graph","locale":"zh-CN"},"5550":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-59","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"**空闲多少分钟后卸载模型（0：从不）**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5551":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-60","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"10","locale":"zh-CN"},"5552":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-61","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"模型闲置超过这么久后自动卸载，释放显存。0 表示从不自动卸载","locale":"zh-CN"},"5553":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-62","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"**同时运行的 GPU 任务数**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5554":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-63","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"1","locale":"zh-CN"},"5555":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-64","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"1–16。显存充足时可以调大，让多个转换/分离任务并行","locale":"zh-CN"},"5556":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-65","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"下方的表格列出每个设备的编号、名称、将使用的精度，以及不能使用时的原因。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5557":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-66","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"修改设备、精度或 **转换时使用 CUDA Graph** 后，服务器已加载的模型会被卸载，下一个任务按新设置重新加载。实时变声在自己的后台进程中运行，它在进程启动时读取这些设置；如果改了之后实时变声没有变化，重启一次服务器即可。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5558":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-67","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#音频","content":"这里的设备面板与 **实时** 页面上的完全相同，两处修改的是同一份设置，用法见 实时变声 的“音频设备”一节。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5559":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-68","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#音频","content":"选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"5560":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-69","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#音频","content":"默认值","locale":"zh-CN"},"5561":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-70","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#音频","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"5562":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-71","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#音频","content":"**启用 ASIO 驱动（Windows）**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5563":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-72","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#音频","content":"关","locale":"zh-CN"},"5564":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-73","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#音频","content":"在设备列表中加入 ASIO 驱动（需要声卡提供 ASIO 驱动）。开启后到 **实时** 页面点 **刷新设备**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5565":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-74","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#音频","content":"**自动重新连接丢失的设备**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5566":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-75","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#音频","content":"开","locale":"zh-CN"},"5567":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-76","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#音频","content":"实时变声运行中设备断开时，每 2 秒重新查找，设备回来后自动恢复；关闭后设备一断开就停止","locale":"zh-CN"},"5568":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-77","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#音频","content":"**停止时显示输入电平**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5569":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-78","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#音频","content":"开","locale":"zh-CN"},"5570":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-79","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#音频","content":"设备面板显示时，即使实时变声未运行，也会打开麦克风显示 **输入电平**；页面关闭或隐藏约 15 秒后释放麦克风。如果不希望麦克风一直被占用，可以关闭","locale":"zh-CN"},"5571":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-80","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#音频","content":"**把输出设备当作输入（内录）**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5572":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-81","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#音频","content":"关","locale":"zh-CN"},"5573":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-82","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#音频","content":"在 **输入** 菜单中列出所有输出设备，带 **内录** 标签：这台设备播放的声音（视频、游戏等）就成为输入。Windows 通过 WASAPI 环回录制，Linux 通过 PulseAudio/PipeWire 的监视器录制；macOS 需要安装 BlackHole 等环回驱动，并把它作为普通输入选择。见 录制输出设备。要把转换后的声音*送给*其他程序，见 在其他程序中使用实时变声","locale":"zh-CN"},"5574":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-83","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#文件夹","content":"选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"5575":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-84","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#文件夹","content":"留空时的位置","locale":"zh-CN"},"5576":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-85","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#文件夹","content":"存放内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"5577":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-86","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#文件夹","content":"**音色**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5578":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-87","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#文件夹","content":"`<数据文件夹>/models`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5579":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-88","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#文件夹","content":"音色库、导入的底模、分离模型、未分配的索引","locale":"zh-CN"},"5580":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-89","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#文件夹","content":"**实验**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5581":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-90","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#文件夹","content":"`<数据文件夹>/experiments`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5582":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-91","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#文件夹","content":"训练实验","locale":"zh-CN"},"5583":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-92","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#文件夹","content":"**结果**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5584":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-93","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#文件夹","content":"`<数据文件夹>/outputs`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5585":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-94","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#文件夹","content":"转换和分离的结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"5586":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-95","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#文件夹","content":"**资源**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5587":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-96","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#文件夹","content":"`<数据文件夹>/assets`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5588":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-97","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#文件夹","content":"HuBERT、RMVPE、底模、分离模型等下载的文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"5589":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-98","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#文件夹","content":"每个输入框下方会显示 **默认：\\{实际路径}**。留空表示使用数据文件夹中的默认位置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5590":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-99","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#文件夹","content":"**资源** 文件夹采用与原版 RVC 相同的布局，所以可以直接指向原版 RVC 安装里的 `assets` 文件夹，复用已经下载好的 HuBERT、RMVPE 和底模，不必重复下载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5591":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-100","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#文件夹","content":"修改文件夹不会自动搬移已有的文件。如果要换位置，请先自己把文件夹移过去，再修改设置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5592":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-101","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#浏览器可打开的文件夹","content":"**浏览器可打开的文件夹** 决定网页上的 **服务器文件**、**浏览…** 对话框能看到服务器上的哪些位置，每行一个路径。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5593":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-102","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#浏览器可打开的文件夹","content":"留空时（默认）包括：你的主目录、已添加的原版 RVC 安装、数据文件夹，以及每个驱动器（Windows 的 `C:\\`、`D:\\`…）或挂载的卷（macOS 的 `/Volumes/…`，Linux 的 `/media/<用户>/…`、`/run/media/<用户>/…`、`/mnt/…`）。输入框的灰色占位文字就是当前实际生效的列表。填写后则只允许这些文件夹。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5594":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-103","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#浏览器可打开的文件夹","content":"这些文件夹对所有浏览器都生效，包括其他电脑上的浏览器；命令行不受这个限制。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5595":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-104","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#结果保留天数","content":"**结果保留天数（0：一直保留）**，默认 0。设为正数后，早于这么多天的转换/分离结果会被自动删除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5596":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-105","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#结果保留天数","content":"改完文件夹或可浏览的文件夹后，点右下角的 **保存**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5597":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-106","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#下载","content":"选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"5598":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-107","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url