ags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-train#改了设置哪些阶段要重跑","content":"改了设置，哪些阶段要重跑？","locale":"zh-CN"},"5699":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-8","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-train#第-3-步运行","content":"第 3 步：运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"5700":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-9","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-train#第-4-步结果","content":"第 4 步：结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"5701":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-10","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-train#导出到音色库","content":"导出到音色库","locale":"zh-CN"},"5702":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-11","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-train#推荐流程","content":"推荐流程","locale":"zh-CN"},"5703":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-12","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-train#命令行","content":"命令行","locale":"zh-CN"},"5704":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-13","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train","content":"和原版 RVC 相比，rvc-next 把“处理数据 → 提取音高 → 提取特征 → 训练 → 建索引”这些步骤合并成一个流程：**全部运行** 只会运行还没完成、或输入已经改变的阶段。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5705":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-14","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#实验列表","content":"打开左侧导航的 **训练**，可以看到所有实验的卡片。每张卡片显示：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5706":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-15","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#实验列表","content":"实验名称，正在运行时带 **运行中** 标签；","locale":"zh-CN"},"5707":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-16","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#实验列表","content":"采样率 · 模型版本 · **单说话人** 或 **多说话人**；","locale":"zh-CN"},"5708":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-17","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#实验列表","content":"五个阶段的状态标签：**切片**、**音高**、**特征**、**训练**、**索引**（完成为主色，**已过期** 为警示色，**失败** 为红色）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"5709":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-18","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#实验列表","content":"**最近活动 …**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5710":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-19","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#实验列表","content":"点击卡片进入实验页面。实验保存在数据文件夹的 `experiments/` 下（可在 **设置 › 存储 › 实验** 中更改）。直接复制到这个文件夹里的实验文件夹（含 `experiment.json`，或原版的 `0_gt_wavs` 文件夹）也会自动出现在列表中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5711":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-20","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建实验","content":"点 **新建实验**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5712":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-21","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建实验","content":"填写 **实验名称**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5713":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-22","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建实验","content":"选择 **单说话人** 或 **多说话人**。单说话人时可以直接填 **数据集文件夹**，或点 **浏览…** 在服务器上选择文件夹（多说话人的表格在实验页面里填写）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5714":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-23","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建实验","content":"点 **添加**，进入新实验的页面。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5715":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-24","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建实验","content":"新实验的采样率、版本、音高引导、轮数等初始值来自 **设置 › 训练默认值**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5716":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-25","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建实验","content":"**浏览…** 只有在服务器本机打开网页，或服务器设置了访问令牌时才可用。否则请直接把服务器上的路径粘贴进输入框。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5717":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-26","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#导入原版-rvc-实验","content":"如果你在原版 RVC 里已经训练过（实验在原版的 `logs/<名称>` 下），可以把它导入继续使用：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5718":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-27","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#导入原版-rvc-实验","content":"点 **导入实验**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5719":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-28","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#导入原版-rvc-实验","content":"在 **原版实验文件夹（logs/\\<名称>）** 中填入路径，可选填一个新的 **实验名称**（默认用文件夹名）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5720":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-29","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#导入原版-rvc-实验","content":"点 **导入**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5721":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#导入原版-rvc-实验","content":"rvc-next 会把整个文件夹**复制**到实验目录（原文件夹不会被改动），并根据其中的内容推断采样率、版本、音高引导和已完成的阶段。文件夹里必须有 `0_gt_wavs` 文件夹或 `config.json`，否则会提示它不像一个 RVC 实验。导入的实验没有记录原始数据集文件夹；如果要重新切片，先在 **数据集** 步骤里填上。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5722":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#实验页面","content":"实验页面顶部显示实验名称、采样率 · 版本 · 文件夹路径，右侧有 **删除** 按钮（实验运行时不可用；删除的实验会被移到数据文件夹的回收站 `trash/`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5723":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#实验页面","content":"下面是四个步骤：**数据集**、**设置**、**运行**、**结果**。实验运行时，步骤条下方会显示整体进度条，**运行** 步骤上标注当前阶段。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5724":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-1-步数据集","content":"选择 **单说话人**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5725":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-1-步数据集","content":"在 **数据集文件夹** 中填写路径，或点 **浏览…** 选择。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5726":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-1-步数据集","content":"点 **保存**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5727":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-36","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-1-步数据集","content":"只会读取该文件夹**顶层**的音频文件，不会进入子文件夹。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5728":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-37","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-1-步数据集","content":"多说话人数据集用一张 **说话人** 表格描述，每行一个说话人：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5729":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-38","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-1-步数据集","content":"列","locale":"zh-CN"},"5730":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-39","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-1-步数据集","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"5731":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-40","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-1-步数据集","content":"**名称**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5732":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-41","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-1-步数据集","content":"说话人名称，不能重复","locale":"zh-CN"},"5733":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-42","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-1-步数据集","content":"**ID**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5734":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-43","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-1-步数据集","content":"0–109，不能重复（重复时显示 **ID N 重复**）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5735":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-44","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-1-步数据集","content":"**文件夹**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5736":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-45","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-1-步数据集","content":"该说话人的音频文件夹，点 选择","locale":"zh-CN"},"5737":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-46","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-1-步数据集","content":"**重复**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5738":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-47","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-1-步数据集","content":"1–100，该说话人的数据在训练中重复的次数，用来平衡数据量不同的说话人","locale":"zh-CN"},"5739":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-48","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-1-步数据集","content":"点 **添加说话人** 新增一行，删除一行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5740":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-49","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-1-步数据集","content":"如果你的数据已经按原版的约定组织成 `名称_ID_重复` 形式的子文件夹（例如 `alice_0_1`、`bob_1_2`），点 **从 名称_ID_重复 文件夹填充**，选择它们的上级文件夹，表格会自动填好。每个子文件夹都必须符合这个格式、ID 在 0–109 之间、重复次数至少为 1、同一个 ID 只对应一个名称，并且里面有音频。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5741":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-50","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-1-步数据集","content":"填好后点 **保存**。导出的音色会带上这些说话人名称。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5742":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-51","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-1-步数据集","content":"**从这台电脑添加音频**：把音频文件或它们的 zip 拖到拖放区（或点击它），会上传到实验自己的 `dataset_upload/` 文件夹，数据集随即指向那里；从另一台电脑访问服务器时也就不需要服务器上的文件夹。**多个说话人** 时请上传一个 zip，其顶层文件夹按 `名称_ID_重复次数` 命名（同上）：它们会成为说话人表。上传会添加到已有的文件中；**删除已上传的音频** 会清空该文件夹。zip 中的非音频文件、隐藏文件和 `__MACOSX` 会被跳过。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5743":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-52","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-1-步数据集","content":"**先清理数据集**：可以选择一个分离预设，在切片之前先对整个数据集做一遍人声分离（例如去掉伴奏或混响），结果存放在实验的 `dataset_clean/` 中，原始文件不变。默认 **不清理**。预设与 **分离** 页面相同，所需的分离模型需要先下载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5744":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-53","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-1-步数据集","content":"**切片**（点击展开）决定录音如何被切成训练片段。默认值与原版相同；这些选项来自 Applio：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5745":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-54","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-1-步数据集","content":"设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"5746":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-55","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-1-步数据集","content":"选项（默认）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5747":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-56","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-1-步数据集","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"5748":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-57","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-1-步数据集","content":"**切分方式**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5749":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-58","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-1-步数据集","content":"先按静音切开，再切成片段（默认）/ 直接按长度切成片段 / 保持原