/quick-start-28","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#rvc-next-能做什么","content":"**数值代码是移植而非重写**：合成器、RMVPE、转换与流式处理的算法都逐行移植自原版，并用“黄金测试”在 CPU 上与原版对比结果，因此已有的 `.pth` 音色和 `added_*.index` 索引可直接使用，声音与原版一致。详见与原版的一致性。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6065":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-29","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#rvc-next-能做什么","content":"**按内容识别模型**：导入 `.pth`、`.index`、`.zip` 时按文件内容而非文件名判断类型与版本，并自动为音色配对索引。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6066":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-30","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#适合谁","content":"**想给歌曲或语音换声的用户**：只用 **转换** 和 **模型** 两个页面就够了。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6067":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-31","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#适合谁","content":"**主播、语音聊天用户**：使用 **实时** 页面，在服务器电脑上实时变声。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6068":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-32","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#适合谁","content":"**训练自己音色的用户**：**训练** 页面把原版的各个步骤整理成可单独重跑的阶段。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6069":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-33","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#适合谁","content":"**原版 RVC 的老用户**：可以直接读取原版安装中的音色和资源，见从原版 RVC 迁移。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6070":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-34","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#适合谁","content":"**喜欢命令行或要批处理的用户**：每个界面操作都有对应的 `rvc-next` 命令，见命令行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6071":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-35","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#文档的组织","content":"部分","locale":"zh-CN"},"6072":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-36","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#文档的组织","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"6073":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-37","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#文档的组织","content":"**快速开始**（本节）","locale":"zh-CN"},"6074":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-38","page_id":"/doc