d-files","content":"Extracted files are identified individually","locale":"en"},"11099":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-85","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#recognized-files","content":"As above","locale":"en"},"11100":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-86","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#recognized-files","content":"Unrecognized files are skipped, with **Skipped: …** shown after import.","locale":"en"},"11101":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-87","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#import-steps","content":"Drop files into a drop zone (or click to select). You can drop several files at once, such as a `.pth` with its `.index`, or a `.zip` containing both.","locale":"en"},"11102":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-88","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#import-steps","content":"A progress bar appears during upload.","locale":"en"},"11103":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-89","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#import-steps","content":"If every file's destination is clear, import finishes immediately with a notification such as **Imported \\{names} with 1 index(es)**.","locale":"en"},"11104":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-90","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#import-steps","content":"If anything is uncertain, **Review the import** opens for you to confirm before importing.","locale":"en"},"11105":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-91","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#links","content":"Under each drop zone, **Or add from a link** takes one or more links separated by spaces; **Add** has the server download them (a **Download links** job shows the progress), and the import then goes on as for dropped files:","locale":"en"},"11106":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-92","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#links","content":"**Hugging Face**: a file (`…/blob/main/x.pth` or `…/resolve/main/x.pth`), a repository (`huggingface.co/owner/repo`), or a folder in one (`…/tree/main/folder`): every `.pth`, `.index`, `.zip` and separation file in it is downloaded. Hugging Face links go through the download source chosen in **Settings › Downloads** (for example hf-mirror).","locale":"en"},"11107":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-93","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#links","content":"**Google Drive**: a shared file link (`drive.google.com/file/d/…`). Drive changes how its downloads work from time to time; if a link stops working, download the file in the browser and drop it.","locale":"en"},"11108":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-94","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#links","content":"**Any other link** to a file.","locale":"en"},"11109":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-95","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#links","content":"Links must point at the internet: a link to the server's own machine or its local network (such as `127.0.0.1`, `192.168.…`, `10.…`), including one a site redirects to, is refused, so the web interface cannot be used to reach other services next to the server. The command line (`rvc-next model import <link>`) may download from local addresses. Files over 8 GiB and links that lead to a web page instead of a file are refused. As with any file, a model from the internet is only read as data (see Recognized files); its licence is yours to check.","locale":"en"},"11110":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-96","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#links","content":"Possible notifications after import:","locale":"en"},"11111":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-97","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#links","content":"Message","locale":"en"},"11112":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-98","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#links","content":"Meaning","locale":"en"},"11113":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-99","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#links","content":"**Imported \\{names}** / **Imported \\{names} with N index(es)**","locale":"en"},"11114":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-100","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#links","content":"New voices were added to the library","locale":"en"},"11115":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-101","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#links","content":"**Attached \\{names} to voices in your library**","locale":"en"},"11116":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-102","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#links","content":"Indexes were attached to existing library voices","locale":"en"},"11117":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-103","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#links","content":"**Kept \\{names} as unassigned indexes; assign them under Voices.**","locale":"en"},"11118":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-104","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#links","content":"Indexes went to **Unassigned indexes**","locale":"en"},"11119":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-105","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#links","content":"**Imported N base model(s); choose them in an experiment’s settings.**","locale":"en"},"11120":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-106","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#links","content":"Base models were imported","locale":"en"},"11121":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-107","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#links","content":"**Imported N separation model(s); they appear in Separate.**","locale":"en"},"11122":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-108","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#links","content":"Separation models were imported","locale":"en"},"11123":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-109","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#how-indexes-are-paired-automatically","content":"Rules for pairing indexes with voices:","locale":"en"},"11124":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-110","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#how-indexes-are-paired-automatically","content":"**Versions must match**: v1 indexes can pair only with v1 voices, v2 only with v2. This is a hard requirement.","locale":"en"},"11125":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-111","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#how-indexes-are-paired-automatically","content":"Compatible voices are scored by name: an exact experiment-name match scores highest, followed by a name containing the voice's name, then similar names. Sharing a folder adds to the score.","locale":"en"},"11126":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-112","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#how-indexes-are-paired-automatically","content":"Automatic pairing happens only when a voice is the index's **only compatible match** in this import, or clearly outscores the other candidates. Otherwise, you choose.","locale":"en"},"11127":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-113","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#how-indexes-are-paired-automatically","content":"Existing library voices are considered only when no suitable voice is in this import.","locale":"en"},"11128":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-114","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#review-the-import-dialog","content":"The dialog begins with: **Some files could not be paired with certainty. Check the choices below; only compatible voices are offered for each index.** Files are grouped by type:","locale":"en"},"11129":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-115","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#review-the-import-dialog","content":"**Voices**: edit each voice's **Name** and use its **Import** switch to decide whether to import it.","locale":"en"},"11130":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-116","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#review-the-import-dialog","content":"**Indexes**: each index shows its vector count, pairing state and reasons. Choose a voice in **Voice**—**\\{name} (this import)** or **\\{name} (library)**—or select **Keep unassigned** to put it in unassigned indexes. If the target has several speakers, you can also choose a **Speaker** (default **All speakers**).","locale":"en"},"11131":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-117","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#review-the-import-dialog","content":"**Base models and checkpoints**: for each G, select **Use as** **Base model**, **Extract a voice** or **Skip**, and optionally rename it. For a base model, select its paired **Discriminator (D)** (or **None**).","locale":"en"},"11132":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-118","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#review-the-import-dialog","content":"**Separation models**: choose a **Checkpoint** for each YAML, enter a name, select **Primary stem** and **Secondary stem** and name them (**Primary name**, **Secondary name**). Use the **Import** switch to decide whether to import it.","locale":"en"},"11133":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-119","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#review-the-import-dialog","content":"**Not imported**: unusable files and their reasons, such as **not a model file** or **discriminator without its generator**.","locale":"en"},"11134":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-120","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#review-the-import-dialog","content":"Index pairing states:","locale":"en"},"11135":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-121","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#review-the-import-dialog","content":"State","locale":"en"},"11136":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-122","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#review-the-import-dialog","content":"Meaning","locale":"en"},"11137":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-123","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#review-the-import-dialog","content":"**Only match**","locale":"en"},"11138":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-124","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#review-the-import-dialog","content":"Only one compatible voice","locale":"en"},"11139":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-125","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#review-the-import-dialog","content":"**Matched**","locale":"en"},"11140":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-126","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#review-the-import-dialog","content":"A match was found by name or folder","locale":"en"},"11141":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-127","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#review-the-import-dialog","content":"**Choose**","locale":"en"},"11142":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-128","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#review-the-import-dialog","content":"Several candidates; you must choose","locale":"en"},"11143":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-129","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#review-the-import-dialog","content":"**No fit**","locale":"en"},"11144":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-130","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#review-the-import-dialog","content":"No voice with a matching version","locale":"en"},"11145":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-131","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#review-the-import-dialog","content":"**Empty**","locale":"en"},"11146":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-132","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#review-the-import-dialog","content":"No vectors (a `trained_` index); cannot be used","locale":"en"},"11147":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-133","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#review-the-import-dialog","content":"**Duplicate**","locale":"en"},"11148":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-134","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#review-the-import-dialog","content":"Another index fits the same voice better","locale":"en"},"11149":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-135","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#review-the-import-dialog","content":"**Chosen**","locale":"en"},"11150":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-136","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#review-the-import-dialog","content":"You selected a match manually","locale":"en"},"11151":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-137","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#review-the-import-dialog","content":"Click **Import** to confirm. **Cancel** abandons this import and discards the uploaded files.","locale":"en"},"11152":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-138","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#unassigned-indexes","content":"Indexes without a paired voice appear in **Unassigned indexes** at the top of **Voices**: **Indexes imported without a voice. Only voices of the matching version are offered.**","locale":"en"},"11153":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-139","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#unassigned-indexes","content":"Select a voice in **Voice** (only matching versions are listed). For voices with several speakers, you can also select a **Speaker**.","locale":"en"},"11154":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-140","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#unassigned-indexes","content":"Click **Assign**.","locale":"en"},"11155":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-141","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#unassigned-indexes","content":"Click Delete for indexes you do not need.","locale":"en"},"11156":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-142","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#unassigned-indexes","content":"If the library has no voice of the same version, a message such as **No v1 voice in the library yet** appears.","locale":"en"},"11157":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-143","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#applio","content":"Applio, another RVC application, writes a few extra details into its voices; rvc-next reads them:","locale":"en"},"11158":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-144","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#applio","content":"Voices with Applio's default vocoder (HiFi-GAN) are RVC voices and work as they are. Their author, epoch, step and training length appear in **About**; a multi-speaker voice gets numbered speakers you can rename.","locale":"en"},"11159":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-145","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#applio","content":"A voice trained on another **content-feature model** (Applio's \"embedder\": SPIN, SPIN v2, or the Chinese, Japanese or Korean HuBERT) converts with that model, as it was trained. **About** shows **Content features**; the first conversion asks to download the model (about 380 MB, from Applio's repository; also under **Assets › Content-feature models**).","locale":"en"},"11160":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-146","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#applio","content":"Voices with Applio's **RefineGAN** or **MRF HiFi-GAN** vocoders, and voices trained on a custom content-feature model, cannot be used: importing one says why, and it is skipped.","locale":"en"},"11161":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-147","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#original-rvc-installs","content":"If you still have the original RVC, you can use its voices directly without copying models. The **Original RVC installs** section at the bottom of **Voices** says: **Voices in an RVC install are used in place; Import all copies them into the library.**","locale":"en"},"11162":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-148","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#original-rvc-installs","content":"Click **Add an RVC install**.","locale":"en"},"11163":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-149","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#original-rvc-installs","content":"Enter the original's root directory in **RVC folder** (it should contain an `assets` folder), or click **Browse…** to select it.","locale":"en"},"11164":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-150","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#original-rvc-installs","content":"Click **Add**.","locale":"en"},"11165":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-151","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#original-rvc-installs","content":"rvc-next reads voices in `assets/weights` and recommends an index for each from `assets/indices` and `logs`, following the original's rules. These voices are marked **legacy**. Files stay in place; rvc-next never writes to the original's folders (indexes attached to legacy voices are copied to `models/attached-indexes/`).","locale":"en"},"11166":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-152","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#original-rvc-installs","content":"Each added install has two buttons:","locale":"en"},"11167":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-153","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#original-rvc-installs","content":"**Scan**: rereads models after additions or deletions in the original and recommends indexes for new voices (voices whose indexes you selected manually are unaffected);","locale":"en"},"11168":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-154","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#original-rvc-installs","content":"**Import all**: copies all voices and their indexes from this install into the library, where they can be edited like ordinary voices.","locale":"en"},"11169":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-155","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#original-rvc-installs","content":"See Migrate from the original RVC for more details.","locale":"en"},"11170":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-156","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#base-models","content":"The **Base models** tab says: **Training starts from a base model. Download the official ones below, or import your own G (and D); their rate, version and pitch guidance are read from the weights.**","locale":"en"},"11171":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-157","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#base-models","content":"**Import base models**: drop G and D `.pth` files, or a `.zip`. G and D are paired automatically by name; G alone can also be imported (shown as **no D**).","locale":"en"},"11172":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-158","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#base-models","content":"**Your base models**: imported models show version · sample rate · pitch guidance · **G + D** or **no D** · size. You can **Rename** or Delete them (moving them to the trash).","locale":"en"},"11173":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-159","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#base-models","content":"**Community base models**: 21 base models trained by RVC users (KLM, Snowie, Titan, Ov2Super, Rigel and others; the list Applio keeps), all v2 with pitch guidance. Each row shows its licence as its repository states it (many state none: check before you share what you train) and the repository it comes from; **Download** fetches it from there (about 1.3 GB, G and D). Once downloaded, it can be chosen as an experiment's base model.","locale":"en"},"11174":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-160","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#base-models","content":"**Official**: official base models for v1/v2 × 32k/40k/48k × with/without pitch guidance. **Download** fetches the full set for that version and sample rate (4 files: G and D with and without pitch guidance). Deleting removes only that entry's own G and D; you can download them again later.","locale":"en"},"11175":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-161","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#base-models","content":"A training experiment's **Settings › Base model** lists only models matching its sample rate, version and pitch guidance. See Train.","locale":"en"},"11176":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-162","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#separation-models","content":"The **Separation models** tab says: **The built-in models are downloaded here or in Assets; import your own as a checkpoint with its YAML config. Each becomes a preset in Separate.**","locale":"en"},"11177":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-163","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#separation-models","content":"**Import separation models**: drop a checkpoint (`.ckpt`, `.pth`, `.safetensors`) with its `.yaml`, or a `.zip`. Before importing, rvc-next actually loads the model once to check it works (this may take a few seconds).","locale":"en"},"11178":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-164","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#separation-models","content":"**Your separation models**: shows model type, primary/secondary stem names and size; models can be deleted. Each imported model becomes a preset marked **imported** on **Separate**.","locale":"en"},"11179":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-165","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#separation-models","content":"**Built-in**: built-in separation models, each marked **presets: …** to show which separation presets use it. You can download or delete them.","locale":"en"},"11180":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-166","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#separation-models","content":"With no imported models, the page shows **No separation models imported**. Built-in presets are always available on **Separate**.","locale":"en"},"11181":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-167","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#assets","content":"**Assets** lists every file rvc-next can download, grouped by purpose:","locale":"en"},"11182":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-168","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#assets","content":"Group","locale":"en"},"11183":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-169","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#assets","content":"Files","locale":"en"},"11184":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-170","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#assets","content":"Approximate size","locale":"en"},"11185":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-171","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#assets","content":"**Conversion**","locale":"en"},"11186":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-172","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#assets","content":"HuBERT (required for all conversion, Live and training), RMVPE, RMVPE (ONNX, for DirectML devices), FCPE, CREPE, CREPE tiny","locale":"en"},"11187":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-173","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#assets","content":"180 MB, 173 MB, 345 MB, 41 MB, 85 MB, 2 MB","locale":"en"},"11188":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-174","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#assets","content":"**Training**","locale":"en"},"11189":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-175","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#assets","content":"Official base models v1/v2 × 32k/40k/48k","locale":"en"},"11190":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-176","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#assets","content":"About 350–420 MB per group","locale":"en"},"11191":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-177","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#assets","content":"**Separation**","locale":"en"},"11192":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-178","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#assets","content":"Vocals, Vocals (aggressive), Dereverb, Dereverb (aggressive), Lead vocals","locale":"en"},"11193":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-179","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#assets","content":"About 305–436 MB each","locale":"en"},"11194":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-180","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#assets","content":"File names and descriptions come from the server in English, for example `HuBERT`, `Base models v2 40k`, `Separation: Vocals`.","locale":"en"},"11195":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-181","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#assets","content":"Each row shows name, description, size (checked files are marked **verified**) and state: **Installed**, **Not installed**, **Partly downloaded**, **Checksum mismatch**, **Downloading**. Available actions:","locale":"en"},"11196":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-182","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#assets","content":"**Download**: starts a download. While downloading, a progress bar and “downloaded / total size · speed · time remaining” appear.","locale":"en"},"11197":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-183","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#assets","content":"**Download everything for Conversion** (also **Download everything for Training**, **Download everything for Separation**): buttons beside group headings download all missing files in that group at once.","locale":"en"},"11198":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-184","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#assets","content":"**Verify**: recalculates SHA-256 checksums for installed files.","locale":"en"},"11199":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-185","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#assets","content":"Delete: removes files; you can download them again later. Files cannot be deleted during a download.","locale":"en"},"11200":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-186","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#assets","content":"Downloads resume after interruption (unfinished files end in `.part`), retry automatically on failure and verify checksums on completion. You do not need to download everything in advance: whenever a page needs a file, the relevant button is replaced by **Needs …** and **Download (size)**.","locale":"en"},"11201":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-187","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#assets","content":"Configure downloads in **Settings › Downloads**: switch **Model repository** between rvc-model and the official RVC repository, or change **Download endpoint** to hf-mirror.com or a custom mirror. See “Downloads” in Settings.","locale":"en"},"11202":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-188","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#demo-voices","content":"At the bottom of **Assets** is **Demo voices**: **The official RVC example voices, downloaded from the model repository with their indexes.** Each row shows sample rate · version · **with index** · size.","locale":"en"},"11203":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-189","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#demo-voices","content":"Click **Download** for one voice, or **Download all**. It then says **Download started; the voice appears in the library when it is ready.**","locale":"en"},"11204":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-190","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#demo-voices","content":"Downloaded voices show an **In library** button; click it to open their detail page.","locale":"en"},"11205":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-191","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#demo-voices","content":"Demo voices are stored only in rvc-model, so they always download from rvc-model regardless of the selected **Model repository**.","locale":"en"},"11206":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-192","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#merge-two-voices","content":"Combine two voices into a new one using weights:","locale":"en"},"11207":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-193","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#merge-two-voices","content":"Select **First voice** and **Second voice**. Their sample rate, version and pitch guidance must match.","locale":"en"},"11208":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-194","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#merge-two-voices","content":"Adjust **Weight of the first voice** (0–1, default 0.5): result = weight × first + (1 − weight) × second.","locale":"en"},"11209":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-195","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#merge-two-voices","content":"Enter a **New voice name** and click **Merge**.","locale":"en"},"11210":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-196","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#merge-two-voices","content":"Merging runs as a background job. The new voice appears in the library when finished.","locale":"en"},"11211":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-197","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#extract-a-voice-from-a-checkpoint","content":"Training checkpoints (`G_*.pth`) cannot be used directly for conversion; extract a small model first:","locale":"en"},"11212":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-models-198","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-models#extract-a-voice-from-a-checkpoint","content":"In **Checkpoint (G\\_\\*.pth path or \\