":"/en/docs/guide-train#new-experiment","content":"**Browse…** is available only when you open the page on the server machine or the server has an access token set. Otherwise, paste the server path directly into the field.","locale":"en"},"11802":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-26","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#import-an-original-rvc-experiment","content":"If you have already trained in the original RVC (experiments are under its `logs/<name>`), you can import the experiment and keep using it:","locale":"en"},"11803":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-27","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#import-an-original-rvc-experiment","content":"Click **Import experiment**.","locale":"en"},"11804":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-28","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#import-an-original-rvc-experiment","content":"Enter the path in **Original experiment folder (logs/\\<name>)**. Optionally enter a new **Experiment name** (defaults to the folder name).","locale":"en"},"11805":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-29","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#import-an-original-rvc-experiment","content":"Click **Import**.","locale":"en"},"11806":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-30","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#import-an-original-rvc-experiment","content":"rvc-next **copies** the entire folder into the experiment directory (leaving the original untouched) and infers the sample rate, version, pitch guidance and completed stages from its contents. The folder must contain `0_gt_wavs` or `config.json`; otherwise, it reports that this does not look like an RVC experiment. Imported experiments do not record the original dataset folder. To slice again, enter it in the **Dataset** step first.","locale":"en"},"11807":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-31","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#experiment-page","content":"The top of the experiment page shows its name, sample rate · version · folder path, with a **Delete** button on the right (unavailable while running; deleted experiments are moved to `trash/` in the data folder).","locale":"en"},"11808":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-32","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#experiment-page","content":"Below are four steps: **Dataset**, **Settings**, **Run**, **Results**. While running, an overall progress bar appears below the step bar, and **Run** indicates the current stage.","locale":"en"},"11809":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-33","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#step-1-dataset","content":"Select **One speaker**.","locale":"en"},"11810":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-34","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#step-1-dataset","content":"Enter a path in **Dataset folder**, or click **Browse…** to select one.","locale":"en"},"11811":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-35","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#step-1-dataset","content":"Click **Save**.","locale":"en"},"11812":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-36","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#step-1-dataset","content":"Only audio files at the folder's **top level** are read; subfolders are not scanned.","locale":"en"},"11813":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-37","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#step-1-dataset","content":"A dataset with several speakers is described by a **Speakers** table, with one speaker per row:","locale":"en"},"11814":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-38","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#step-1-dataset","content":"Column","locale":"en"},"11815":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-39","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#step-1-dataset","content":"Description","locale":"en"},"11816":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-40","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#step-1-dataset","content":"**Name**","locale":"en"},"11817":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-41","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#step-1-dataset","content":"Speaker name; must be unique","locale":"en"},"11818":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-42","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#step-1-dataset","content":"**ID**","locale":"en"},"11819":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-43","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#step-1-dataset","content":"0–109; must be unique (duplicates show **Duplicate ID N**)","locale":"en"},"11820":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-44","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#step-1-dataset","content":"**Folder**","locale":"en"},"11821":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-45","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#step-1-dataset","content":"This speaker's audio folder; click to select","locale":"en"},"11822":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-46","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#step-1-dataset","content":"**Repeat**","locale":"en"},"11823":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-47","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#step-1-dataset","content":"1–100; how many times this speaker's data is repeated during training, to balance speakers with different amounts of data","locale":"en"},"11824":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-48","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#step-1-dataset","content":"Click **Add speaker** to add a row; delete a row to remove it.","locale":"en"},"11825":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-49","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#step-1-dataset","content":"If your data already follows the original's `Name_ID_Repeat` subfolder convention (for example, `alice_0_1`, `bob_1_2`), click **Fill from Name_ID_Repeat folders** and select their parent folder to fill the table automatically. Each subfolder must follow this format, have an ID from 0–109 and a repeat count of at least 1, map each ID to only one name, and contain audio.","locale":"en"},"11826":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-50","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#step-1-dataset","content":"Click **Save** when finished. Exported voices include these speaker names.","locale":"en"},"11827":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-51","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#step-1-dataset","content":"**Add audio from this computer**: drop audio files, or a zip of them, on the drop zone (or click it) to upload them into the experiment's own `dataset_upload/` folder; the dataset then points there, so a server you reach from another machine needs no folder of its own. With **Several speakers**, upload a zip whose top-level folders follow `Name_ID_Repeat` (as above): they become the speaker table. Uploads add to what is there; **Remove the uploaded audio** empties the folder. Zip members outside audio files, hidden files and `__MACOSX` are skipped.","locale":"en"},"11828":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-52","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#step-1-dataset","content":"**Clean the dataset first**: select a separation preset to run vocal separation on the whole dataset before slicing (for example, to remove accompaniment or reverb). Results are stored in the experiment's `dataset_clean/`; original files are unchanged. The default is **No clean-up**. Presets are the same as on **Separate**, and the required separation models must be downloaded first.","locale":"en"},"11829":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-53","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#step-1-dataset","content":"**Slicing** (opens on click) decides how the recordings are cut into training pieces. The defaults are the original's; the options come from Applio:","locale":"en"},"11830":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-54","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#step-1-dataset","content":"Setting","locale":"en"},"11831":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-55","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#step-1-dataset","content":"Options (default)","locale":"en"},"11832":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-56","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#step-1-dataset","content":"Description","locale":"en"},"11833":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-57","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#step-1-dataset","content":"**Cut**","locale":"en"},"11834":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-58","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#step-1-dataset","content":"At silences, then into pieces (default) / Into pieces, straight through / As they are (already cut)","locale":"en"},"11835":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-59","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#step-1-dataset","content":"The original finds the silences first and cuts the sound between them into pieces. Straight through keeps silences in the pieces. As they are suits a dataset you cut yourself; a file longer than the piece length + 5 s is still cut, since training would leave it out","locale":"en"},"11836":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-60","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#step-1-dataset","content":"**Piece length (s)**","locale":"en"},"11837":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-61","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#step-1-dataset","content":"0.5–10; blank: 3.7 s with a GPU, 3.0 s without","locale":"en"},"11838":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-62","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#step-1-dataset","content":"Length of each piece","locale":"en"},"11839":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-63","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#step-1-dataset","content":"**Overlap between pieces**","locale":"en"},"11840":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-64","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#step-1-dataset","content":"0–0.4 s (0.3)","locale":"en"},"11841":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-65","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#step-1-dataset","content":"How much consecutive pieces share","locale":"en"},"11842":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-66","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#step-1-dataset","content":"**Loudness**","locale":"en"},"11843":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-67","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#step-1-dataset","content":"Even out each piece (default) / Even out each file / Leave as recorded","locale":"en"},"11844":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-68","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#step-1-dataset","content":"The original brings every piece to the same peak; per file keeps the differences inside a recording; as recorded keeps the levels","locale":"en"},"11845":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-69","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#step-1-dataset","content":"**Noise reduction**","locale":"en"},"11846":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-70","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","u