-do","content":"Live voice conversion","locale":"en"},"12048":{"id":"/en/docs-15","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#what-it-can-do","content":"Convert your voice live through the server computer's sound card; switch parameters and voices while running.","locale":"en"},"12049":{"id":"/en/docs-16","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#what-it-can-do","content":"Live voice conversion","locale":"en"},"12050":{"id":"/en/docs-17","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#what-it-can-do","content":"Vocal separation","locale":"en"},"12051":{"id":"/en/docs-18","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#what-it-can-do","content":"Separate vocals and accompaniment, remove reverb, separate backing vocals and use presets with multiple steps.","locale":"en"},"12052":{"id":"/en/docs-19","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#what-it-can-do","content":"Vocal separation","locale":"en"},"12053":{"id":"/en/docs-20","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#what-it-can-do","content":"Training","locale":"en"},"12054":{"id":"/en/docs-21","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#what-it-can-do","content":"Go from a dataset to a voice model: slicing, pitch, features, training and an index. After changes, rerun only the steps that need it.","locale":"en"},"12055":{"id":"/en/docs-22","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#what-it-can-do","content":"Training","locale":"en"},"12056":{"id":"/en/docs-23","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#what-it-can-do","content":"Model management","locale":"en"},"12057":{"id":"/en/docs-24","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs#what-it-can-do","content":"Import and organize voices and indexes; download demo voices, base models, separation models and required assets.","locale":"en"},"12058":{"id":"/en/docs-25","page_id":"/en/docs","tags":[],"type"