":"/en/docs/quick-start#what-rvc-next-can-do","content":"Use built-in RoFormer models to separate vocals and accompaniment, remove reverb and extract lead vocals","locale":"en"},"12140":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-19","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#what-rvc-next-can-do","content":"Training","locale":"en"},"12141":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-20","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#what-rvc-next-can-do","content":"**Train**","locale":"en"},"12142":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-21","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#what-rvc-next-can-do","content":"Train a voice on your own dataset: scan the dataset, run stages, view loss curves, try checkpoints and export as a voice","locale":"en"},"12143":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-22","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#what-rvc-next-can-do","content":"Model management","locale":"en"},"12144":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-23","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#what-rvc-next-can-do","content":"**Models**","locale":"en"},"12145":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-24","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#what-rvc-next-can-do","content":"A voice library, indexes, base models, separation models, required asset downloads and tools for merging voices and extracting voices from checkpoints","locale":"en"},"12146":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-25","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#what-rvc-next-can-do","content":"A few designs shared throughout the application:","locale":"en"},"12147":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-26","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#what-rvc-next-can-do","content":"**One voice picker and one set of voice parameters**: Convert, Live and voice 