n/docs/quick-start-32","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#who-it-is-for","content":"**Users training their own voices**: the **Train** page organizes the original's steps into stages that can be rerun individually.","locale":"en"},"12154":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-33","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#who-it-is-for","content":"**Existing users of the original RVC**: voices and assets can be read directly from an original installation; see Migrating from the original RVC.","locale":"en"},"12155":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-34","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#who-it-is-for","content":"**Users who prefer the command line or need batch processing**: every interface operation has a corresponding `rvc-next` command; see Command line.","locale":"en"},"12156":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-35","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#documentation-structure","content":"Section","locale":"en"},"12157":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-36","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#documentation-structure","content":"Contents","locale":"en"},"12158":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-37","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#documentation-structure","content":"**Quick start** (this section)","locale":"en"},"12159":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-38","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#documentation-structure","content":"Installation, first run and first conversion","locale":"en"},"12160":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-39","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#documentation-structure","content":"User guide","locale":"en"},"12161":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-40","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url