c_collect` (`torch.mps.empty_cache()` on MPS). Synchronising first ensures no kernel is still using the blocks being returned. Does nothing if torch is not loaded."],[3061,"`soft_empty_cache()`：先 `gc.collect()`，然后在 CUDA 上 `synchronize` → `empty_cache` → `ipc_collect`（MPS 上 `torch.mps.empty_cache()`）。先同步，保证没有内核仍在使用要归还的块。torch 未加载时什么也不做。"],[3179,"`sola_buffer_frame`"],[9264,"`sola_buffer_frame`"],[3181,"`sola_search_frame`"],[9266,"`sola_search_frame`"],[9679,"`sounddevice` opens audio devices; live voice conversion and device enumeration tests need it"],[3594,"`sounddevice` 打开音频设备；实时变声和设备枚举测试需要它"],[3680,"`sounddevice>=0.5.1,<0.6`"],[9765,"`sounddevice>=0.5.1,<0.6`"],[9337,"`SounddeviceBackend` uses PortAudio (`latency=\"low\"`, WASAPI through `WasapiSettings`: exclusive when chosen, otherwise shared with `auto_convert`, so Windows converts channel count and rate where PortAudio alone converts only mono ↔ stereo); `enable_asio` sets `SD_ENABLE_ASIO=1` to select the ASIO-enabled PortAudio bundled on Windows since sounddevice 0.5.1. `fake.py:FakeBackend` simulates devices: one thread per stream calls callbacks at the device's own clock (`1 + ppm·1e-6` times the nominal rate), `lose(index)` simulates unplugging a USB device, `refuse` makes opening fail, and output is recorded for assertions. Tests and worker requests with `backend: \"fake\"` use it (`backend_from_request`). `tone.py:chime()` is the chime played by the “Test” button."],[3252,"`SounddeviceBackend` 用 PortAudio（`latency=\"low\"`，WASAPI 经 `WasapiSettings`：选了独占就独占，否则共享模式加 `auto_convert`，由 Windows 转换声道数和采样率——PortAudio 自己只做单声道 ↔ 立体声的转换）；`enable_asio` 设置 `SD_ENABLE_ASIO=1`，选用 sounddevice 0.5.1 起在 Windows 上附带的 ASIO 版 PortAudio。`fake.py:FakeBackend` 模拟设备：每个流一个线程按设备自己的时钟（`1 + ppm·1e-6` 倍标称速率）调用回调，`lose(index)` 模拟拔出 USB 设备，`refuse` 让打开失败，输出被录下来供断言。测试和 worker 请求里的 `backend: \"fake\"` 都走它（`backend_from_request`）。`tone.py:chime()` 是“测试”按钮播放的提示音。"],[1414,"`source` 为 `custom` 时使用的地址"],[8013,"`SPAStaticFiles` sends `Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable` for files under `assets/` (Vite filenames contain content hashes and can be cached permanently); other files (mainly `index.html`) get `no-cache`, so browsers fetch the new entry point after upgrades."],[1928,"`SPAStaticFiles` 对 `assets/` 下的文件发 `Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable`（Vite 产物文件名含内容哈希，可以永久缓存），其余文件（主要是 `index.html`）发 `no-cache`，保证升级后浏览器拿到新的入口。"],[1443,"`speaker_id`"],[7528,"`speaker_id`"],[4043,"`src/` 内的模块只经 `@/` 别名互相导入，没有相对路径"],[10120,"`src/i18n/index.ts` is a small implementation: nested message objects, `t(key, params)` (`{name}` placeholders), fallback to English, then to the key; `tOr(key, fallback)` handles keys built from server values (error codes, stage IDs), showing a readable fallback when no message exists. Languages are `en` and `zh-CN`; with `auto`, `detectLocale()` chooses by browser language (any `zh`/`zh-*` maps to `zh-CN`) and responds to `languagechange`."],[4035,"`src/i18n/index.ts` 是一个很小的实现：嵌套的消息对象、`t(key, params)`（`{name}` 占位）、缺失时回落英文、再回落键名；`tOr(key, fallback)` 用于由服务器值拼出的键（错误码、阶段 id），没有对应消息时显示可读的回退。语言有 `en` 与 `zh-CN` 两种，偏好为 `auto` 时由 `detectLocale()` 按浏览器语言决定（任何 `zh`/`zh-*` 都映射到 `zh-CN`），并响应 `languagechange`。"],[10119,"`src/layout.test.ts` checks these rules by reading styles from source files (with explicit file and selector lists). Add new name-bearing rows or section pages to the corresponding list."],[4046,"`src/theme/` 之外的样式与模板中没有十六进制颜色"],[10018,"`src/ui/` is the only place that imports `@material/web` and `@lucide/vue` (with additional test patches in `test/setup.ts`); views and feature components import only from `@/ui` (`ui/index.ts`). This layer isolates risk: `@material/web` no longer adds components, so if one fails in a browser, it can be replaced in `ui/` without changing application code. Icons are re-exported through `ui/icons.ts` and rendered with `<AppIcon :icon=\"icons.X\" />`."],[3933,"`src/ui/` 是唯一导入 `@material/web` 与 `@lucide/vue` 的地方（另有 `test/setup.ts` 为测试打补丁），视图和业务组件只从 `@/ui` 导入（`ui/index.ts`）。这一层的意义在于隔离风险：`@material/web` 已不再新增组件，若它在某个浏览器上出问题，可以在 `ui/` 里逐个替换，而应用代码不变。图标经 `ui/icons.ts` 重新导出，用 `<AppIcon :icon=\"icons.X\" />` 渲染。"],[8124,"`start_background` controls whether background threads start:"],[2039,"`start_background` 决定后台线程是否启动："],[6098,"`start()` runs the server on a background thread and returns the web UI's address; `run()` serves in the foreground until `Ctrl+C`. The object is also a context manager:"],[8931,"`start()` saves devices, stream parameters, `last_voice`, `last_params` to settings (the `live` group), so **Start** without arguments restores the last session; `rvc-next live run` reads the same values. Devices belong to the server machine, so they live in settings rather than browser client state."],[7932,"`start()` subscribes to the event bus. `LocalEventBus` calls handlers synchronously on the publisher thread, usually a job thread or a thread reading worker output, so the handler only does one thing: `loop.call_soon_threadsafe(queue.put_nowait, event)`, handing the event to the event loop. A background task `_pump()` then calls `emit` for each event; serialization failures for individual events are only logged."],[13,"`start()` 在后台线程里运行服务端，返回网页界面的地址；`run()` 则在前台运行，直到 `Ctrl+C`。对象也可以当作上下文管理器使用："],[2846,"`start()` 把设备、流参数、`last_voice`、`last_params` 写回设置（`live` 组），所以不带参数的 **Start** 恢复上一次会话，`rvc-next live run` 读的也是同样的值。设备属于服务器所在的机器，因此放在设置里而不是浏览器的客户端状态里。"],[1847,"`start()` 订阅事件总线。`LocalEventBus` 在发布者线程上同步调用处理函数，而发布者多半是任务线程或 worker 输出的读取线程，所以处理函数只做一件事：`loop.call_soon_threadsafe(queue.put_nowait, event)`，把事件交给事件循环。一个后台任务 `_pump()` 再逐个 `emit`，单个事件序列化失败只记日志。"],[3260,"`Start(config)`"],[9345,"`Start(config)`"],[8898,"`start`, `update_voice`, `update_stream`, `set_voice`, `set_devices` perform “read state → send message → write state” under `_control`, because switching a voice and resetting its speaker are two consecutive messages that must not interleave with another request."],[2813,"`start`、`update_voice`、`update_stream`、`set_voice`、`set_devices` 都在 `_control` 锁里执行「读状态 → 发消息 → 写回状态」，因为切换音色及其引起的说话人重置是两条紧挨着的消息，不能与另一个请求交错。"],[1894,"`state: LiveState`"],[7979,"`state: LiveState`"],[3282,"`State`"],[9367,"`State`"],[9368,"`state`, `error` (`{code, message, detail}`), `topology`, `sample_rate`, `meter`, `passthrough`, `cached` (models loaded in the worker runtime, for “Free GPU memory”), `voice_path`"],[3283,"`state`、`error`（`{code, message, detail}`）、`topology`、`sample_rate`、`meter`、`passthrough`、`cached`（worker 运行时里加载的模型，用于“释放显存”）、`voice_path`"],[1898,"`stats: LiveStats`"],[7983,"`stats: LiveStats`"],[3284,"`Stats`"],[9369,"`Stats`"],[6099,"`stop()` may be called more than once; it closes the server, the live voice changing process and the database, and frees the port. `import rvc_next` loads neither torch nor FastAPI; the server is loaded only when `RvcNextServer` is used."],[14,"`stop()` 可以重复调用，会关闭服务端、实时变声的子进程和数据库，并释放端口。`import rvc_next` 不会加载 torch 或 FastAPI，只有用到 `RvcNextServer` 时才加载服务端。"],[3262,"`Stop` / `Shutdown`"],[9347,"`Stop` / `Shutdown`"],[10148,"`stores/jobs.test.ts`, `stores/preferences.test.ts`, `audio/player.test.ts`, `api/baseUrl.test.ts`, `devProxy.test.ts`"],[4063,"`stores/jobs.test.ts`、`stores/preferences.test.ts`、`audio/player.test.ts`、`api/baseUrl.test.ts`、`devProxy.test.ts`"],[2991,"`stream/`"],[9076,"`stream/`"],[3171,"`stream/engine.py` 的 `StreamEngine` 是“一块进、一块出、没有 I/O”的实时转换器。数学来自原版 `infer/rtrvc.py`（`RVC.infer`）和 `realtime_gui.py` 的 `start_vc`、`audio_callback`；原版这套 DSP 链在 GUI 回调、`rtrvc` 和 VST worker 里有三份拷贝，这里合为一个类。`process()` 是同步的、只接受普通数组，所以它可以由 PortAudio 会话驱动、由测试拿 WAV 驱动，也可以在将来由 VST 适配器或浏览器传输驱动。"],[9299,"`stream/latency.py:estimate_latency_ms()` extends the original's display formula (output latency + block + crossfade + 10 ms, plus the input denoising term `min(crossfade, 40 ms)`): it also adds one block prefilled in the output ring buffer, one block of target ring-buffer fill for split streams, and input device latency. Measured inference time is reported separately in statistics (`infer_ms_p50/p95`)."],[3214,"`stream/latency.py:estimate_latency_ms()` 是原版显示公式（输出延迟 + 块 + 交叉淡化 + 10 ms，加上输入降噪项 `min(crossfade, 40 ms)`）的扩展：再加上输出环形缓冲预填充的一块、分离流时环形缓冲的目标填充一块，以及输入设备延迟。实测的推理耗时另外在统计里报告（`infer_ms_p50/p95`）。"],[9256,"`StreamEngine` in `stream/engine.py` is a live converter with “one block in, one block out, no I/O”. Its maths comes from the original's `infer/rtrvc.py` (`RVC.infer`) and `start_vc`, `audio_callback` in `realtime_gui.py`; the original has three copies of this DSP chain in the GUI callback, `rtrvc` and VST worker, now combined in one class. `process()` is synchronous and accepts only plain arrays, so it can be driven by a PortAudio session, tests using WAV files, or a future VST adapter or browser transport."],[9077,"`StreamParams`, `StreamEngine`, latency estimation"],[2992,"`StreamParams`、`StreamEngine`、延迟估算"],[3988,"`StreamParamsPanel`"],[10073,"`StreamParamsPanel`"],[37,"`strict_port`"],[6122,"`strict_port`"],[9210,"`summarize()` describes a small model or G checkpoint without constructing a network; `inspect_checkpoint()` identifies any `.pth` by content for import sessions, never raising for a readable file:"],[3125,"`summarize()` 不建网络就能描述一个小模型或 G 检查点；`inspect_checkpoint()` 则按内容识别任意 `.pth`，供导入会话使用，读得出来的文件从不抛异常："],[3100,"`swift`"],[9185,"`swift`"],[9186,"`SwiftProvider` → `f0/swift_model.py` (SwiftF0 0.3.0), Applio's subharmonic repair, 16 ms frames interpolated in log frequency to 10 ms, voiced at confidence ≥ 0.5"],[3101,"`SwiftProvider` → `f0/swift_model.py`（SwiftF0 0.3.0），Applio 的次谐波修复，16 ms 帧按对数频率插值到 10 ms，置信度 ≥ 0.5 为浊音"],[8424,"`Synthesizer_inputs.pth`, `hubert_inputs.pth` (sample inputs for ONNX export), `logs/mute/*.spec.pt` (spectrogram caches generated by the training loader)"],[2339,"`Synthesizer_inputs.pth`、`hubert_inputs.pth`（导出 ONNX 用的样例输入）、`logs/mute/*.spec.pt`（训练加载器生成的频谱缓存）"],[3116,"`SynthesizerTrnMs256NSFsid_nono`"],[9201,"`SynthesizerTrnMs256NSFsid_nono`"],[3115,"`Synthesize