me). `mutate(fn)` makes arbitrary edits to the file-layer dictionary and saves (used for legacy directory additions/removals). `set_value()` serves `config set`, allowing only existing keys (dictionary groups may add keys)."],[2853,"`update(patch)` 深合并进**文件层**（字典合并，其他值替换，`None` 清除可选值），先校验文件层、再校验生效值，原子写入（`.toml.tmp` → `replace`），TOML 没有 null 所以保存前去掉 `None`，最后同步调用监听器（`ComputeService` 借此重建运行时）。`mutate(fn)` 在文件层字典上做任意修改后保存（旧版目录的增删用它）。`set_value()` 供 `config set` 使用，只允许已有的键（字典型分组内可新增键）。"],[3200,"`update(VoiceParams)`"],[9285,"`update(VoiceParams)`"],[3266,"`UpdateStream(stream)`"],[9351,"`UpdateStream(stream)`"],[3264,"`UpdateVoice(params)`"],[9349,"`UpdateVoice(params)`"],[2741,"`upload`"],[8826,"`upload`"],[1906,"`usage: ComputeUsage`"],[7991,"`usage: ComputeUsage`"],[10025,"`useSnackbar`: a global queue, showing one message at a time."],[3940,"`useSnackbar`：全局队列，一次显示一条。"],[9686,"`uv pip install build` (outside the `dev` group; needed only for packaging)"],[3601,"`uv pip install build`（不在 `dev` 组里，只有打包时需要）"],[8504,"`uvicorn.Server(...).run(sockets=[sock])` serves on the socket just bound; on exit, delete `server.json` and close services."],[2419,"`uvicorn.Server(...).run(sockets=[sock])` 在刚才绑定的套接字上服务；退出时删除 `server.json` 并关闭服务。"],[6956,"`v1` or `v2`"],[7072,"`v1` or `v2`"],[871,"`v1` 或 `v2`"],[987,"`v1` 或 `v2`"],[1486,"`v1`/`v2`"],[7571,"`v1`/`v2`"],[1487,"`v2`"],[7572,"`v2`"],[8838,"`validate()` (before submission): speaker in range, assets present, separation preset available, `remix` requires `separate`."],[2753,"`validate()`（提交前）：说话人在范围内、资源齐全、分离预设可用、`remix` 必须配 `separate`。"],[2112,"`ValidationError`"],[8197,"`ValidationError`"],[707,"`VALUE`"],[6792,"`VALUE`"],[8382,"`verified` is `True` (all verified), `False` (a failure), or `None` (some files not yet verified). `is_installed()` also counts `corrupt` as installed—the user may have replaced files with another version, so the UI warns rather than blocks use."],[2297,"`verified` 为 `True`（全部校验通过）、`False`（有失败）或 `None`（