 note may also appear below a device explaining how the saved device was found again, such as **\\{name} was found under another driver.** (a different driver, but the same device), or **\\{name} was not found: using the system default.**"],[10579,"A PipeWire / PulseAudio virtual microphone"],[11435,"A preset is a saved set of voice parameters (excluding speaker). Each preset either **belongs to one voice** or is shared by **all voices**."],[8831,"A previous output itself, or the input used to produce it"],[11102,"A progress bar appears during upload."],[10459,"A progress bar while running; download jobs also show downloaded/total size, speed and time remaining."],[8036,"A request's path"],[10386,"A reverb or delay rings out past the end of the voice: the result is longer by its audible tail."],[11987,"A selected G checkpoint is first extracted into a small model;"],[6477,"A self-signed certificate works after the browser's warning is accepted (`openssl req -x509 -newkey rsa:2048 -nodes -keyout key.pem -out cert.pem -days 365 -subj /CN=my-pc`). A reverse proxy that terminates HTTPS works too; it must forward the WebSocket at `/api/v1/live/browser-audio` as well as those under `/ws/`."],[9157,"A separate CUDA Graph namespace for each of the four combinations (version × mask present/absent)."],[8770,"A session is `uploads/imports/<sid>/`, containing `session.json` and `files/<file id>/<original filename>`; creating a session also removes old sessions idle for 24 hours (`SESSION_TTL`)."],[10045,"A side sheet slides in from an edge"],[11973,"A single stage: click **Run this stage** on its card. Completed stages show **Run again**, which forces another run."],[9848,"A small-model `.pth` (fp16 weights, `enc_q` removed), written with `write_small_model`"],[7330,"A state (`queued`, `waiting`, `running`, `cancelling`, `cancelled`, `failed`, `completed`, `interrupted`), or `active`, `finished`"],[9857,"A torchfcpe-format FCPE checkpoint (`config_dict`, `model`, output weights