ault. Useful for sending output to a virtual audio device while listening through headphones. Selecting a monitor device reveals its **Monitor level** meter, a **Test** button and the following controls:"],[7203,"An original experiment folder (`logs/<name>`; required)"],[6358,"An original experiment folder, `logs/<name>`, can be copied in for continued use:"],[6195,"An out-of-memory failure is not retried automatically; the server unloads all unused models. You can:"],[6980,"An unassigned index (see `rvc-next model list --type index`; required)"],[8926,"An unspecified device follows the system default and counts as `exact`."],[11148,"Another index fits the same voice better"],[10879,"Another program is using the device"],[6492,"Answers to questions about missing assets, slow CPU conversion, missing devices or crackling in live voice conversion, ports in use, other drives not appearing, where results are saved, and more."],[9523,"Any path"],[9525,"Any path accepted by the OS"],[6385,"Any path accepted by the system"],[7996,"Any settings change (API, CLI, direct edits to `settings.toml`)"],[6462,"Anyone who can open the Web UI (with a token set, anyone holding it) can change all settings (including browsing scope and folder locations) and delete voices and experiments. Let only people you trust reach the server."],[6134,"Anyone with the public address can reach the server and use every feature; pass `access_token` if you want one, or add authentication on the host application's or the proxy's side. Requests arriving through these names are not treated as local, even though the tunnel connects from the same computer, so they cannot use **Show in folder**."],[9220,"Anything else, with an explanation"],[7797,"API and events"],[10192,"API and events"],[9967,"API client"],[7836,"API JSON has the same shape as CLI `--json` (`tests/cli/test_cli.py::test_model_json_matches_api_shape`)"],[1712,"API 与事件"],[4107,"API 与事件"],[3643,"API 侧执行 `python -m rvc_next webui --no-open --por