ctml` 附加项的 RVC Next："],[6262,"DirectML, MPS, and CPU always use fp32 (except vocal separation on DirectML; see below). fp16 is faster and uses less GPU memory; if a card produces abnormal output in fp16, switch to `fp32`."],[177,"DirectML、MPS 和 CPU 上始终是 fp32（DirectML 上的人声分离例外，见下）。fp16 更快、显存占用更少；如果某块卡在 fp16 下输出异常，改为 `fp32`。"],[157,"DirectML（Windows 上的 AMD、Intel 等显卡）。不可用时退回 CPU"],[8335,"Directory"],[9898,"Directory"],[9939,"Directory structure"],[9205,"Discriminators are `MultiPeriodDiscriminator` (v1) and `MultiPeriodDiscriminatorV2` (v2)."],[8529,"Disk layout and database cache"],[12081,"Disk space"],[7913,"DNS rebinding: a malicious page resolves its own domain to 127.0.0.1 and calls the local API"],[1828,"DNS 重绑定：恶意网页把自己的域名解析到 127.0.0.1 后调用本机 API"],[6921,"Do not ask for confirmation"],[9783,"Do not name a method `list` on a class with `list[...]` annotations (ty resolves `list` to that method): use names such as `list_assets`, `list_jobs`, `list_voices`."],[10658,"Do the same for the other devices in the chain:"],[9740,"Documentation pages. Chinese uses `<page>.mdx`, English uses the matching `<page>.en.mdx`; `meta.json` / `meta.en.json` define sidebar order and groups (`---group---` is a separator heading)"],[12035,"Documentation sections"],[3846,"Documentation site"],[9931,"Documentation site"],[9720,"Documentation site's `bun install`, local preview and build (in `site/`; see below)"],[9722,"Documentation site's `bun run test` (vitest) plus `bun run check` (tsc)"],[12124,"Documentation structure"],[8483,"Domain errors (`core/errors.py`) each carry an `exit_code`; see Architecture for the full mapping. The CLI converts them to exit codes in two places:"],[10706,"Don't make **RVC-Next-Microphone** the system's default input: rvc-next's **pipewire**, **pulse** and **System default** inputs record the default input, so rvc-next would record its own output. For a program without a microphone setting, start it, then move its stream to **RVC-Next-Microphone** in `pavu