e 1024-frame `cache_pitch`/`cache_pitchf`. Live pm differs from offline: both ends are zero-padded using a 65 Hz lower bound, then trimmed to the block's frame count (`_pm`), matching the original's live implementation."],[3192,"F0 只在缓冲尾部计算：长度 `block_frame_16k + 800`，RMVPE 时向上取整到 5120 的倍数再减 160（RMVPE 的帧对齐）。结果去掉首尾几帧后滚入 1024 帧的 `cache_pitch`/`cache_pitchf`。实时的 pm 与离线不同：两端按 65 Hz 下限补零、截到块的帧数（`_pm`），这是原版的实时写法。"],[3166,"F0 按 `pitch − formant` 移调（与实时相同）；"],[2935,"F0 提取"],[8438,"Factory and custom classes"],[9884,"Factory: `build_services(environ={...})` in `tmp_path / \"data\"`, using tiny assets and CPU; accepts `start_background=True` and extra environment variables; closes all services after the test"],[10243,"Fail instead of trying the next port when it is occupied (by default, it tries the next port and reports the port actually used)"],[6583,"Fail instead of trying the next port when the port is in use"],[6425,"Fail when the port is in use"],[7406,"Fail when the port is in use instead of trying subsequent ports"],[8368,"Failed assets are marked `failed`; the job ends with `RvcNextError`, with failed IDs listed in `detail.assets`."],[8523,"Failures"],[8162,"Failures become `error` events: `MissingAssetError` → `asset_missing` (`detail.assets`), `ModelFormatError` → `invalid_model`, out of GPU memory → `compute_unavailable` with `detail.reason = \"out_of_memory\"`, everything else → `internal_error`; the full stack trace is sent separately as an `error` log. Core reconstructs the corresponding domain error with `worker_error()` in `core/engine_errors.py`."],[8780,"faiss (`.index`)"],[9863,"faiss `IVF4,Flat` index; `add=False` gives a trained but empty index"],[3778,"faiss `IVF4,Flat` 索引；`add=False` 得到训练过但为空的索引"],[9618,"faiss index"],[3533,"faiss 索引"],[2695,"faiss（`.index`）"],[6141,"FAQ"],[7796,"FAQ"],[9645,"FastAPI + Vue 3, pydantic v2"],[3560,"FastAPI + Vue 3，pydantic v2"],[7852,"FastAPI request validation errors remain 422 + a `detail` array; the frontend's `toError