y used voices remain cached, so the second file starts immediately"],[9489,"HuBERT, RMVPE, and FCPE weight initialization (later overwritten by checkpoints) consumes the global RNG, while the original builds RMVPE/FCPE inside `Pipeline`. If one side seeds before building models and the other does the reverse, subsequent random sequences (such as the NSF noise source) diverge, and results cease to be bit-identical. Golden code therefore calls `runtime.hubert()` and `runtime.f0(method)` first; the original side also builds RMVPE/FCPE in advance and assigns them to `pipeline.model_rmvpe`/`model_fcpe`, then calls `torch.manual_seed()`. Keep this order in new golden cases."],[7446,"HuBERT, RMVPE, base models, and separation model weights; can point to an original RVC `assets` folder"],[6796,"HuBERT, RMVPE, base models, and separation model weights."],[8211,"HuBERT, RMVPE, FCPE or base model not installed; `detail.assets` lists asset ids used by the UI to offer downloads"],[2060,"HuBERT、F0 模型和最近用过的音色留在缓存里，第二个文件立刻开始"],[3404,"HuBERT、RMVPE 和 FCPE 的权重初始化（随后被检查点覆盖）会从全局随机数生成器取数，而原版在 `Pipeline` 内部才构建 RMVPE/FCPE。如果一边先播种再建模型、另一边相反，两边后续的随机序列就错开了（例如 NSF 的噪声源），结果不再逐位相同。所以 golden 代码先 `runtime.hubert()`、`runtime.f0(method)`，原版一侧也预先构建 RMVPE/FCPE 塞进 `pipeline.model_rmvpe`/`model_fcpe`，然后才 `torch.manual_seed()`。新增 golden 用例时保持这个顺序。"],[2126,"HuBERT、RMVPE、FCPE 或底模未安装；`detail.assets` 列出资源 id，界面据此提供下载"],[1361,"HuBERT、RMVPE、底模、分离模型权重；可以指向原版 RVC 的 `assets` 文件夹"],[5588,"HuBERT、RMVPE、底模、分离模型等下载的文件"],[711,"HuBERT、RMVPE、底模和分离模型权重。"],[1683,"HuBERT、音高模型（RMVPE、FCPE、CREPE）或底模没有安装，会同时提示 `rvc-next assets download <id>`"],[2254,"HuBERT（transformers 格式）"],[5101,"HuBERT（所有转换、实时和训练都需要）、RMVPE、RMVPE（ONNX，DirectML 设备使用）、FCPE、CREPE、CREPE tiny"],[8320,"Hugging Face repository"],[11687,"Hugging Face repository to download model files from"],[2235,"Hugging Face 仓库"],[2186,"Hugging Face 仓库。`selected` 由设置计算，不写在目录里"],[9410,"Hyperparameters are in `CONFIGS` in `train/hparams.py` (the original's `configs/v1|v2/*.json`);