rdLoopback` over SoundCard (≥ 0.4.3, which returns silence instead of blocking while nothing plays), WASAPI loopback on Windows and monitor sources on PulseAudio/PipeWire. macOS has no provider (Core Audio's process taps are outside PortAudio); `loopback_provider()` says so, and the message reaches `DeviceList.errors`."],[12110,"PortAudio is not needed if you only convert files, separate audio and train models."],[3253,"PortAudio 无法录制渲染端点：输出设备没有输入声道，按输入打开会报 `Invalid number of channels [PaErrorCode -9998]`。PortAudio 的 WASAPI 宿主 API 在 2022 年才加入环回设备（每个输出再以 `<输出名> [Loopback]` 的名字列为输入，用 `AUDCLNT_STREAMFLAGS_LOOPBACK` 打开），晚于 sounddevice 附带的 19.7.0 DLL；它的 ALSA 宿主 API 也无法指定 PulseAudio 监视器。因此由一个环回提供者负责录制：`SoundcardLoopback` 基于 SoundCard（≥ 0.4.3，没有声音播放时返回静音而不是阻塞），Windows 上用 WASAPI 环回，PulseAudio/PipeWire 上用监视器源。macOS 没有提供者（Core Audio 的进程 tap 不在 PortAudio 之内），`loopback_provider()` 会说明这一点，消息进入 `DeviceList.errors`。"],[3593,"PortAudio（Linux 上的 `libportaudio2`）"],[5998,"PortAudio（仅 Linux，仅实时变声）"],[10218,"Ported step by step to `engine/audio/sinc_resample.py` and `engine/f0/fcpe_model.py`; tests verify bit-identical results when the original libraries are installed. RVC Next therefore no longer depends on torchaudio (whose final release is 2.11) or torchfcpe"],[9438,"Porting rules"],[10201,"Porting rules, golden tests, behaviour differences from the original and their reasons, torchaudio / torchfcpe ports"],[9444,"Porting torchaudio and torchfcpe"],[11110,"Possible notifications after import:"],[6215,"Precision"],[6263,"Precision also determines chunk sizes for long audio (as in the original): CUDA, ROCm and XPU cards with at most 4 GiB of memory use the smallest chunks, fp16 uses larger chunks, and other cases use medium chunks."],[7466,"Precision; `auto` follows the GPU rules"],[7855,"Prefix"],[11991,"Prepare at least 10 minutes of clean recordings without accompaniment and put them in one folder."],[12065,"Prerequisites"],[11502,"Preset (as shown in the interface)"],[7043,"Preset