guments (unknown options or out-of-range values)"],[8181,"Voice, job, file or experiment does not exist"],[10603,"Voicemeeter (free, donationware, from VB-Audio) is a virtual mixer. Use it instead of VB-CABLE when the call or stream should get more than your voice, for example music or game sound mixed in, or when you want its equalizer and compressor on your voice. The steps use **Voicemeeter Banana**; notes for Standard and Potato follow."],[10648,"Voicemeeter adds its own buffering to rvc-next's latency. **Menu › System Settings / Options** sets the buffering per driver type; smaller buffers mean less delay, but crackles mean they are too small for your computer."],[10604,"Voicemeeter adds virtual playback devices (rvc-next plays into these) and virtual recording devices (the other program records from these). Since the 2024 release, which installed a new driver, the recording devices are called **Out B1/B2/B3**; older installs show the old names:"],[10571,"Voicemeeter Banana (to mix in other sound)"],[4486,"Voicemeeter Banana（需要混入其他声音时）"],[10605,"Voicemeeter strip or bus"],[4563,"Voicemeeter 会在 rvc-next 的延迟之上再加自己的缓冲。**Menu › System Settings / Options** 里可以按驱动类型设置缓冲；缓冲越小延迟越低，但出现爆音就说明对你的电脑太小了。"],[4519,"Voicemeeter 会添加虚拟播放设备（rvc-next 往里播放）和虚拟录音设备（其他程序从中录制）。2024 年的版本换了新驱动，录音设备从此叫 **Out B1/B2/B3**；旧的安装显示旧名称："],[4520,"Voicemeeter 的通道条或总线"],[4551,"Voicemeeter 窗口左侧是输入通道条（三个硬件输入，然后是两个虚拟输入 **VOICEMEETER VAIO** 和 **VOICEMEETER AUX**），右侧是输出。每个输入通道条上的 **A1 A2 A3 B1 B2** 按钮决定这路输入送往哪些总线：**A** 总线是真实的输出设备，**B** 总线是虚拟录音设备。"],[10636,"Voicemeeter's window has the input strips on the left (three hardware inputs, then the two virtual inputs **VOICEMEETER VAIO** and **VOICEMEETER AUX**) and the outputs on the right. The **A1 A2 A3 B1 B2** buttons on each input strip choose which buses that input goes to: **A** buses are your real outputs, **B** buses are the virtual recording devices."],[4518,"Voicemeeter（VB-Audio 出品，免费，捐赠软件）是一个虚拟调音台。如果通话或直播里除了你的声音还要混入别的声音（音乐、游戏声），或者想给声音加上它的均衡器和压缩器，就用